&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rejoins une superstar de la foodtech française&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez HelloFresh, nous bousculons les habitudes alimentaires des français grâce à nos Box à cuisiner !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition ?&amp;nbsp; Révolutionner le quotidien de nos abonnés, en promouvant une façon plus durable de cuisiner et en leur faisant découvrir de délicieuses recettes, créatives et équilibrées. L’alliance parfaite entre technologie et gastronomie, pour un maximum de gourmandise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh est présent dans plus de 15 pays. La France, un jeune marché lancé en 2019, connaît une ascension fulgurante : nous y sommes déjà leaders depuis 2021. Le moment parfait pour rejoindre notre équipe et avoir un impact fort dans l&#39;une des scales up françaises les plus prometteuses !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comment rendre tout cela possible ? Grâce à une équipe talentueuse et dynamique, des valeurs fortes de bienveillance et de diversité, et un environnement de travail stimulant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En 2023 nous avons ouvert un site de production en France, si tu souhaites prendre part à cette incroyable aventure humaine, internationale et entrepreneuriale, rejoins-nous !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes à la recherche d&#39;un.e Assistant(e) Qualité au sein du Service Qualité pour notre centre de distribution de Lisses. Tu seras garant de :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;la qualité des produits entrant sur le site, pour la suite des process de fabrication, ainsi que l’amélioration continue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le respect des procédures qualité sur l’ensemble du site en accord avec les exigences de notre certification BRC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pragmatique dans ton approche, tu sais :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;résoudre les difficultés et tu es exemplaire en termes de sécurité et qualité tout en assurant un environnement de travail sûr et sain, visant le “zéro accident”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insuffler un réel esprit d’équipe et motiver tes troupes sont des aspects du métiers que tu maîtrises parfaitement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh France est en forte croissance, notre site de production grossit et des opportunités de formation, de promotion, et de mouvement inter-services se présenteront régulièrement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que tu feras :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter en synergie avec l’équipe les opérations de contrôle qualité à réception (agréage fruits et légumes, conformité poids et étiquetage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer une remontée au fil de l’eau aux fournisseurs via nos outils de gestion des non conformités&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser des audits internes: GMP, Nuisible, calibrage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;S’assurer que l’ensemble des procédures en lien avec la sécurité alimentaire sur le site soient respectées et proposer des solutions pour atteindre nos objectifs internes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appliquer une démarche d’amélioration continue basée sur les concepts de Lean Manufacturing en collaboration avec l’équipe Operations Excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer des formations auprès des équipes qualité et opérationnelles sur des sujets en lien avec la sécurité alimentaire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les informations pratiques :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travail en environnement froid - EPI fournis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shift du matin : 6h-14h. Jours de repos : dimanche + second jour dans la semaine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shift de l’après-midi : 14h-22h. Jours de repos : dimanche + second jour dans la semaine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous recherchons chez un.e candidat.e :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es Titulaire d’un diplôme en Qualité appliqué aux Industries Agro Alimentaire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as au minimum 2 ans d&#39;expérience dans le secteur industriel agro-alimentaire, dans le secteur de la food, de la restauration ou tout secteur en lien avec l’alimentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es à l’aise avec les chiffres et est capable de traiter et d’interpréter des données parfois complexes sur GSheet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu ne crains pas les défis et es à l’aise dans un environnement de travail rapide et en constante évolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as des capacités développées en communication et un contact facile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as un fort attrait pour la résolution de problèmes et l’amélioration continue des processus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as déjà planifié et livré des projets&amp;nbsp; (nouveaux équipements ou logiciels, amélioration continue)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es orienté.e service et solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’anglais serait un plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous t’offrons :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une rémunération juste et attractive, avec des packs allant de 33k à 36k en fonction de ton niveau d’ expérience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement dynamique et international, avec une culture d&#39;entreprise forte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30% de réductions sur nos Box HelloFresh&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;75% de prise en charge sur la Mutuelle Alan Green (options supplémentaires possibles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% de participation au transport en commun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des paniers repas (3,75 euros par jour travaillé)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une courbe d’apprentissage rapide garantie, accompagnée par un budget développement personnel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement de travail sûr, bienveillant, et respectueux de chacun.e&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Voici le déroulé du processus de recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous examinons ton CV et ta lettre de motivation. Si c’est un match, nous t’invitons à une série d’entretiens ainsi qu’un cas pratique. Nous nous engageons à organiser rapidement les entretiens, afin de t’accueillir chez HelloFresh au plus vite !&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Associate Category Manager, Grocery who will help us build out our vendor network and continuously improve our end-to-end sourcing process. Reporting to the Senior Manager, Strategic Sourcing (Grocery), you will contribute to and execute our strategic roadmap, manage vendor relationships, support negotiations, launch new ingredients, and streamline internal procurement processes. As part of the Procurement team, you will play a key role in improving our costs, ingredient quality, supply chain reliability, and product innovation - helping us deliver the best possible value to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development and execution of our sourcing strategy for the category, driving improvements and supply chain performance in:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cost: consistently optimize our cost base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality: identify and reduce quality errors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliability: ensure supply availability and proactively mitigate risk in the supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer offering: drive product innovation and create a unique competitive advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage large internal datasets and industry benchmarks to report on team progress against objectives, identify and prioritize new opportunities, and drive continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support vendor negotiations and selection process, and lead any vendor onboarding/ offboarding as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead projects that drive innovative and sustainable packaging solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage new and existing vendor relationships, manage pricing and supplier agreements, providing feedback on performance and collaborating on key initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally within the organization to prioritize and develop new products that deliver improved value for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, engineering, supply chain, or related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of related experience in a hands-on, high-performance environment (ideal backgrounds include sourcing, supply chain, operations, or consulting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and data skills: able to dig through data independently and draw helpful insights/conclusions. Strong Excel skills are a must!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured approach and communication style: ability to clearly and persuasively communicate with a large variety of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A love for solving complex, ambiguous problems in a fast-paced environment with constant change and limited direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Strategic sourcing or buying experience, ideally across different steps of the sourcing process; comfortable managing negotiations with vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#JD1003&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$72,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$82,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As you may have read in the news …..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“HelloFresh Acquires Ready-to-Eat Meal Company Factor75, Inc.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The acquisition marks the next step in HelloFresh’s growth plan in the US to strengthen its leading position and to expand its total addressable market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Both companies will benefit from their combined resources, operational excellence and data-driven approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are extremely excited by this news as we add to the range of products available to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is Factor?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that health and wellness starts with food and what you put into your body. Our goal is to help our customers achieve their health and wellness goals. We focus on being physically fit and healthy with nutritious, purposeful eating. We want to help real people achieve real results without sacrificing time and energy trying to sort through the overwhelming amount of information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use the freshest, highest quality ingredients available, and our in-house culinary team is constantly working to optimize the nutritional value of every single meal. Meals arrive fresh and are fully prepared- simply heat in the microwave or oven and enjoy!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the fast growing environment of Factor, the newly acquired ready-to-heat brand of HelloFresh, the FSQA department is at the core of ensuring food safety and product quality. Cooking and plating of ready-to-heat meals requires excellence in food handling and environmental cleanliness. The Associate Director of the QA team oversees site level execution as well as business unit wide strategic direction. This includes monitoring and communication of KPIs, overseeing the project execution for improvement, and determining the direction of processes and procedures related to food safety and quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will ….&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for food safety and quality by coordinating cross functional departments to achieve food safety and quality objectives in collaboration with other Directors and cross functional team to maximize regulatory compliance and product reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Quality Assurance and Compliance strategy to align with local, city, state and federal requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and motivate a team of Sr. Quality Assurance Manager and QA managers and supervisors across multiple facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assure the adherence of sites to HACCP plans and ensure compliance with all company FSQA requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct the development and implementation of corporate Food Safety and Quality Assurance plans&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion continuous improvement within the teams, driving FSQA KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the primary contact for high-impact quality issues experienced by the company and industry including co-mans and 3PL sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide the leadership team with updates on KPIs, projects and team dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to travel up to 50% as business needs require&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Leader: develop and motivate a large group of employees&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and Problem Solving Oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results Driven and Passionate About Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Proficiency: speak to employees with tact and diplomacy and manage stakeholders using strong interpersonal skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Management: tracking/monitoring production and maintaining productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Capacity: computer literacy to input information into the computer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning Orientation: able to take direction and relay information to employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At a minimum, you have…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree in Environmental, Food Science, Biology or other relevant subjects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience within the food industry&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a leadership role within a food manufacturing/processing facility (experience in high risk food manufacturing environment is an asset)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizational oversight with large site or multi-site business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and data driven mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of principles and applications of FSQA programs including HACCP, Sanitation and applicable certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up-to-date knowledge on FDA, USDA, SQF and local guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is the policy of HelloFresh/Factor not to discriminate against any employee or applicant for employment because of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, marital status, genetic information, disability, because they are a protected veteran, or any other protected classification under federal, state, or local law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Arizona Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$122,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$148,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Illinois Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$131,250&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$159,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh Group, we are on a mission to revolutionize the way people &lt;em&gt;and pets &lt;/em&gt;eat. The Pets Table is passionate about providing every dog—the long-haired, the short-legged, and the spotted alike—a seat at the table, with healthy recipes developed with vets and made from wholesome ingredients that humans trust. We’re incubated within the HelloFresh Group, which provides us the agility of a startup with the resources and support of a global organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a strategic and hands-on Associate Director, Growth Marketing to own our acquisition engine end to end. Reporting to the CMO, it’s a unique opportunity to be a key part of one of the fastest growing pet brands while getting the infrastructure and support of HelloFresh Group (a leader in human food commerce).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the bottoms-up marketing budget and plan, steer spend across a diversified channel portfolio, and be directly accountable for growth outcomes (ROI, CAC, Acquisition volume, etc.). You’ll manage a small team as well as external agencies and partners, and work cross-functionally to make sure our growth strategy is aligned with the broader business. If you’re a builder who’s equally comfortable steering a budget model and getting into the weeds of a campaign, this is the perfect role for you.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a large DTC marketing budget and steer spend allocation across channels to hit growth and efficiency targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for core growth outcomes (ROI, CAC, and conversion volume) across key acquisition channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit across and manage strategy and execution for a diversified mix of channels including paid social, search, display, affiliate, influencer, direct mail, CTV and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own relationships with external vendors, agencies, freelancers, affiliates, setting expectations and holding partners accountable for performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, test, and scale new/emerging channels and growth opportunities to diversify acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run tests across creative, discounts, and landing pages — clearly documenting results and building business cases that quantify impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Creative, Tech, Analytics, and CRM teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reporting that tracks performance against targets, surfacing key trends and strategic opportunities to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present performance, plans, and recommendations to senior leadership on a regular cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jump in hands-on where needed, whether that’s digging into a performance anomaly, onboarding a new vendor, creating Meta ads yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate: &lt;/strong&gt;you get excited by driving growth and scaling up brands (and you love pets!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Marketing Generalist: &lt;/strong&gt;you know what works and what doesn’t. You’ve scaled brands’ budgets and know how to structure ad accounts to achieve profitable growth. You’ve managed 3 or more paid marketing channels with profitable unit economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Paid Social Wizard: &lt;/strong&gt;You live and breathe Meta Ads Manager and know how to scale brands through Paid Social ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical: &lt;/strong&gt;data is your friend; you’re able to translate numbers into decisions and strategy. You naturally frame ideas and initiatives in terms of core marketing metrics, not just gut feel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-centric: &lt;/strong&gt;you understand our customer and can put yourself in their shoes. You consume media with a marketing mindset and apply inspiration to your own work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable: &lt;/strong&gt;you can context-switch quickly without losing quality or momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resourceful: you work well both in a team setting and autonomously. You don’t need to wait for clear instructions before you can take action and launch successful initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity: &lt;/strong&gt;you can build structure and process where it doesn’t exist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurially Minded:&lt;/strong&gt; you have vision, passion, and imagination; you are not afraid to challenge the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A love for dogs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in growth/performance marketing, including experience owning a marketing budget; background in D2C (subscription a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing a multi-channel acquisition mix (hands-on-keyboard paid social and search experience required; affiliate, display, podcast, influencer, direct mail a strong plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting funnel diagnostics and running CRO and landing page testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running incrementality tests and a general interest in marketing measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative intuition — you know what ads work; you can form sound hypotheses for why an ad performed or underperformed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing people and/or external agencies or partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of performance marketing metrics (ROI, CAC, CPM, CVR, LTV) and how to translate them into budget decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel/Google Sheets mastery, GA4 proficiency; Tableau proficiency and basic SQL knowledge are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are AI native and have Claude Code, Codex and/or agentic marketing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, writing, and presentation skills, with experience presenting to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An obsession with growth and building things, and a positive mindset toward challenges and new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$151,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$183,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Associate Director, Maintenance and Reliability Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Associate Director – MRE, you will oversee the maintenance and reliability of numerous buildings across your assigned business vertical.&amp;nbsp; You will take a hands-on approach to leadership, effectively engaging, motivating, and coaching team members. Partnering with the M&amp;amp;RE senior leadership team, you will define, develop and deliver the maintenance roadmap and set the standard for operational efficiency within your business vertical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee MRE-related processes including maintenance of automation and manufacturing equipment, electrical, refrigeration, PIT equipment (forklifts), building, grounds, and overall upkeep of numerous buildings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivate, engage, coach, and inspire a team of managers and technicians, creating a positive team dynamic that encourages all employees to provide feedback and drive change from within&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide project management and support as assigned for key strategic and building level projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage outside vendors and facilitate planned and unplanned repairs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that maintenance regulations are followed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify problems and brainstorm improvement strategies for the fulfillment centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-departmental engagement and collaboration on new projects and retrofits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You are…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Centric: You are passionate about delivering on commitments to your customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bold: you have vision, passion and grit; you&#39;re not afraid to take calculated risks and constantly challenge the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile: you roll with the punches and don’t get overwhelmed easily, you adapt quickly to change and know how to deliver results in a fast-paced, autonomous environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decisive: You realize when making a decision is as important as the time it takes to make that decision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem-solver: you understand there is not a one-size-fits-all approach when problem-solving; you think outside the box and enjoy enjoy deep diving issues to find a solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmatic: you’re able to identify the system component that is causing the error, as well as the options available for resolving it and completing the task efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic: you see the bigger picture, as well as each moving part which allows you to recognize and resolve situations that are ambiguous or challenging for others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You have…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years managing maintenance/operations and reliability within the&amp;nbsp;Food/Beverage/Perishables/Distribution industry or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-Site management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree preferred; high school diploma or GED required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective leader and communicator for employees, direct reports, cross-functional teams, and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of integrity and ethics with excellent follow-up and follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in engaging directly with all levels of staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-versed in recent OSHA regulations and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to read and interpret blueprints, manuals, and schematics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to refrigeration systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable in GMP/LEAN and strong continuous improvement and project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in cold environments with some areas of facility at 40F&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excitement for working in a start-up environment with a high level of ambiguity and change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work weekends, holidays and/or nights and travel approximately 50% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
