&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Canada is looking for a strategic and highly analytical &lt;strong&gt;Associate Director, Supply Chain Management&lt;/strong&gt; to act as the central nervous system for our Canadian operations performance. In this critical individual contributor role, you will be plugged directly across all Canadian Fulfillment teams to deeply understand weekly performance against our business plan and identify the key drivers of any operational gaps. Serving as the interface between the Canadian business and North American Platforms, you will influence tech and operational prioritization, onboard global best practices, and export Canadian innovations. If you are an expert systems-thinker who thrives on turning complex supply chain metrics into actionable executive strategy, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plug directly across all Canadian Operations business units (Procurement, Planning, Logistics, FSQA, and Production) to maintain a holistic, end-to-end view of the supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor weekly operational performance against budget and business plan; proactively diagnose, investigate, and articulate the root causes and key drivers of performance gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the Operations expert and Canadian Commercial business representative for Operations components of the Weekly and Monthly Business Reviews for the Canadian Senior Leadership Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary interface between the Canadian business and North American Operations Platforms to influence strategic prioritization, alignment, and resource allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplement HelloFresh Canada’s continuous improvement culture by identifying, onboarding, and implementing international best practices locally, while effectively exporting successful Canadian operational workflows to the broader Operations network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize and secure buy-in from cross-functional stakeholders to drive organizational-level adjustments without direct authority over the teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze current business strategies to identify new opportunities for supply chain growth, structural efficiency, or cost savings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in Engineering, Supply Chain Management, Business, or a highly analytical equivalent field (MBA or specialized technical master&#39;s is a bonus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on, progressive experience navigating complex, multi-site distribution networks, physical product scaling, or localized fulfillment operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record as a high-impact individual contributor with exceptional relationship and stakeholder management skills; a demonstrated ability to influence, communicate, and partner with cross-functional leaders to drive performance without direct line authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or heavily contributing to executive performance reviews (such as WBRs/MBRs) within a fast-paced corporate or operational framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of supply chain dynamics, data frameworks, and process improvement methodologies (e.g., Lean Six Sigma, workflow automation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with advanced operational modeling capabilities to dig into data and pull out clear, concise narratives for the executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in an unstructured, fast-paced, and constantly evolving high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able and willing to travel to Canadian distribution centers as required (up to 25%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#JD1003&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced procurement professional to join our Procurement team as an “Associate &amp;nbsp;Strategy Manager”. In this role, you will be responsible for developing and executing sourcing strategies to improve our cost structure, the quality of our products, the reliability of our supply chain, and will play a leading role in supporting innovation through new product development.You will have key responsibilities over SKU ideation and onboarding, vendor selection and relationships, price negotiations and contract management, budgetary planning and continuously improving our end-to-end sourcing process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also serve as a liaison for both the strategy and operations teams. You will be supporting external strategic partnerships while strengthening our operational excellence. You will be the process owner for inventory outlook, risk analyses, and waste mitigation. You will partner closely with key cross-functional teams including Procurement Operations, Menu Planning, Product Validation, and Finance.&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will help drive the strategy and framework for how the business interacts with its supplier base and have a direct stake in affecting bottom line profitability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;full ownership of assigned categories to develop and optimize our supply network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refine and implement a sourcing and supply chain strategy for a selection of categories that optimizes process, reduces risk, and improves our cost structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a strong supplier base that align with our company values; own relationships with our strategic suppliers, including performance management and innovation activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cost savings initiatives through our strategic sourcing process to ensure that we hit our targeted budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage large internal datasets and industry benchmarks (including market, supplier, and SKU analysis) to drive continuous improvement, identify opportunities for cost reduction, and identify/implement best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a culture of continuous improvement, both internally and externally through data-driven reporting and effective project management to identify and drive opportunities for quality improvement and implement best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboard new vendors and new SKUs to drive cost savings and improve customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively manage quality specifications and potential issues that might impact ingredient standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Procurement Operations Team to set &amp;nbsp;execution plans and develop best practices for tracking contract compliance by our vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively between Buying and Strategy teams to meet business goals and solve for day-to-day operational issues, reporting on supply chain progress and procedural efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with both internal and external stakeholders to monitor and manage aging inventory&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Data-driven – You can organize, explore, and synthesize unstructured data into actionable insights to better inform operational decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Intellectually curious – You have an insatiable desire to understand how and why things work, identify data-driven insights, and consistently challenge the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Detail-oriented – You possess strong organizational skills and demonstrate a methodical approach to your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A self-starter – You are highly motivated and passionate. You’re eager to take on new projects without knowing exactly what you will uncover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Agile – You thrive in fast-paced and dynamic environments and are comfortable working autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A critical thinker – You use logic to identify opportunities, evaluate alternatives, and synthesize and present critical information to solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;An excellent communicator – You can explain complex (often technical) information to a variety of audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborative - You are prepared to work collaboratively across many different HelloFresh teams and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A project manager - You have exceptional project and people management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience in procurement/sourcing/ supply chain operation, with relevant experience in Food, or CPG Industry experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Undergraduate degree in Business, Supply Chain, Finance, or other relevant area of study&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fluent in Microsoft Office and Google Suite applications (especially Google Sheets)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tableau and Project Management experience is a plus&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$79,538&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$88,375 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Als Automation Engineer (w/m/d) bist Du der Fachexperte des Standorts für alle Steuerungssysteme, Sensoren, SPS, Kommunikationsprotokolle und die Automatisierung innerhalb des Standorts Barleben bei Magdeburg. Du wirst mit dem Wartungsteam zusammenarbeiten, um Förder-, Automatisierungs- und Anlagen-Geräte zu optimieren, um die Betriebszeit zu unterstützen und die Zuverlässigkeit unserer Systeme zu verbessern.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du bist verantwortlich für die aktive Überwachung, Fehlersuche und Verbesserung unserer Systeme, um eine hohe Verfügbarkeit der Systeme für die internen Kunden des Produktionsteams sicherzustellen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du bist hauptverantwortlich für den Bereich der Automatisierungs-, Roboter- und Steuerungssysteme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du führst eine aktive Fehlersuche und -Behebung von SPS, SCADA, Kameras, Sensoren usw. für die Automatisierungssteuerung durch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du arbeitest mit dem Automatisierungsteam zusammen, um sicherzustellen, dass alles in der Produktion reibungslos läuft, und teilst das Wissen mit den anderen Teammitgliedern mit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du schulst die Techniker in den Grundlagen der Fehlersuche in Steuerungssystemen, um den Wissensstand am Standort zu erhöhen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest mit den lokalen oder regionalen Teams zusammen, um die Installation und Inbetriebnahme neuer Geräte zu unterstützen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verwendest die verschiedenen Tools zur Effizienzverfolgung, um Dokumente und Berichte für die Probleme und Verbesserungen vorzubereiten und stellst sicher, dass genaue Backup-Bibliotheken verwaltet werden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du nimmst aktiv an kontinuierlichen Verbesserungsprojekten teil, die vom regionalen oder lokalen Automatisierungsteam vorangetrieben werden, oder Du leitest diese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du erstellst Dokumentation aller Arbeiten im computergestützten Wartungsmanagement System (CMMS) sowie dem Ticketing System&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du übernimmst die Verantwortung der Ursachenanalyse bei Fehlerereignissen und führst anschließende Verbesserungskonzepte ein&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du hast ein abgeschlossenes Studium im Bereich Elektrik/Elektrotechnik oder im Maschinenbau oder vergleichbare Erfahrung im Bereich der Automatisierungstechnik Industrie&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du verfügst über mindestens 3-4 Jahre Erfahrung bei Siemens (TIA, WinCC und WinCC flexible),&amp;nbsp;Cognex-Kameras (DataMan)&amp;nbsp;und Rockwell (Studio 5000) mit Automatisierungsprojekten, Installation und Inbetriebnahme, sowie in der Umsetzung von CIP-Projekten&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du hast Erfahrung in den Bereichen Materialtransport, Flusskontrolle, SCADA und MHE-Leistungsüberwachungssysteme (wünschenswert)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du hast ein Verständnis für die industriellen Kommunikationsprotokolle EtherNet/IP, Profibus/Profinet, ASI-Bus, MODBUS/TCP&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du besitzt gute Deutschkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift und verfügst über fortgeschrittene Englischkenntnisse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du bist bereit in Schichten zu arbeiten und profitierst dadurch von weiteren attraktiven Zuwendungen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz&lt;/strong&gt; mit einem tollen Team in Barleben bei Magdeburg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte auf unsere HelloFresh Kochboxen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten&lt;/strong&gt; durch interne Trainings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein kompetitives Gehalt und ggf. Schichtzulagen &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 Tage Urlaub &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergünstigte Fitnessangebote &lt;/strong&gt;bei Urban Sports Club bzw. John Reed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen monatlichen Zuschuss zum Deutschlandticket&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Selgros Karte &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persönliche Sicherheitsausrüstung &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cafeteria am Standort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(149, 165, 166);&quot;&gt;#barnmaintenance #JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Automation Technician, you will work with the maintenance team to maintain and repair conveyance, automation and facilities equipment to support operations uptime and improve reliability of our systems. This role is the resident expert in mechanical, electrical and/or refrigeration systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shifts Available: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wednesday to Saturday - 9:00pm to 7:30am&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wednesday to Saturday - 5:00am to 3:30pm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and educate compliance with all safety, food safety, and security standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform preventive maintenance and routine inspections on assigned conveyors, automation, robotics and ancillary equipment as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform troubleshooting of assigned out of service equipment and correct issues, act as an escalation point for lower level technicians, and escalate to leadership and/or vendors as needed for additional troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document all work in the computerized maintenance management system (CMMS) and ticketing systems as appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor all maintenance personnel in developing appropriate skill sets and knowledge of equipment specializing in mechanical, electrical, and refrigeration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root cause analysis of major downtime events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a network resource for technical issues and lead network-wide root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop maintenance personnel knowledge on intermediate to advanced mechanical, electrical, and refrigeration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit maintenance personnel work and provide feedback to improve performance and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit vendor work to provide feedback to leadership on quality of work and SLA performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and/or modify PMs to standardize across the network and increase effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform building project work as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6 years of experience with conveyor, automation, robotics, and/or refrigeration repair and maintenance including mechanical and electrical operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding of machinery and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic computer skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and understand drawings, schematics and diagrams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with inputs, outputs, and PLC logic systems and ability to troubleshoot these systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel as necessary (up to 10%) for business purposes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High School diploma or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent follow through, judgment, and common sense. &quot;Make it happen&quot; attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mechatronics associates degree or equivalent preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and additional sick leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_) &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Newark, NJ Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$39.50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$39.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Automation Technician, you will work with the maintenance team to maintain and repair conveyance, automation and facilities equipment to support operations uptime and improve reliability of our systems. This role is the resident expert in mechanical, electrical and/or refrigeration systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and educate compliance with all safety, food safety, and security standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform preventive maintenance and routine inspections on assigned conveyors, automation, robotics and ancillary equipment as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform troubleshooting of assigned out of service equipment and correct issues, act as an escalation point for lower level technicians, and escalate to leadership and/or vendors as needed for additional troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document all work in the computerized maintenance management system (CMMS) and ticketing systems as appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor all maintenance personnel in developing appropriate skill sets and knowledge of equipment specializing in mechanical, electrical, and refrigeration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root cause analysis of major downtime events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a network resource for technical issues and lead network-wide root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop maintenance personnel knowledge on intermediate to advanced mechanical, electrical, and refrigeration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit maintenance personnel work and provide feedback to improve performance and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit vendor work to provide feedback to leadership on quality of work and SLA performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and/or modify PMs to standardize across the network and increase effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform building project work as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6 years of experience with conveyor, automation, robotics, and/or refrigeration repair and maintenance including mechanical and electrical operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding of machinery and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic computer skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and understand drawings, schematics and diagrams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with inputs, outputs, and PLC logic systems and ability to troubleshoot these systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel as necessary (up to 10%) for business purposes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High School diploma or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent follow through, judgment, and common sense. &quot;Make it happen&quot; attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mechatronics associates degree or equivalent preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and additional sick leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_) &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
