&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in (Inoza tower, BGC) that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As&lt;strong&gt; Team Leader&lt;/strong&gt;, you drive operational excellence and accountability by managing daily agent performance, maintaining quality standards, and acting as a strategic liaison between leadership, clients, and frontline staff—fostering a high-performance culture in collaboration with CX and Training experts. You will be&amp;nbsp;contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Coaching:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive agent development, performance, and recruitment through regular 1-on-1s, root-cause analysis, direct feedback, and dedicated onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Administrative Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee daily queue coverage, workforce management, schedule planning, payroll/timekeeping, and complex issue escalations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hands-on Core Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Spend 20% of time performing core customer service tasks to maintain a grounded understanding of front-line operations and assist during high volumes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Recommendation-Led Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide proactive, solution-oriented updates to stakeholders and CS Leads, emphasizing actionable proposals over passive status reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; QA:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with cross-functional experts to address skill gaps, refine workflows, and streamline processes using data-driven insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI &amp;amp; Platform Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage approved AI tools and CX platform capabilities to improve team reporting, efficiency, and continuous improvement while maintaining data privacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical CX &amp;amp; CRM Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep power-user proficiency in e-commerce CX platforms (e.g., Gorgias)—leveraging rules, macros, tags, and automation to optimize queue management and team efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI &amp;amp; Data Privacy Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience using approved AI tools to enhance reporting, analysis, and coaching, while rigorously ensuring data privacy compliance and accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive &amp;amp; Solution-Oriented Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; High accountability and composure under pressure, leading with actionable, recommendation-driven solutions rather than passive updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Root-Cause Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to perform root-cause analysis, track continuous improvement pipelines, and connect daily operational metrics to broader business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Team Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong cross-functional partnership skills with a track record of client-facing management and delivering objective, constructive team feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;1,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Adaptability &amp;amp; Work Ethic:&lt;/strong&gt; High emotional maturity, integrity, and enthusiasm for navigating operational shifts, continuous self-development, and campaign pivots.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
