&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple: to change the way people eat, forever. We&#39;re the world&#39;s leading meal-kit provider and a global digital-native FMCG company, reaching more than 6 million customers across 16 markets through a portfolio of brands, from HelloFresh and Factor to Green Chef, EveryPlate, Chefs Plate, YouFoodz, Good Chop, and The Pets Table. HelloTech, our global technology division, builds the digital consumer experience across Berlin, Warsaw, and North America. Experience quality and innovation are leadership priorities all the way to the group president.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Director of UX to lead the Growth experience end to end, across the brands in our portfolio, with HelloFresh and Factor the biggest. This is the team that owns how people discover our brands, sign up, get to their first great box, and keep coming back. Most funnels are something people endure. We want ours to be something they remember. Your job is to turn each step into a moment worth having, so the journey feels effortless, true to each brand, and sticky enough that people want to stay, and to grow the business while you do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report directly to the Global VP of UX and lead a team of 6 UX designers and collaborate closely with content design and research strategy. You set the quality bar for the alliance and work shoulder to shoulder with Growth product, marketing, lifecycle/CRM, and engineering across web and app, and across 16 markets. You care about the numbers and the experience, and you know the best growth work improves both at once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role, and a build-and-scale one rather than a maintenance one. You are exceptional at craft and stay close enough to the work to lead with credibility. You&#39;re also a visionary: you bring our brands to life and express them clearly across every touchpoint, and you have a strong feel for content and how words shape an experience. You&#39;re happy in ambiguity, and you&#39;d rather write the playbook than follow one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A funnel worth remembering. &lt;/strong&gt;You lead the experience across the full customer journey: acquisition and activation, conversion, retention, and reactivation of lapsed customers. You do more than reduce drop-off and smooth out onboarding. You make each step sticky and memorable, so people feel something at sign-up, come back because they want to, and tell a friend. You give lapsed customers a real reason to return.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation and evidence. &lt;/strong&gt;You run a team that tests its way to the answer. You treat behavioral data as a primary design input, not just something to validate a decision after the fact. You set clear hypotheses, design experiments and A/B tests with statistical rigor alongside data science, read the results honestly, and balance quick wins with the changes that compound over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy before screens. &lt;/strong&gt;You decide which problems are worth solving and why, and you tie design choices to the business outcomes this role is measured on, like conversion, activation rate, and retention [confirm the exact KPIs for this role]. You set direction before design work begins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft and quality. &lt;/strong&gt;You define what excellent looks like for Growth and hold the bar. You set a high standard for craft yourself and raise it in others, and you build and evolve the systems and patterns that let the team ship consistent, high-quality work at speed across web and app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand expression. &lt;/strong&gt;You bring our portfolio of brands to life, from HelloFresh and Factor to the rest, and give each a clear, distinct voice and look in the experience. You know how to hold what makes a brand itself while keeping the funnel coherent across all of them. You have a strong understanding of content and how design and words work together to express who each brand is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make us AI-native. &lt;/strong&gt;You lead a team that treats AI as an active part of how the work gets done, from insight synthesis to rapid prototyping to the path from design to code. You define the quality bar AI-assisted work has to meet, and you help rewrite how growth experiences get built in the AI era. You are a driving force in this transformation, not a passenger, and you help your team see the shift as opportunity rather than threat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A team of generalists. &lt;/strong&gt;You lead a team of UX Designers with a generalist profile that move across design, content, research and code. You attract, develop, and retain strong talent, coach through feedback and influence rather than authority, and build a place where people do the best work of their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in product design, including experience leading and growing teams in a consumer (B2C) or product-led environment with a track record of moving metrics like activation, conversion, retention, and reactivation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional craft. You are a top-tier designer who sets and holds a high bar, and you stay hands-on enough to lead with credibility and a&amp;nbsp; visionary eye for the brand. You can bring distinct brands to life and express them clearly and consistently across an experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency. You push for the right solution over the convenient one and make things happen without waiting for permission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native practice. You already use AI across the design workflow, for insight synthesis, rapid prototyping, and design to code, and you have a clear point of view on scaling it responsibly at a high quality bar. Fluency with tools like Figma and Claude is expected, and you can show your team what excellent AI-assisted work looks like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data fluency. You read behavioral data and experiment results well, know what they are and aren&#39;t telling you, and use them to sharpen design, not just defend it. You&#39;re comfortable partnering with data science on experimentation quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Command of experimentation: hypothesis design, A/B testing, and funnel analysis as a connected system rather than isolated moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A partnership mindset with Growth product, marketing, lifecycle/CRM, and engineering. You navigate constraints with engineers and shape research and synthesis with researchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People leadership experience: building teams, coaching designers, and setting a quality bar others rally around.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping cross-channel communication strategy across app, email, push, and web, so the message a customer gets is consistent and well-timed wherever they meet us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with pricing, packaging, or monetization design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record building 0-to-1 growth systems, or fixing broken acquisition and retention loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your team consistently ships high-quality growth work at speed, and the metrics move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve hired exceptional talent and helped your existing team grow in craft and judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience quality across the funnel is visibly higher, and customers feel it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product and engineering leaders love partnering with you because you unlock progress and raise the ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native ways of working in your domain make the whole team faster without giving up craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Each brand feels distinctly itself in the experience, while the funnel stays coherent across all of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale and impact. Shape experiences for millions of customers across our brands and 16 markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A craft-and-AI-first culture, championed from the top of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership of your domain, with the autonomy to set and raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined leadership track and the chance to grow your scope as the alliance scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global collaboration with experienced product, engineering, and design partners across HelloTech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy amazing discounts: 75% off weekly HelloFresh/Chefs Plate meal kits plus 50% off weekly Factor meal boxes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from health and dental coverage from day one, a Health Spending Account, unlimited Headspace access, and 25% off GoodLife fitness memberships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access wellness resources including fitness discounts and mental health support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive generous vacation and PTO offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a parental leave top-up program designed to support expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with dedicated L&amp;amp;D initiatives and career support, aligning with our &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re moving UX to work AI-native, and we expect our leaders to help drive that shift. You&#39;ll report directly to the Global VP of UX and partner closely with Product and Engineering leaders in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that sharing a meal brings people of all identities, backgrounds, and cultures together, and we&#39;re committed to celebrating every dimension of diversity in the workplace. We&#39;re an equal-opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, national origin, color, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, marital status, or any other protected characteristic. We provide reasonable accommodations to candidates at any stage of the process. If you need one, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that for this position employees are eligible to equity on top of the base pay.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$143,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$153,850 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Manufacturing Value Stream&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global Value Stream As a Director on the Global Value Stream team, you will &lt;em&gt;lead &lt;/em&gt;our Manufacturing value stream within HelloFresh&#39;s global supply chain, shaping the strategy and execution model for how we standardize, improve, and scale our operations worldwide. You will lead a team, set the department&#39;s operational agenda, and serve as a senior voice of operations across the organization. This is a high-impact leadership role that sits at the intersection of operations, technology, and global strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the strategic direction for the portfolio of Manufacturing processes, owning the multi-year capability roadmap and global template.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and build a high-performing, accountable department with clear OKRs aligned to company strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the governance framework and operating model for how the Global Value Stream team designs, validates, and deploys process and technology standards internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner at the executive level with Operations, Product, Engineering, and others to align on global priorities, technology investments, and performance benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the final decision authority on process deviation requests, capability exceptions, and cross-market design trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the organization&#39;s approach to continuous improvement, value stream analysis, and waste elimination at scale — setting the standard for how the company approaches process maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team functions as an effective internal consultancy — providing rigorous expert support to regional operations, quality teams, and technology partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12–15+ years of progressive experience in supply chain, operations, or manufacturing — including significant senior leadership experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading multi-functional teams across multiple geographies, with full accountability for operational outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise across multiple supply chain functional domains, with a breadth of experience that enables credible leadership across the full Value Stream portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen and experience managing department budgets and delivering measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with global process standardization, operational technology ecosystems (WMS/WES/WCS/automation), and large-scale transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing senior talent and building high-performance organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating as a senior stakeholder in cross-functional governance and product/technology lifecycle processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 25%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bold, strategic leader with the operational depth to earn the trust of both warehouse teams and the C-suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity at the department level while maintaining clarity and pace for your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A talent multiplier — known for developing strong leaders and creating organizations that outlast any individual.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A rigorous, data-driven decision maker who moves fast without sacrificing quality or thoroughness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about building world-class operations at scale — energized by the complexity and impact of a global mandate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An outstanding communicator and influencer who can drive alignment across diverse cultures, functions, and levels of seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additionally With This Role, You will have....&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to shape global operations at a leading food technology company with significant reach and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-ownership, low-bureaucracy environment where your work is visible and your decisions matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements to support your work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous development through HelloFresh Academies and access to internal mobility across 18 countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An egoless, collaborative culture focused on learning, growth, and building something exceptional together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
