&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;When submitting supporting documents such as a resume, curriculum vitae (CV), or educational transcripts, you may voluntarily redact or omit any information that would identify your age. This includes:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of birth&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of attendance at educational institutions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of graduation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your decision to redact this information will not adversely affect the consideration of your application. We evaluate all candidates based on their skills, qualifications, and experience. Please be aware that should you receive a conditional offer of employment, we may be required to request this information for legally permissible purposes, such as verifying eligibility for employment or for benefits administration and background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Colorado Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$148,050&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$179,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Texas Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$143,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$174,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Newark, NJ Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$164,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$199,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Arizona Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$143,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$174,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Illinois Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$148,050&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$179,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_ &lt;/strong&gt;a brand of HelloFresh is seeking a dedicated Dispatch Specialist&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to join our growing team! As the Dispatcher you are directly responsible for overseeing and assisting in the daily delivery of our freight hauling. You will manage, mentor, and develop a team of drivers who ultimately ensure that our facilities receive quality and on-time shipments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing all our drivers from load-out beginning the start of the shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning routes with our system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to calls from drivers on their routes who need support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with various members of the distribution center team members, facilitating pickups and deliveries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff the routes and assign routes to drivers daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage driver gas cards, driver tools, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule maintenance services, roadside service calls, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasionally load/unload product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekend work is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any other tasks as assigned by management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience in dispatching / driving role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of optimization techniques and process flow improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a nimble, fast-growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer skills, particularly G-Suite, Slack&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energetic and excited about Imperfect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multitask&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excels at independent, unsupervised work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Demands:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to walk, bend, squat, climb, reach, and kneel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift/push/pull up to 50 pounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in material handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sedentary work; involves sitting most of the time&lt;/li&gt;
