&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Warsaw&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a new R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Poland and are looking for people who want to make a real impact from day one. You’ll be part of a globally connected team, helping to shape the culture and ways of working at our new location. This is a hands-on role in a supportive environment, where collaboration, learning, and adaptability are key.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value practical problem-solving, diverse perspectives, and people who take ownership. If you&#39;re ready to contribute to meaningful projects and help lay the foundation for a growing team, we’d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager for the &lt;strong&gt;Customer Orders&lt;/strong&gt; squad at HelloFresh, you will lead the engineering vision and execution for the experience of &lt;strong&gt;actually getting a HelloFresh box&lt;/strong&gt;. Your squad owns how a customer&#39;s order comes into being and is tracked: &lt;strong&gt;subscription orders created at cutoff&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;one-time purchases placed on demand&lt;/strong&gt;, plus &lt;strong&gt;order tracking&lt;/strong&gt;. This is the order-processing backbone that turns a customer&#39;s intent into a placed, accurate, trackable order across our global brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;backend-first&lt;/strong&gt; role at its core. Order processing is where correctness, resilience, and scale matter most: every order must be accurate, idempotent, and traceable, and the platform must hold up at HelloFresh scale — around &lt;strong&gt;7 million active customers across 18 countries&lt;/strong&gt;, with close to &lt;strong&gt;1 billion meals delivered a year&lt;/strong&gt;. At the same time, you and your team will &lt;strong&gt;work in a cross-functional squad&lt;/strong&gt; with product, frontend, and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a leader who brings deep backend engineering judgement and is energised by collaborating across disciplines to make &lt;strong&gt;HelloFresh better&lt;/strong&gt;. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don&#39;t “tick all the boxes” but think you&#39;d thrive in this role, we&#39;d really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh we are moving away from a model where software developers just execute tickets toward one where product engineers are trusted to own customer problems. A Product Engineer takes a problem, forms a point of view, validates it with customers and data, and ships it using AI as a force multiplier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, inspire and grow a cross-functional team of 7 engineers, ensuring smooth delivery and continuous improvement of the Customer Orders systems and tech real estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture and reliability of &lt;strong&gt;order creation and tracking&lt;/strong&gt; — subscription orders placed at cutoff and one-time purchases on demand — with a strong focus on correctness, idempotency, data integrity, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive design decisions for &lt;strong&gt;scalable, event-driven services&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Kafka) that place and track high volumes of orders with the highest quality and resilience standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as an engineering leader within a &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional squad&lt;/strong&gt;, partner closely with product and data to deliver end-to-end customer outcomes and make joint decisions across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion observability, on-call health, and incident readiness so order creation and tracking stay accurate and available around the clock.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to hiring and capacity planning, conduct regular code reviews, and mentor engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a continuous improvement culture and promote the HelloFresh DNA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate what you build. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led a team in an agile environment (5+ engineers), ideally within a cross-functional squad setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 6+ years of hands-on &lt;strong&gt;backend development experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience building &lt;strong&gt;scalable microservices and event-driven systems&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Kafka), especially where correctness, idempotency, and data consistency are critical — such as order processing, payments, or other transactional domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and operating high-throughput backend systems that other teams and customer-facing surfaces depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DevOps practices and cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, Azure, Google Cloud), including observability and production ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and comfort working cross-functionally with product, frontend, and data partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an empathetic, strong communicator and active listener.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a self-organized individual who can operate autonomously, solve complex problems, and remove roadblocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a humble leader who can motivate a team and drive them to their highest potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take full ownership. You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product sense and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: experience with &lt;strong&gt;React Native&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health - &lt;/strong&gt;You’re covered from your first day with&amp;nbsp; private health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working - &lt;/strong&gt;We work in-office 3 days a week to align on goals, with flexible hours to support work-life balance and personal needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off - &lt;/strong&gt;You receive 26 days of paid vacation each year, providing you time to rest and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development - &lt;/strong&gt;An annual Learning &amp;amp; Development budget and a Mentoring Program to support your ongoing professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Referral Program - &lt;/strong&gt;Our team members can take part in our internal employee referral program and receive a bonus for recommending successful candidates to open roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Comforts - &lt;/strong&gt;Free coffee, drinks, and fresh fruit are available to keep you refreshed throughout the day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Engineering&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager for the Deliveries squad at HelloFresh, you will lead the engineering vision and execution for how customers control their box week to week. Your squad owns the systems that keep a subscription flexing with the customer&#39;s life: skip, pause and resume, reschedule, delivery cadence, delivery day, and address changes — the controls a customer uses before an order locks in at cutoff — along with the home and delivery feed that surfaces them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Delivery planning is where correctness, resilience, and scale matter most: every change a customer makes must be applied accurately and in time before cutoff, and the platform must hold up at HelloFresh scale — around 7 million active customers across 18 countries, with close to 1 billion meals delivered a year. You and your team will work in a cross-functional squad with product, frontend, and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a leader who brings deep backend engineering judgement and is energised by collaborating across disciplines to make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don&#39;t “tick all the boxes” but think you&#39;d thrive in this role, we&#39;d really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, inspire and grow a cross-functional team of engineers (backend and frontend), ensuring smooth delivery and continuous improvement of the Deliveries systems and tech real estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture and reliability of the delivery-control experience — skip, pause and resume, reschedule, cadence, delivery day, and address — with a strong focus on correctness, applying changes in time before cutoff, data integrity, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive design decisions for scalable, event-driven services (e.g., Kafka) that apply high volumes of delivery changes reliably, with the highest quality and resilience standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as an engineering leader within a cross-functional squad: partner closely with product, frontend, and data to deliver end-to-end customer outcomes and make joint decisions across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion observability, on-call health, and incident readiness so delivery changes stay accurate and available around the clock.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to hiring and capacity planning, conduct regular code reviews, and mentor engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a continuous improvement culture and promote the HelloFresh DNA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led a team in an agile environment (5+ engineers), ideally within a cross-functional squad setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 6+ years of hands-on backend development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience building scalable microservices and event-driven systems (e.g., Kafka), especially where correctness, idempotency, and data consistency are critical — such as scheduling, subscription management, or other transactional domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and operating high-throughput backend systems that other teams and customer-facing surfaces depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DevOps practices and cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, Azure, Google Cloud), including observability and production ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and comfort working cross-functionally with product, frontend, and data partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an empathetic, strong communicator and active listener.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a self-organized individual who can operate autonomously, solve complex problems, and remove roadblocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a humble leader who can motivate a team and drive them to their highest potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: experience with React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
