&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a French foodtech superstar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we’re shaking up the way people eat with our meal kits!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;France is a young market, launched in 2019, and has been growing at lightning speed: we’ve been the market leader since 2021.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we make it happen? Thanks to a team full of talent and energy, driven by a shared ambition to win the food market, all within a company culture and DNA that truly stand out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re eager to be part of an exciting, international, and entrepreneurial human adventure, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about building food safety standards and driving product quality? We are looking for someone with strong technical experience to drive food safety and quality compliance, supporting the French market while contributing to food safety excellence across other HelloFresh markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Assurance team is recruiting an experienced and highly driven FSQA Manager, based in France (FR), to support our growing local ingredient sourcing strategy while contributing to our international FSQA agenda.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role has a clear FR focus, with approximately 50% of time dedicated to supporting the FR local ingredient sourcing team. In this capacity, you will act as the FSQA business partner for FR-sourced ingredients. The remaining 50% of the role will focus on driving food safety and quality compliance across our international Grocery and Convenience supplier base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with the FR sourcing, procurement, supply chain, and distribution centre teams, while also collaborating with FSQA colleagues and stakeholders across Europe. The role combines hands-on supplier engagement with strategic FSQA projects, ensuring robust food safety standards and consistent product quality for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FR local ingredient sourcing (≈50%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the &lt;strong&gt;FSQA partner embedded within the FR local ingredient sourcing team&lt;/strong&gt;, providing hands-on food safety and quality input to sourcing and commercial decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead supplier approval, audits, onboarding, and ongoing performance management for FR-based and locally sourced suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive risk assessments, specifications, and shelf-life validations for locally sourced ingredients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and mitigate food safety and quality risks in close collaboration with sourcing, suppliers, and operational teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide pragmatic FSQA guidance that enables speed to market without compromising food safety or quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International FSQA scope (≈50%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver the same FSQA activities across &lt;strong&gt;international suppliers&lt;/strong&gt;, including audits, approvals, onboarding, and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives and complaint reduction across the supply base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and embed standardised FSQA ways of working across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and manage quality incidents through root cause analysis and corrective actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and track key FSQA performance indicators related to compliance and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a quality and/or food safety management role within the food industry, ideally with strong exposure to the FR supply base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience auditing food manufacturers, supported by relevant food safety and quality qualifications (e.g. HACCP, internal auditor certification)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of EU food safety legislation, supplier approval processes, and risk-based food safety management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with the ability to partner effectively with sourcing and commercial teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident and pragmatic decision-maker who remains calm under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy and adaptability to thrive in a fast-paced, operational environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel within France and internationally, spending approximately 50% of time at suppliers, distribution centres, and the home office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally across international markets and proficiency with Google Suite / MS Office tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic and international environment, with a strong corporate culture and DNA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delicious discounts on HelloFresh meal kits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve guaranteed!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A supportive, passionate, proactive, and dynamic French team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central Paris offices (1st arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee benefits (Alan Blue healthcare, transport discount, Gymlib, training budget)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you as soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about building food safety standards and systems across multiple countries, and driving food safety culture to the next level?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an International Food Safety and Quality Assurance Manager (all genders), you will join a lean, fast-paced cross-functional team responsible for managing our International Safety Quality and Operational Compliance based in one of our European offices, supporting Factor_ operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of your responsibilities as International Food Safety and Quality Assurance Manager you’ll collaboratively work to mitigate risk, drive standards and operational excellence, while ensuring the consumer gets safe and high quality ingredients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is a 12-months maternity cover for now.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work closely with international Procurement teams to support the implementation of the Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality strategy for products supplied to Factor_ manufacturing facilities, ensuring compliance with HelloFresh Group standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;By leading strategic and innovative projects, you’ll help ensure a consistent supply of safe, high-quality products to Factor_ manufacturing facilities while developing templates, procedures and processes to support the standardized implementation of central policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll drive continuous improvement initiatives by coordinating the sharing of relevant information and best practices across HelloFresh Group regions and translating these insights into actionable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building strong relationships with relevant internal and external stakeholders will be key, working closely with Procurement, Factor_ teams, suppliers and other functions to ensure effective collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll proactively identify and assess key risks within your categories, establish appropriate mitigation methodologies, and manage supplier and product onboarding in line with HelloFresh Group requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Through regular analysis of customer complaint trends related to product quality and packaging, you’ll identify improvement opportunities, conduct root cause analyses across the supply chain through to Factor_ manufacturing facilities, and implement corrective actions. You’ll also support Factor_ teams with serious customer complaint investigations and recalls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll conduct Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality audits at supplier production sites against HelloFresh Group standards, while role-modelling our HelloFresh Group values and the International Safety, Quality &amp;amp; Operational Compliance vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More than 2 years of relevant experience in a similar role within Food Manufacturing, Assembly, Distribution, Retail or a comparable food-related environment; international experience is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of relevant government food regulations across the UK and wider Europe, alongside in-depth knowledge of food safety systems, HACCP and COSHH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level 3/4 Food Safety qualification or equivalent relevant qualification; experience with internal and external audits is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively with a wide range of internal and external partners and understand and meet their expectations and needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational and time management skills, with the ability to work autonomously, manage multiple priorities and adapt confidently to change and new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and experience in data manipulation, supported by intermediate to advanced Google Suite skills, including G-Sheets/Excel, G-Docs/Word and G-Slides/PowerPoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, enthusiasm, commitment and a flexible, can-do attitude, combined with excellent English skills and the ability to thrive in a dynamic and changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a FSQA Specialist, you will take on a key responsibility in ensuring that a company&#39;s food products meet established standards of safety and quality. You will complete tasks related to food inspection, testing, and regulatory compliance, and play a crucial role in protecting consumers and maintaining the company&#39;s reputation. Your role needs a good understanding of food safety regulations and quality standards, good organizational skills, and good problem-solving abilities. You should also have good communication skills, as you often need to coordinate with various stakeholders, from production staff to suppliers to regulatory authorities, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Product Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct supplier and product onboarding to ensure compliance with company food safety and quality requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain quality specifications and collaborate with suppliers to implement best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze customer complaint trends and work with suppliers to drive corrective action and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory &amp;amp; Labeling Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Regulatory team to verify ingredient lists, allergen statements, and nutritional information for weekly menus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure supplier information is accurate and up to date within company systems.&lt;br&gt;Verify ingredient information uploaded to websites, ensuring consistency and accuracy for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal teams, including procurement, culinary development, and distribution, to ensure food safety and quality objectives are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with suppliers, regulatory authorities, and internal stakeholders to address compliance and quality concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Food Science, Nutrition, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of food safety systems, HACCP principles, and quality assurance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in food labeling legislation, preferably with Canadian regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of analytical skills with experience in data analysis and trend identification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in MS Office (Excel, PowerPoint, Word).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, prioritize workload, and adapt to shifting business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in supplier management and product quality assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
