&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Auckland and reporting to the ANZ CEO, the &lt;strong&gt;General Manager for New Zealand&lt;/strong&gt; leads the overall performance, growth and strategic direction of HelloFresh New Zealand; one of the HelloFresh’s most established and innovative markets. Owning the New Zealand P&amp;amp;L end-to-end, you set the strategy to maximize sustainable growth and profitability, sharpen the local proposition, and represent HelloFresh with government, regulators, partners and the wider community. You deliver through influence, aligning matrixed teams across growth, product, marketing, finance, customer care and operations behind a shared plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, you will change the way Kiwis eat, forever!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the P&amp;amp;L:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full accountability for HelloFresh New Zealand’s commercial and financial performance, leading annual planning, forecasting and business reviews with ANZ and Global leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and execute the roadmap that returns the market to sustainable growth and profitability across customer acquisition, retention, pricing and margin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sharpen the proposition:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Global teams to pilot new products and propositions, and strengthen the local relevance of HelloFresh for Kiwi customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Align and energise matrixed teams across growth, product, marketing, finance, customer care and operations to reach shared business objectives without direct line authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent the business: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the senior spokesperson for HelloFresh New Zealand with government, regulators, industry bodies and strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Group strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Feed insight, innovation and learnings from New Zealand back into regional and Global decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;P&amp;amp;L leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of owning a P&amp;amp;L or a major commercial function, ideally blending top-tier consulting, high-growth startup or comparable fast-paced experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and product instinct: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong grounding in D2C marketing and product development, with the judgement to turn strategy into measurable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence without authority: &lt;/strong&gt;The ability to set clear direction and bring senior, matrixed stakeholders along through collaboration rather than formal reporting lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A highly analytical approach, comfortable using data to prioritise and to hold the business to its plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local market understanding:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with the New Zealand market and consumer, or a real ability to build local relevance and credibility quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive and food enthusiasm:&lt;/strong&gt; Entrepreneurial energy, resilience and a genuine enthusiasm for good food and the HelloFresh mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation with upside: A highly attractive package with significant equity upside for a senior leader in a leading global food-technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a market: The rare chance to lead an entire market and shape its direction end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working: Three days in the Auckland office and two days working from home each week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from anywhere: Up to three weeks working from a location of your choice in any 12-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing support: Free Headspace access (extendable to five friends or family) and a confidential Employee Assistance Program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and growth: HelloFresh Academy sessions, a function-led L&amp;amp;D budget and a structured mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time to recharge: Additional HF Days that grow with tenure, plus sabbatical leave for longer-serving team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HelloFresh discount: 70% off your HelloFresh boxes, plus friends-and-family discounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? &lt;/strong&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Director, People Technology to lead the People Technology function at HelloFresh. This role is accountable for the strategy, operating model, delivery, stability and performance of our global People Technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the end-to-end technology environment that enables the People function and supports critical operational execution across the business, with Workday as the core platform. This includes functional development, operations, integrations, programme delivery, AI enablement, and business-critical workforce technology such as Time Tracking, Absence and time clocking devices across our distribution centres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role has a clear AI mandate. You will define how People Technology uses AI to improve its own productivity, service quality, delivery speed and decision-making, while also partnering with People leaders to identify, govern and deploy AI-enabled solutions for our People function customers. This includes moving beyond experimentation into responsible, scalable and measurable adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with People, Technology and Operations leaders to translate business needs into a clear, executable technology roadmap. The role requires strong judgement, clear prioritisation and the ability to balance transformation, platform health, operational reliability, business continuity and user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the People Technology strategy and roadmap, aligned to People, Technology and Operations priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of the People Technology operating model across Operations, Functional Development, Integrations and Programme Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Workday and related People Technology platforms are stable, scalable, secure and fit for purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technology performance of business-critical workforce processes, including Time Tracking, Absence and time clocking across distribution centres.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Operations stakeholders to ensure workforce technology supports reliable execution in frontline and operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the People Technology AI strategy, including internal productivity, automation, service improvement and delivery effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People leaders to identify, prioritise and deliver responsible AI-enabled solutions for People function customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish appropriate governance for AI use across People Technology, including risk, data protection, adoption, measurement and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set priorities for major initiatives, balancing delivery ambition, operational risk, capacity and long-term platform health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior escalation point for complex delivery, operational, vendor or system-risk issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology leadership on architecture, security, integrations, data and platform sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent People Technology in senior leadership forums and cross-functional decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in People Technology, HR systems or enterprise SaaS leadership roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Workday-centric technology landscapes, including implementation, optimisation and operational support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading multi-disciplinary technology teams across operations, delivery, integrations and specialist domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting technology used in frontline, operational or distribution-centre environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience identifying and deploying AI or automation opportunities in an enterprise function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of responsible AI adoption, including governance, data, risk, change management and measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgement in balancing transformation, system stability, governance, operational risk and business continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in global, complex organisations with senior cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate People, Technology and Operations priorities into clear, executable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable making and owning difficult prioritisation and trade-off decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy massive discounts: 85% off HelloFresh/Every Plate, 60% off Green Chef, 50% off Factor, 40% off Good Chop, and 50% off The Pets Table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the Employee Referral Program ($3,000 for salaried, $500 for hourly).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive comprehensive coverage including Medical, Dental, Vision, HSA, and FSA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from flexible hybrid work arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accrue up to 160 hours (20 days) of annual PTO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 8 company holidays and 2 additional personal holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with an annual $400 training stipend (after 6 months) and a Tuition Reimbursement Program of up to $5,250/year (after 2 years).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,250&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$235,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

