&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Growth Development Manager&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;Youfoodz&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a pivotal role in shaping our future growth. Reporting directly to the Director of Product and Growth at our &lt;strong&gt;Chippendale office in Sydney&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the identification, testing, and scaling of our next major business horizons.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the autonomy to innovate our established D2C subscription channel while pioneering entirely new avenues in the B2B and B2B2C spaces. We are looking for an entrepreneurial strategist with strong commercial acumen who thrives on data-driven decision-making. From day one, you will move with agility, balancing strategic vision with the execution needed to expand our brand footprint and make a highly visible, lasting impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steer and scale the Youfoodz Government Subsidy business on shopify&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and scope new channels, commercial models or ways of working where Youfoodz can “win” and expand its Total Addressable Market (TAM); and model the unit the economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market penetration and size for different customer segments (B2B and B2C); educate senior leaders on both opportunities and risks over a short and medium-term horizon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the go-to-market strategy for new channel, feature or partnership launches from end-to-end; ensure delivery on metrics and keep stakeholders informed of progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with 3rd party vendors, auditors and key industry stakeholders and coordinate across functional teams to operationalise &amp;amp; execute on business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional partners across Growth Marketing, Product Marketing, Finance, Operations, Legal, Food Safety, Product &amp;amp; Technology teams to ensure smooth execution for each initiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse quantitative data, gather consumer research, build models, and aggregate insights to drive key business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively manage resources needed to deliver profitable growth while scaling new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for new revenue outside of the core, direct-to-consumer business model by launching and scaling new channels to increase target addressable market (TAM) and grow incremental revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the P&amp;amp;L and drive financial performance by proactively identifying revenue growth levers, optimising marketing spend allocation, and rigorously uncovering cost-saving opportunities to ensure long-term profitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular reports and updates to the Youfoodz and Hellofresh ANZ Leadership team on progress toward business plan goals and OKRs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate strategic narratives that connect short-term operational execution with long-term business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage industry trends, competition news, and market insights to inform growth strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Growth Marketing, Business Development, consulting, project management, or eCommerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in managing e-commerce platform operations (Klaviyo, Hubspot and Shopify would be ideal)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating regulatory/government frameworks and contracting in new markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills with senior management and cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal, written, and interpersonal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive revenue growth, execute projects and exceed targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mentality combined with ability to think strategically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience problem-solving and proposing unique solutions to complex challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly data-driven approach to decision-making and strategy formation - i.e., comfortable with modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in an entrepreneurial, fast-paced, and dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised with the ability to manage multiple projects against deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full time role.&amp;nbsp; You must have the right to work full-time in Australia/New Zealand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Chippendale Head Office - hybrid working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;((#youfoodz))&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(( #LI-Hybride))&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is looking for a Growth Marketing Specialist, Direct Mail to help drive the growth and performance of our Direct Mail channel across our Canadian brands: HelloFresh, Chefs Plate, and Factor. This is a hands-on role for someone who takes ownership of their work, thinks in numbers, and enjoys turning data into clear actions that drive growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Growth Marketing Manager, you will be responsible for planning, executing, and optimizing Direct Mail acquisition campaigns that deliver against volume, CAC, ROI, and efficiency goals. You will help manage campaign operations from end to end, including audience planning, creative coordination, vendor management, budgeting, forecasting, execution, reporting, and post-campaign analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with internal teams and external partners to improve channel performance, scale what works, and identify new opportunities for growth. If you are someone who holds yourself accountable to results, enjoys solving problems, and wants to directly influence customer acquisition, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Execution &amp;amp; Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the planning and execution of Direct Mail campaigns from start to finish, including audience planning, creative coordination, print production, vendor timelines, deployment, QA, and post-campaign follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Analysis &amp;amp; Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Track campaign results across key metrics including volume, CAC, ROI, conversion, payback, and budget efficiency. Turn performance insights into clear recommendations that improve future campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the Direct Mail testing roadmap across audiences, creative, formats, offers, timing, and other campaign levers. Help identify what is working, what is not, and where we should focus next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Brand, Creative, Product Marketing, Analytics, Finance, and broader Growth teams to ensure campaigns are accurate, on brand, and aligned with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Partner Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage day-to-day communication with external partners, including printers, agencies, and data partners, to ensure campaigns are delivered accurately, on time, and cost-effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; AI-First Ways of Working:&lt;/strong&gt; Look for opportunities to reduce manual work, improve workflows, and make the channel run more efficiently. Use AI tools to automate repetitive tasks, summarize insights, improve reporting, and free up time for higher-impact work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budgeting &amp;amp; Administrative Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Support key operational tasks including voucher creation, invoicing, cost tracking, campaign trackers, and monthly targeting file preparation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay current on direct mail, offline marketing, consumer behaviour, and competitor activity, and bring forward fresh ideas that can help improve channel performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All other duties, as assigned.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in growth marketing, offline marketing, direct mail, print media, CRM, lifecycle marketing, or another acquisition-focused role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Marketing, or a related field required, with BBA or BComm preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning, executing, or supporting marketing campaigns with measurable performance goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Analytical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel or Google Sheets skills, with experience managing large datasets, campaign trackers, budgets, and reporting files.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with acquisition and performance marketing metrics, including CAC, LTV, ROI, conversion, budget tracking, and campaign efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using data to identify trends, summarize results, and make clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Tableau, SQL, Looker, or other reporting tools is an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, with the ability to plan, prioritize, and execute in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail, especially when working with targeting files, creative QA, budgets, vendor timelines, and campaign execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ownership mindset. You take initiative, follow through, and hold yourself accountable to outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills, with the ability to work effectively with internal teams and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative approach that brings energy, curiosity, and focus to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical AI-first mindset. You are comfortable testing new tools and finding smarter ways to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine enthusiasm for HelloFresh’s mission and a hunger to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Assets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with direct mail, print production, offline acquisition, or performance marketing channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a marketing agency or working closely with agency partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual French proficiency is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in joining the HelloFresh team? Don’t be chai, apply! Submit your application in PDF format today. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$60,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$67,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rejoins une superstar de la foodtech française&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez HelloFresh, nous bousculons les habitudes alimentaires des français grâce à nos Box à cuisiner !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition ?&amp;nbsp; Révolutionner le quotidien de nos abonnés, en promouvant une façon plus durable de cuisiner et en leur faisant découvrir de délicieuses recettes, créatives et équilibrées. L’alliance parfaite entre technologie et gastronomie, pour un maximum de gourmandise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh est présent dans plus de 15 pays. La France, un jeune marché lancé en 2019, connaît une ascension fulgurante : nous y sommes déjà leaders depuis 2021. Le moment parfait pour rejoindre notre équipe et avoir un impact fort dans l&#39;une des scales up françaises les plus prometteuses !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comment rendre tout cela possible ? Grâce à une équipe talentueuse et dynamique, des valeurs fortes de bienveillance et de diversité, et un environnement de travail stimulant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu souhaites prendre part à cette incroyable aventure humaine, internationale et entrepreneuriale, rejoins-nous !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Le poste :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous cherchons un Growth Operator rockstar pour muscler notre machine : quelqu&#39;un qui peut à la fois comprendre les stratégies complexes (Pricing &amp;amp; Discount, testing pipeline,rétention client) ET les faire exécuter sans friction. Tu seras le lien entre vision et résultat, entre équipes globales et réalités locales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu aimes les opérations qui ont du pouvoir, apprendre vite, et voir directement l&#39;impact de ton travail sur la croissance d&#39;une scale-up, c&#39;est toi qu&#39;on cherche.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ce que tu feras :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Growth Operator, tu seras responsable de faire fonctionner la machine Growth à une autre échelle. Tu travailleras sur quatre piliers clés :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stratégie Pricing &amp;amp; Discount :&lt;/strong&gt; ta mission sera d&#39;identifier et démarcher de nouveaux partenaires pour tester de nouveaux “gift with purchase” dans nos campagnes d&#39;acquisition. Tu seras le maître d&#39;œuvre de A à Z : de la négociation et du setup de lancement jusqu&#39;à l&#39;évaluation des performances. En collaboration avec nos équipes globales, tu documenteras ce pipeline de tests et transformeras les résultats en recommandations data-driven pour alimenter notre roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Referrals &amp;amp; Win-Back :&lt;/strong&gt; tu piloteras le suivi de performance de nos canaux d’acquisition clés&amp;nbsp;Referral et Win-back (Réactivations). Tu garantiras qu&#39;on atteint nos objectifs et travailleras étroitement avec les équipes à Berlin pour implémenter la stratégie au local. Ton rôle sera clé pour définir la stratégie d’acquisition en période de Peak.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Operations :&lt;/strong&gt; tu seras l’élément qui fait fonctionner l&#39;équipe Growth sans friction : setup des campagnes, coordination des assets, troubleshooting opérationnel, liaison avec les autres équipes (Creative, Brand, Analytics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retention Roadmap Support : &lt;/strong&gt;tu travailleras étroitement avec le Head of Retention &amp;amp; Analytics pour soutenir l&#39;exécution de la roadmap : mise en place des initiatives, tracking et reporting, coordination cross-team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qu&#39;on recherche chez toi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 à 4 ans d&#39;expérience minimum&lt;/strong&gt; en Growth Marketing, Performance Marketing, ou rôle opérationnel similaire (startups/scale-ups bienvenu)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Excel/Google Sheets solide&lt;/strong&gt; : tu peux faire des analyses rapides, créer des dashboards, manipuler des données sans traîner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obsession pour les données&lt;/strong&gt; : tu n&#39;aimes pas les suppositions, tu veux du contexte, du tracking, des recommandations basées sur la data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactivité &amp;amp; autonomie&lt;/strong&gt; : tu identifies ce qui bloque et tu le fixes toi-même (ou tu escalades intelligemment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation &lt;/strong&gt;: tu sais prioriser, structurer ton temps et suivre tes dossiers de manière irréprochable sans perdre le fil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication claire&lt;/strong&gt; : tu peux expliquer des concepts complexes simplement, et tu documentes ton travail pour que d&#39;autres le comprennent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingue français/anglais&lt;/strong&gt; (oral + écrit):&amp;nbsp; tu collaboreras avec des équipes globales à l’oral et à l’écrit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosité&lt;/strong&gt; : tu veux comprendre comment fonctionne HelloFresh, pas juste exécuter des tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptabilité&lt;/strong&gt; : dans une scale-up, les priorités changent vite; tu l&#39;acceptes et tu pivotes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous t&#39;offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact réel : tes actions alimentent directement la croissance d&#39;une des plus belles scale-ups européennes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une courbe d&#39;apprentissage rapide&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe bienveillante : une petite Growth team talentueuse et passionnée qui t&#39;aidera à monter en compétence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environnement international : tu travailleras avec des équipes dans 15 pays; c&#39;est une vraie école&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des bureaux au cœur de Paris (1er arr.), une culture dynamique et entrepreneuriale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avantages : réductions HelloFresh, tickets restaurant Swile, accès Gymlib, transport, et tout ce qui fait que c&#39;est cool de venir au bureau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le déroulé du processus de recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous examinons ton CV et ta lettre de motivation. Si c’est un match, nous t’invitons à une série d’entretiens et à réaliser un case study. Nous nous engageons à organiser rapidement les entretiens, afin de t’accueillir chez HelloFresh au plus vite !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes débuts chez HelloFresh :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A ton arrivée, nous te concoctons des sessions d’onboarding qui te permettront de rencontrer chaque manager et de t’imprégner ainsi du fonctionnement de HelloFresh.&amp;nbsp;Tu auras aussi du temps pour faire plus ample connaissance avec ton équipe avant de plonger dans le vif de tes missions !&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join one of France’s fastest-growing foodtech scale-ups&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we’re transforming the way people cook and eat. Through our meal-kit boxes, we help thousands of customers cook delicious, balanced meals at home while reducing food waste and simplifying everyday life.&amp;nbsp;Operating in 15+ countries, HelloFresh is one of the world’s leading foodtech companies. The French market, launched in 2020, has experienced hyper growth and became market leader in 2021.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Behind this growth is a simple formula: technology, data, and a team of ambitious people working together to reinvent food at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;If you want to work at the intersection of data, strategy, and growth, and have a tangible impact on a fast-scaling business, this internship is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Growth Strategy Data Analyst Intern, you will join the Analytics &amp;amp; Performance team and work closely with the Growth Marketing team to help drive HelloFresh’s growth in France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a data partner to business stakeholders, turning complex data into actionable insights that influence key strategic decisions, marketing investment decisions, and customer lifecycle optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will directly impact critical growth levers such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, and website optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines business analysis, experimentation, and data modeling, giving you end-to-end exposure to how data drives decisions in a growing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for candidates who want to apply rigorous analytics to real business problems and see their insights translated into concrete growth decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with modern analytics tools including SQL, Tableau, and Google Sheets, as well as internal data pipelines to analyze large-scale datasets and support data-driven decision-making across the Growth team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive business-impacting analyses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses on key growth topics such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, discount optimization, and marketing channel performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve conversion, marketing efficiency, and customer lifetime value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear, actionable recommendations for business stakeholders&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Growth Marketing managers and team leads to support strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and recommendations that influence budget allocation and growth strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support experimentation and A/B testing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design, monitoring, and analysis of A/B tests and growth experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the impact of new initiatives and help scale successful strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build data products and dashboards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track key business KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that enable the marketing team to make data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data models, reporting pipelines, and analysis frameworks that help teams scale their decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone curious, analytical, and eager to tackle complex business problems using data.&amp;nbsp;You are comfortable navigating large datasets, structuring ambiguous questions, and translating analyses into insights that drive business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking and ability to structure complex business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL, Excel / Google Sheets, and data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization tools (Tableau is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate data into clear and actionable business insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gap-year or final-year student from a top engineering or business school&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in data, consulting, strategy, or analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve in one of Europe’s fastest-growing scale-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to real business decisions driven by data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts on HelloFresh boxes, Swile meal vouchers, and Wellpass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offices in the heart of Paris (1st arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CV review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invitation to Case Study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interviews with your future managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your first days will include dedicated onboarding sessions with key managers across teams to help you understand HelloFresh’s organization and business model.&amp;nbsp;You’ll then quickly dive into your projects and start contributing to the team’s impact from day one.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role (What’s in the Box)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Nordic Product team shapes the meals, assortment and new concepts that customers experience every week across Denmark, Sweden and Norway.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Strategic Product Development, you will shape and drive HelloFresh Nordics&#39; physical product vision in close partnership with the Product Director. You&#39;ll balance two lenses: an &lt;strong&gt;outside-in view&lt;/strong&gt;, tracking how our industry and competitors are evolving and how customer tastes and needs are shifting more broadly, and an &lt;strong&gt;inside-out view&lt;/strong&gt;, grounded in how our own product and assortment are actually performing and what our existing customers are telling us. Bringing these together, you&#39;ll build a roadmap in close partnership with Marketing, so our biggest product bets and go-to-market efforts move as one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond setting direction, you&#39;ll own execution — leading cross-functional initiatives, scaling our assortment innovation program, and commercially managing our monetised product portfolio. The team you&#39;ll lead is still young, so a significant part of this role is building it: shaping its structure, its processes, and the way it works with stakeholders across the business, turning it into a mature, reliable engine for product strategy in the Nordics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do (The Recipe)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic product roadmap — building &amp;amp; execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the view of what our physical product should look like, grounded both in an outside-in read of industry, competitor, and customer trends, and in a solid understanding of how our existing product and assortment are performing and what our current customers tell us through feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, assess, and quantify strategic opportunities to evolve the product and grow the business profitably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-shape the overall product strategy in close partnership with the Product Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align the roadmap tightly with Marketing, so that our big bets are jointly defined and brought to customers as a single, coherent play to drive acquisition and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anchor the roadmap with other key stakeholders, including Operations and the International Product team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the execution of cross-functional strategic initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assortment innovation strategy &amp;amp; execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the assortment innovation program: identify and develop new concepts, seasonal and thematic offerings, and limited-time offers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate execution and implementation of new concepts across Menu Planning, Recipe &amp;amp; Ingredient Development, and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monetised product — commercial &amp;amp; operational ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimise the performance of our monetised products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial results (&lt;strong&gt;average order value (AOV&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; and profit contribution) and operational execution of this portfolio.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team building &amp;amp; ways of working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and structure a still-young team so it can deliver reliably — Define clear roles, priorities and ways of working so the team can deliver reliably&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build robust processes with key stakeholders (Marketing, Menu Planning, Operations, International Product) so cross-functional work runs smoothly rather than on an ad hoc basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring (Your Ingredients)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring relevant experience—typically 5–10 years—in FMCG, consumer products, management consulting or a similar field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience directly managing and developing a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on player-coach: as comfortable doing the strategic and analytical work yourself as you are developing and directing a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely curious about consumer and food trends and the competitive landscape, while equally grounded in what our existing product performance and customer feedback are telling us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable building team structure and processes from a fairly blank slate, not just running an established machine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills — able to align Product, Marketing, Operations, and international counterparts around a shared plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent business acumen: able to identify, quantify, and business-case strategic opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working language is English; proficiency in Swedish, Danish, or Norwegian is a plus; knowledge and understanding of Scandinavian food culture and consumers is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report directly to the Product Director, Nordics, and lead a team of 2 Product Managers and 1 Senior Product Strategy Manager. The role covers Denmark, Sweden and Norway and is based in our Copenhagen office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer (The Toppings)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HelloFresh Discounts – Enjoy 65% off your HelloFresh Meal Box and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development – Make the most of a dedicated Learning &amp;amp; Development budget and the HelloMint mentorship program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 25 days of paid vacation per year, + 5 days of&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;feriefridage&lt;/em&gt;. Paid leave also provided for your child’s first sick day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parent Benefits – Benefit from a Parental Leave policy supporting your family needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation and Perks – Includes a 5% company-paid pension and insurance package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health – Access to Spill online therapy, available within 24 hours of request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily Comforts – Office perks include drinks and snacks, subsidized catered lunches, and breakfast every Friday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness and Well-being – Discounts at SATS gym, plus access to sports and exercise clubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; 920&amp;nbsp; 36 Avenue, Unit 100,Nisku, T9E 1C6&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;: Monday to Friday (9am to 5pm) - may vary based on business needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Health and Safety Manager &amp;nbsp;is responsible for building a safety culture and strong engagement on site, developing and implementing safety programs in partnership site leadership &amp;amp; facilitating safety training. The Health and Safety Manager reports directly to the Senior Manager, National Health and Safety, and will collaborate closely with the Site Director. The Health and Safety Manager oversees a Health and Safety Coordinator; and works directly with Production Supervisors and Managers to ensure workplace safety is top priority. The size of the team overseen depends on the specific site.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a strong, continuously improving, safety-first culture through employee engagement, strong health and safety management programs, and training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Leadership to develop health and safety management systems and the associated rollout and facilitated training to ensure continued growth opportunities for the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead health and safety audits, routine site checks, and closing of compliance gaps to establish high safety standards and compliance with HelloFresh and OHS requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with site management to proactively identify, assess, analyze, and mitigate job hazards; and establish high effectiveness of controls and processes to eliminate safety risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage, motivate, and train employees on safety roles and responsibilities, accountabilities, and processes to maintain a safe workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee incident investigations, reporting, and management, develop root cause analysis and mentor operational personnel in its processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee injury management, WCB claim management, and Return-to-Work (RTW) processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead safety reporting; ensure high transparency and visibility to safety metrics and alerts on site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee onboarding and on the job safety training programs for employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with operations to develop and mentor an effective Joint Health and Safety Committee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor existing and incoming relevant legislation and regulations to ensure the site meets requirements and that health and safety management programs are up to date with leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in compliance with Provincial OH&amp;amp;S acts, regulations, and legislation, Industry best practice, and internal Policy and Procedure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties and responsibilities as assigned by the Senior Manager, National Health and Safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completed post-secondary education&amp;nbsp; in&amp;nbsp; Health and Safety (Certificate, Diploma, Degree), or related field or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Health and Safety Designation (CRSP, CRST, CSP, ASP, CMIOSH).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of work experience required in Health and Safety including 3 years of verifiable leadership progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in providing high quality customer experience, building a safety culture, communicating to get team member buy-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills with ability to perform administrative tasks with high degree of accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills (written and verbal), including active listening and proofreading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform at a high level in a fast paced and dynamic work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to demonstrate good, sound judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to work weekend schedules and in temperature controlled (it’s food, so it’s cold!) facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Suite (Calendar, Gmail, Docs, Sheets), and video conferencing (Hangouts Meet).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
