&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in Inoza tower, BGC that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will provide data-driven insights, operational performance analytics, and transformation impact measurement to enable fact-based decision-making across Operational Excellence initiatives. The role acts as the analytical engine of the transformation team, ensuring visibility of performance, identification of improvement opportunities, and measurement of value realization, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Performance Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze large operational datasets to identify trends, inefficiencies, and performance gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop insights on key Customer Care KPIs (e.g., AHT, FCR, CSAT, SLA, backlog, productivity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform deep-dive analysis to support root cause identification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Segment data to uncover drivers of operational performance variation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation &amp;amp; Benefits Tracking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and validate benefits realization across transformation initiatives (cost, time, quality, CX)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ROI modeling and post-implementation impact measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain transformation dashboards and benefits tracking frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistency between projected vs. realized benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Dashboard Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain dashboards (e.g., Power BI or equivalent tools)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate reporting processes to improve efficiency and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver recurring performance reports for leadership and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clarity, accuracy, and usability of reporting outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Analytics Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support process mining and process analytics initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in identifying automation and AI opportunities through data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct root cause analysis in collaboration with Process Excellence teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide data support for Lean and continuous improvement workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accuracy, consistency, and integrity of operational data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align data definitions and KPI frameworks across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data standardization initiatives across reporting platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve data quality issues in collaboration with relevant teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Support &amp;amp; Insight Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex datasets into clear, actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver ad hoc analysis for leadership and transformation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business case development with quantitative evidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate findings in a clear and structured manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
