&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in data analysis and visualization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills (or equivalent data querying capability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large operational datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
