&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic in Inoza Tower, BGC that embraces innovation and leverages advanced data to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on highly impactful strategic projects, develop your financial leadership skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will serve as the financial custodian and strategic co-pilot for HelloConnect, leading the entire Finance function in the Philippines. You will be accompany sustainable growth of HelloConnect and ensuring the highest standards of financial integrity. As a member of the local leadership team, you will in parallel to supervising Accounting, Controlling, Tax, and Payroll, act as the core Finance go-to-person on strategic business decisions, while acting as a vital bridge to HelloFresh Global Finance in Berlin. Your leadership will be crucial in optimizing local operations, managing statutory compliance, and championing value creation across our BPO solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for passionate finance professionals who can bring their unique analytical skills and strategic ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t check every single box but believe you’d excel in driving our financial story forward, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Planning &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Orchestrate the end-to-end financial planning and forecasting (FP&amp;amp;A) process, delivering board-level financial reporting and strategic insights that represent the full health of the HelloConnect business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Business Partnering:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the strategic financial co-pilot to the Manila leadership team. You will translate complex financial metrics into actionable operational strategies, supporting decisions on headcount planning, infrastructure, cost efficiency and local expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global-Local Bridge:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary liaison between local&amp;nbsp; operations in the Philippines and the Global Finance team in Berlin. You will ensure local financial nuances are accurately captured and represented in global consolidated reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop, lead, and mentor a high performing local finance team of 8-10 FTEs across our Philippines locations, fostering a culture of accountability, continuous improvement, and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Ownership &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the daily operations of Accounting, Controlling, and Payroll. Ensure strict compliance with local tax and regulatory requirements and lead the relationship with internal and external auditors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Modeling &amp;amp; Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Understand, maintain, and sophisticatedly scale our financial model to budget, re-forecast and continuously track actual performance of the business against budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Technology Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion digital transformation within the finance function by implementing automated solutions and modern tools to scale operations, enhance data integrity, and eliminate manual redundancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Financial Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep fluency in P&amp;amp;Ls, Balance Sheets (IFRS), and Cash Flow statements. You are adept at explaining complex financial dynamics to non-finance stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Leadership Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Multiple years of progressive leadership experience in a Finance function, ideally within the BPO, tech, or multinational shared services sector. You have a track record of building and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Border Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience working within a global matrix organization. You know how to navigate different cultures, time zones, and reporting structures (experience partnering with European/German HQ is a major plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Financial Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Bulletproof Excel/Google Sheets skills and experience in an enterprise performance management (EPM) tool (in Workday Adaptive is a plus). You can develop dynamic, scalable, and error-free financial models to forecast costs, and cash flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impactful Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional English communication skills. You don&#39;t just report numbers; you tell the &lt;em&gt;story&lt;/em&gt; behind the numbers in a clear, concise way to both finance and non-finance stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational Background:&lt;/strong&gt; A Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Accountancy, Economics, or a related field. Professional certifications (CPA, CFA, or CMA) or an MBA are advantageous but not mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
