&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entry level, 0 – 2 years of payroll experience, but fresh graduates are welcome to apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to do overtime when needed, but focus on efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity to quickly learn HRIS or Payroll Tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With Mathematical Ability and able to input massive volumes of numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful and keen on details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
