&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent English communication skills used to build cross-geographical relationships and foster a result-oriented culture through effective delegation.&lt;/p&gt;
