&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the uninterrupted flow of goods in and out of our warehouses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in both ambient and temperature-controlled environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the warehouse clear and ensure any potential hazards are dealt with quickly and efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually review operating systems and procedures, recommending any changes to improve operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with Line Leaders, Quality Checkers, Inventory and Shift Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all boxes are being staged correctly from the end of line and the correct pellets are loaded into correct trailers following Pallet Manifest and Supervisor instructions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhering to and upholding strict Health and Safety standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
