&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;People Business Partner&lt;/strong&gt; (all genders) unterstützt und berätst du unsere Führungskräfte an der operativen Basis, die Standortleitung sowie unsere Mitarbeitenden mit dem Ziel, eine engagierte und leistungsstarke Belegschaft bei Factor zu fördern. Du bist Expert:in in der Beratung entlang des gesamten Employee Life Cycles, steuerst wichtige Talent Programme, setzt HR-Richtlinien und -Prozesse um, stellst deren Einhaltung sicher und übernimmst operative Aufgaben im Tagesgeschäft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In dieser Rolle arbeitest du eng mit verschiedenen internen Teams zusammen, um passgenaue Lösungen für personalbezogene Anforderungen zu entwickeln. Gleichzeitig leistest du einen wichtigen Beitrag zu strategischen Projekten auf Bereichs- oder Funktionsebene – und gestaltest so aktiv die Zukunft unseres Unternehmens mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diese Stelle ist für 24 Monate zu besetzen (eine Verlängerung ist möglich).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du betreust und berätst Führungskräfte, Standortverantwortliche und Mitarbeitende in allen HR-relevanten Fragestellungen und trägst damit zur Umsetzung unserer Unternehmensziele bei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auf Basis der Strategie deiner Teams bzw. des Standorts richtest du HR-Maßnahmen gezielt aus und gehst proaktiv auf Führungskräfte zu, um sie bei Herausforderungen im täglichen Miteinander zu unterstützen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Als Coach und vertrauensvolle Ansprechpartner begleitest du Führungskräfte und Mitarbeitende in ihrer beruflichen Weiterentwicklung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Für die reibungslose Umsetzung zentraler HR-Programme wie Payroll, Performance Management und Talent Reviews übernimmst du die Steuerung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HR-Daten nutzt du aktiv zur Erstellung aussagekräftiger Reports und leitest daraus wertvolle Erkenntnisse sowie konkrete Lösungsansätze ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimierungspotenziale in Richtlinien, Prozessen und Compliance-Themen identifizierst du eigenständig und setzt Maßnahmen zur Vereinfachung und Effizienzsteigerung um.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In enger Zusammenarbeit mit anderen Bereichen des People-Teams entwickelst du gemeinsame Lösungen, bringst dich aktiv in Projekte ein und nutzt diese gezielt zur Weiterentwicklung deiner Fähigkeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfolgreich abgeschlossenes Studium (Bachelor/Master) mit Schwerpunkt Human Resources oder einem verwandten Bereich sowie mindestens 3 Jahre Berufserfahrung als HR Business Partner – idealerweise in einem schnell wachsenden (Tech-)Unternehmen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Kenntnisse im Arbeitsrecht und in personalwirtschaftlichen Prozessen sowie fundierte Erfahrung in der Planung und Umsetzung von HR-Projekten entlang des Employee Life Cycles, z. B. in den Bereichen Performance Management, Engagement und Workforce Planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Fähigkeit, starke und vertrauensvolle Beziehungen zu Führungskräften und relevanten Stakeholdern aufzubauen und professionell mit unterschiedlichen Zielgruppen zu kommunizieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamorientierte Persönlichkeit mit hoher Kommunikationsstärke und einem professionellen, souveränen Auftreten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytisches Denkvermögen und sicherer Umgang mit HR-Daten, um komplexe Herausforderungen strukturiert zu analysieren und passende Lösungen abzuleiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hohes Maß an Eigeninitiative und Flexibilität sowie Freude daran, in einem dynamischen und sich stetig verändernden Umfeld zu arbeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherer Umgang mit HRIS-Systemen, idealerweise Workday, sowie MS Office und Google Workspace; sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz&lt;/strong&gt; mit einem tollen Team in Verden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiativen für das Wohlbefinden&lt;/strong&gt; durch Kooperationen mit der Headspace-App und Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten &lt;/strong&gt;- Interne Schulungsmöglichkeiten sowie ein jährliches Budget für Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte auf Factor_-Boxen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergütung &amp;amp; Urlaub:&lt;/strong&gt; Kompetitives Gehalt und 30 bezahlte Urlaubstage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gesundheit &amp;amp; Wohlbefinden:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Zugang zu Wellbeing-Initiativen, mit zusätzlichen Fitnessangeboten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1002&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#basecampoffice #factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Planning team is the most data-driven team at HelloFresh: we plan, schedule and analyse the production of every box before it reaches our hungry customers across the UK. It&#39;s a team where technical skill genuinely moves the needle, and where the right person can make a real mark.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a technical role at the heart of the planning team. We&#39;re looking for the subject-matter expert on the front-end of production planning: someone who owns the tools, the systems and the detail, and who is proactive rather than reactive. Management experience is not essential; deep technical capability is. In your first year you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical capability of the planning team, and be the subject-matter expert on the frontend production planning tasks before they reach production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and coordinate the daily planning operations, and actively build the production schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse the previous week&#39;s production measurements to adapt future plan parameters, and draw out insight for ongoing and future projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives to improve the tools and processes that optimise production, measurement and KPI reporting, applying AI and automation where it adds value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical lead for the team, coordinating short and mid-term team and business projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and help elevate the team, and attend tier meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders inside and outside the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical and systems background, ideally from an operational environment (for example data, logistics or transport planning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real understanding of AI and how to apply it, ideally with some coding ability, this is central to the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced in Excel and Google Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven, and highly detail-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Long-term oriented and proactive: you anticipate and plan ahead rather than react.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The competencies of a manager, though management experience itself is not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prioritisation and problem-solving skills, and a proactive, can-do approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The Windmill Unit 2, SmartParc, Derby. DE217HW&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shifts:&lt;/strong&gt; Onsite, Monday-Friday 9am-6pm&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title: Lead Automation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&lt;/strong&gt; The Lead Automation Engineer brings highly technical experience in designing, implementing, and improving Automation systems within the fulfillment network. This role works closely with functional stakeholders, vendors, and other engineers to solve ambiguous problems autonomously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Principal point of contact with external vendors and system integrators to develop automated order fulfillment solutions utilizing top industry technology such as AMRs, Robotics, ASRS, sortation systems, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design effort for implementing new technology within a distribution center; including creating detailed Requests for Quotes (RFQs) and requirements documentation to ensure a cohesive end-to-end design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead data analytic efforts for designing and measuring success for Automation projects. Ability to extract clear and concise outputs from messy inputs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with optimizing Distribution Center layouts, material flows, Automation equipment, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work autonomously with cross-functional team members to ensure their business needs are met by new system designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owner of business case justification for new technology and/or CapEx purchases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor for junior engineers and team members, improving their technical and soft skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex technical information into simple documentation and presentations, independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills, professional attitude, and approach (and the ability to interact with individuals at various levels of the organization, up and down).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An influential technical leader with interpersonal skills, professional attitude and approach, and has the ability to interact with individuals at various levels of the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert in equipment selection, design, standards, performance improvement, statistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work as part of a team and interact effectively with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze and provide solutions for cost reduction through automation implementation and cost/benefit analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A superior multi-tasker, and have the ability to meet concurrent project deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Known for delivering polished, high quality presentations and reports that influence and accelerate business decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS Mechanical Engineering, Industrial Engineering, or similar field required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of engineering experience in multi-site industrial distribution, manufacturing, or processing environments preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Warehouse Conveyance (Right Angle Transfers, MDR, Sortation, Spirals, etc.) including working knowledge of Programmable Logic Controllers (PLCs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mechanical aptitude and an ability to understand how equipment and systems operate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with using Warehouse Control Systems (WCS/WES) and Warehouse Management Systems (WMS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL (Snowflake, MSSQL) and advanced data visualization tools (Tableau, Grafana, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AutoCAD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation, and company equity plan based on role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to 6 different Employee Resource Groups (ERGs) including those for minorities, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is growing exponentially year over year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Texas Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$127,890&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$147,900 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Newark, NJ Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$147,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$170,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Arizona Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$127,890&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$147,900 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Copywriter, Global Creative Studio (m/f/x)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brand Marketing · Berlin or Warsaw&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh Group, our mission is to change the way people eat forever. Since our 2011 founding in Berlin, we&#39;ve become the global market leader in the meal kit sector, inspiring millions of home cooks and food lovers every week. Our portfolio spans eight brands across 16 markets, from HelloFresh and Factor to Good Chop and Pets Table.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you love making words work hard, this might be your job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Group is looking for a Lead Copywriter to join our Creative Studio and help drive copy quality across our demand generation engine. You&#39;ll work across the full funnel and across every channel that matters (TV, OOH, paid social, display, CRM, YouTube) with a particular focus on mid-funnel, paid social creative that stops thumbs and starts conversations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on writing role, creating everything from campaign headlines to push notifications, from social hooks to CRM journeys. You&#39;ll also bring the strategic thinking to help shape how eight global brands communicate across sixteen markets, and the collaborative instinct to consult with local teams, advise channel owners, and help more junior staffers write better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crucially, you will help build, train, and socialize AI tools (particularly on Claude and Gemini) to create and maintain&amp;nbsp; a broad creative toolkit. You will use these tools to generate, iterate, and localize content, but you will be the creative brain behind all LLM work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Warsaw. Berlin-based employees have required attendance three days per week (Monday to Wednesday) at our Creative Studio in Moabit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write sharp, on-brand copy across the full funnel and all major channels (paid social, display, CRM, YouTube, TV, and OOH), with a particular emphasis on mid-funnel paid social creative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring big-picture strategic thinking to campaign briefs and creative concepts, while staying just as comfortable writing a single subject line or a two-second video hook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with local market copywriting teams across sixteen markets, offering guidance, feedback, and creative direction that keeps their work on-brand and high-quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools (especially Claude and Gemini) as part of your creative workflow: for ideation, iteration, and developing prompt frameworks and localization pipelines that improve quality and efficiency at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise channel owners and marketing stakeholders on copy strategy, messaging hierarchy, and how to make creative work harder at every touchpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape, evolve, and maintain tone of voice and messaging guidelines across eight brands, ensuring they’re clear and practical enough to use at local and global levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with designers, videographers, motion designers, and performance marketers to bring creative ideas to life and optimize them for conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret performance data to understand what&#39;s working, and use those insights to improve briefs, iterate on copy, and sharpen your craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorously proofread copy. Zero typos, zero grammatical errors, no exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage content flows via Google Suite, Airtable, and Jira so copy moves efficiently from brief to stakeholders to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A full-time copywriter based in, or willing to relocate to, Berlin or Warsaw.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS from a top-tier university in Communications, Marketing, Creative Writing, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of copywriting or communications experience, ideally spanning both agency and in-house environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of high-impact, English-language copy across major digital channels, especially paid social, display, CRM, email, and YouTube.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic thinker who can see the big picture across brands and markets, but who is equally happy polishing a push notification or reworking a subject line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experienced AI worker, using LLMs as part of a creative process to generate, refine, and localize copy more effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural collaborator who can consult with and advise local teams and channel owners—someone who leads through the quality of their thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working within brand and tone guidelines, and experienced enough to know when to push the boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to write across multiple projects, brands, markets, and tones simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A curiosity about audiences and the ability to interpret performance data to refine copy strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with localization and machine translation workflows is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency experience, particularly at a social media-focused or digital agency, is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working for food or tech brands is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of German, French, Swedish, Norwegian, Danish, or Dutch is a plus.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ARE YOU UP FOR THE CHALLENGE?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To apply, please complete the application and send us a portfolio that shows your range: performance-driven digital copy, campaign thinking across brands or markets, and any examples of how you&#39;ve worked smarter—whether that&#39;s AI-assisted workflows, localization processes, or something else entirely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re excited to see what you bring to the team.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;For our ambitious and fast-growing team in London, we are looking for a Lead Analyst. In this exciting role you will be supporting with setting the analytical direction for the team, building &amp;amp; maintaining our BI infrastructure, and driving key analytical projects. Within this you will be looking to improve data quality &amp;amp; tooling across teams, bringing our analytical capabilities to the next level. This will form the foundation from which you will produce insightful and actionable dashboards, datasets &amp;amp; analysis, which in turn will be used to underpin key decisions and recommendations, informing future developments and improvement of our product (the meal kits we send our customers every week!)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this hands on role you will be leading on the scoping, building and managing of our Commercial&lt;br&gt;BI infrastructure, ensuring we are providing highly insightful/actionable Tableau dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focused on improving our data quality &amp;amp; tooling across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Championing a strong data culture across the business, influencing how teams adopt and act on&amp;nbsp;analytical insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideating, scoping and leading key strategic analytical projects focused on driving improvements in&amp;nbsp;our core product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep diving large datasets and pulling out key insights which will underpin core product&amp;nbsp;improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and obtain approval on any recommendations from Senior Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, develop and implement new approaches and processes across the business, whilst&amp;nbsp;mapping out recurring processes, and finding ways of simplifying/optimising them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with teams such as Culinary, Menu Planning, Analytics, Procurement &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Operations and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with International HelloFresh geographies ensuring synergies are found and&amp;nbsp;leveraged&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural leader who can inspire and influence teams without formal authority, driving alignment&amp;nbsp;across stakeholders and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Tableau, with a strong working knowledge of data visualisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL is essential; experience with Python a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very strong Microsoft Excel/Google Sheets skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, including the ability to summarise quantitative concepts into a digestible format that is easy to understand and communicate to all levels of the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience in a high performance and culture environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage priorities simultaneously and meet time-sensitive deadlines in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead interactions with senior stakeholders and to summarise quantitative concepts into a digestible format&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management competencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys working cross-functionally, across teams and departments to achieve a joint objective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll need to have a genuine interest in using data - something we love at HelloFresh! As well as an ability to use the data and information gathered to solve real business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll have strong analytical abilities, and a keen interest to make a big impact on a fast-growing organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
