&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior Manager to lead price and discount strategy for a portfolio of our global brands, owning both the strategy and execution of our experimentation and optimization roadmap. This is a high visibility, high impact role as we work cross functionally to ensure delivery of a world-class experience for our customers and drive profitable, long term growth for the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategic Initiatives: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the conceptualization, execution, and optimization of complex price and discount strategies, ensuring alignment with overall business goals and market conditions and translating strategy into tangible action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Testing &amp;amp; Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, execute, and analyze innovative price and discount tests, utilizing advanced modeling techniques to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Closely monitor market trends for portfolio markets, inflationary pressures, and competitor strategies to identify opportunities for differentiation and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify new data-driven optimization opportunities, propose innovative solutions, and influence cross-functional teams and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Data Science to build advanced segmentation models and enhance attribution, ensuring strategic alignment across customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with senior leadership and global teams (e.g., Product, Marketing Analytics, Growth Marketing) to craft strategies and share recommendations that drive impactful decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in consulting, data analytics, or a price/discount-related role, with a strong track record of solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required, Master’s degree preferred in marketing, business or STEM-related fields (e.g. mathematics, engineering, computer science, economics, statistics, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical skills, including advanced command of Excel, SQL is a plus, with the ability to translate complex data into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience devising and measuring the effectiveness of strategic optimizations (including AB testing), with a proven track record from other data-rich business environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication skills with proven ability to engage with senior leadership and align on key initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with diverse teams, including Product, Marketing, and Data Science, in a fast-paced, matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating ambiguity and adapting quickly to evolving priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
