&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;mit einem tollen Team in Verden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiativen für das Wohlbefinden&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;durch Kooperationen mit der Headspace-App und Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten&lt;/strong&gt;- Interne Schulungsmöglichkeiten sowie ein jährliches Budget für Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte auf Factor_-Boxen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergütung &amp;amp; Urlaub:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Kompetitives Gehalt und 30 bezahlte Urlaubstage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gesundheit &amp;amp; Wohlbefinden:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Zugang zu Wellbeing-Initiativen, mit zusätzlichen Fitnessangeboten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001 #factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Associate will support improving our transportation strategic initiatives to enhance processes within our Logistics Operations Center team. Responsibilities include transportation scheduling, tracking line hauls, negotiating spot market freight, managing exceptions and communicating cross-functionally to create seamless shipping execution across our network.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will ...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report to the Associate Manager / Manager to manage, monitor and develop recovery plans for outbound loads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute outbound strategy - working across all distribution centers, third-party storage locations, cross docks, and vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor, measure, and improve service level metrics, including on-time arrival and on-time departure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine root causes and ensure details of escalations are provided and accurate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute relabeling of boxes from label generation to pushing customer communication updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly and effectively analyze real-time data to provide recovery and contingency action plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the daily Exception Management process, communicating potential delays and assigning boxes to be re-made, with the goal of protecting the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, organize, log and root cause major exceptions events; analyzing the impact of these events to weekly error data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve unique and challenging problems faced in a perishable supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become part of a passionate team that strives to develop innovative solutions to improve and grow HelloFresh’s delivery network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with third-party carriers and execute plans to secure loads against forecasted volume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with our outbound transportation team to lead and reinforce operational process improvement projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a customer-focused environment committed to delivering the highest quality product to our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven – you can organize, explore, and synthesize unstructured data into actionable insights to better inform operational decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually curious – you have an insatiable desire to understand how things work, why they work the way they do, and to consistently challenge the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented – you possess strong organizational skills and consistently demonstrate a methodical approach to all your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile – you thrive in fast-paced and dynamic environments and are comfortable working autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A critical thinker – you use logic to identify opportunities, evaluate alternatives, and synthesize and present critical information to solve complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent communicator – able to communicate at all levels with clarity, poise, maturity and precision both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative - you enjoy working cross-functionally with various teams to gather key inputs, and are able to work well with diverse opinions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated to providing the best possible experience for the HelloFresh customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business Administration, Economics, Data Science, Computer Science, Information Systems, Accounting, Supply Chain, or other relevant areas of study required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 years of experience delivering analytical solutions to complex problems required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 10% within the United States required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with transportation management software (E2Open, BluJay) preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible in working a non M-F work schedule (e.g. rotational schedule, weekends, and/or overnights).&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Must be able to work the shift: Sunday- Wednesday, 7am-5pm CST&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position&#39;s essential functions demand the performance of the following physical requirements with or without reasonable accommodation:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prolonged periods working at a desk and on a computer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reading information on a computer screen and inputting data into a computer system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in&lt;strong&gt; Inoza tower, BGC&lt;/strong&gt; that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt; Logistics Coordinator,&lt;/strong&gt; you will report to the Logistics Manager and serve as the key liaison between production facilities and logistics partners. In this role, you will play a vital part on the team by managing vendor relationships, driving on-time delivery performance, and resolving outbound shipping issues to ensure customer satisfaction. You will be contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Supply &amp;amp; Transport Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Liaise daily with supply planning and buying teams to schedule, organize, and monitor ongoing supply chain transportation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Carrier &amp;amp; Cost Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Compare multiple vendor quotations, tender loads to chosen carriers, and build strategic supplier relationships to drive cost savings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Shipment Tracking &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor all shipments through to final delivery while keeping cross-functional teams updated on status changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Scheduling:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce company SOPs for delivery and packing requirements while actively booking delivery appointments in Data Docks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Logistics &amp;amp; Layout Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Organize, update, and manage weekly truck layouts to maximize transport efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in developing, maintaining, and refining SOPs to support continuous logistics improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Relevant Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum of 1-2 years of experience in supply chain, transportation, or manufacturing with a strong interest in logistics. (WMS, TMS, ERP Logistics, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional MS Excel skills and quantitative background used to drive data-based problem solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Entrepreneurial and ambitious mindset, taking full initiative beyond the standard scope of assignments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Organization &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly organized with exceptional follow-up abilities to ensure key results are consistently met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Interpersonal &amp;amp; Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; Self-motivated, adaptable, and assertive with strong communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in&lt;strong&gt; Inoza tower, BGC&lt;/strong&gt; that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt; Logistics Coordinator,&lt;/strong&gt; you will report to the Logistics Manager and serve as the key liaison between production facilities and logistics partners. In this role, you will play a vital part on the team by managing vendor relationships, driving on-time delivery performance, and resolving outbound shipping issues to ensure customer satisfaction. You will be contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Supply &amp;amp; Transport Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Liaise daily with supply planning and buying teams to schedule, organize, and monitor ongoing supply chain transportation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Carrier &amp;amp; Cost Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Compare multiple vendor quotations, tender loads to chosen carriers, and build strategic supplier relationships to drive cost savings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Shipment Tracking &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor all shipments through to final delivery while keeping cross-functional teams updated on status changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Scheduling:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce company SOPs for delivery and packing requirements while actively booking delivery appointments in Data Docks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Logistics &amp;amp; Layout Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Organize, update, and manage weekly truck layouts to maximize transport efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in developing, maintaining, and refining SOPs to support continuous logistics improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Relevant Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum of 1-2 years of experience in supply chain, transportation, or manufacturing with a strong interest in logistics. (WMS, TMS, ERP Logistics, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional MS Excel skills and quantitative background used to drive data-based problem solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Entrepreneurial and ambitious mindset, taking full initiative beyond the standard scope of assignments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Organization &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly organized with exceptional follow-up abilities to ensure key results are consistently met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Interpersonal &amp;amp; Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; Self-motivated, adaptable, and assertive with strong communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set-up&lt;/strong&gt;: Temporary Work-from-Home&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule:&lt;/strong&gt; Rotational Monday to Sunday with 2 days off&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Must be amenable to work during Holidays and Weekends&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Time: &lt;/strong&gt;9:00pm to 6:00am MNL (US support)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#helloconnect&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#hcgreenhouse&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over de rol: &lt;em&gt;What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Onze hub in Gent is het kloppende hart van onze &lt;em&gt;last mile operatie&lt;/em&gt;: de plek waar elke dag tientallen chauffeurs vertrekken om maaltijdboxen bij onze klanten thuis te bezorgen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Logistiek Manager &lt;/strong&gt;(&lt;em&gt;intern noemen we deze functie &#39;Hub Manager&#39;&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;ben jij de drijvende kracht achter een vlotte, veilige en klantgerichte operatie. Jij combineert operationeel leiderschap met een scherp oog voor mensen, en zorgt ervoor dat de hub niet alleen vandaag goed draait, maar ook klaar is voor de groei van morgen. Met jouw aanpak maak je zichtbaar verschil: voor je team, voor onze klanten én voor HelloFresh als geheel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat je doet: &lt;em&gt;The Recipe&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je stuurt de dagelijkse operatie aan en zorgt voor een efficiënte, veilige en professionele werkomgeving voor teamleiders en chauffeurs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je coacht, motiveert en ontwikkelt jouw team, en schrikt ook niet terug voor moeilijke gesprekken wanneer dat nodig is;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bewaakt de performance van de hub door KPI&#39;s scherp op te volgen en samen met je team continu te verbeteren;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je werkt nauw samen met aangrenzende teams en stakeholders om processen te bewaken en operationele uitdagingen pro-actief aan te pakken;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je beheert roosters, planningen en absenteïsme, en draagt zorg voor de ontwikkeling en beoordeling van je medewerkers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je houdt toezicht op het wagenpark en zorgt voor de naleving van welzijns- en milieuregelgeving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat je meebrengt: &lt;em&gt;The Ingredients&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimaal 3 jaar ervaring in de logistieke sector, inclusief aantoonbare ervaring in een leidinggevende rol;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sterke people skills: je weet mensen te verbinden en te motiveren, maar durft ook grenzen te stellen en het gesprek aan te gaan;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytisch en procesmatig denkvermogen, met een hands-on instelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De flexibiliteit om ook in weekends beschikbaar te zijn;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uitstekende communicatieve vaardigheden in Nederlands én Engels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bovenal zijn we op zoek naar mensen die HelloFresh beter maken. Er zijn veel verschillende manieren om vaardigheden te ontwikkelen, en we houden van diverse ervaringen! Dus ook als je niet aan elk criterium voldoet, maar denkt dat je in deze rol tot je recht komt, leren we graag meer over jou.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ben jij het ontbrekende ingrediënt?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Klinkt dit als een smakelijke uitdaging? Stuur dan zo snel mogelijk je cv op. We streven ernaar om jouw profiel binnen 5 werkdagen te bekijken en je te laten weten wat de volgende stap is.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Loyalty and retention are two of the strongest levers we have for growing customer lifetime value and profit. As Lead, Loyalty &amp;amp; Customer Lifecycle, you own the strategy and end-to-end delivery of HelloFresh Group’s loyalty program across our global markets and brands. You decide how the program works and how it earns its keep, set the quarterly roadmap and OKRs, and own the CRM and lifecycle experience that runs across email, push and SMS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is customer-centric and data-driven. You’ll run experiments, build the financial models that quantify program cost and customer value, and analyze our data to find where the biggest gains are. You work hand-in-hand with tech and product as the commercial owner of the program, translating business questions into requirements and taking on the commercial work so engineering can stay focused on building. You also partner with Data, Product Marketing, Legal and CRM Operations to ship, and coordinate across markets with local growth and legal teams. Beyond the core program, you look after our legacy retention initiatives across markets and help local teams run their own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual-contributor leadership role. You’ll set direction and lead major initiatives through influence and cross-functional partnership, not through direct reports. Your work will shape how HelloFresh Group rewards and retains its customers for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own loyalty strategy &amp;amp; design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect and own&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the end-to-end loyalty program, from how it works (points, tiers, missions, rewards) to the financial models and business cases behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the reward economics and program roadmap, turning company strategy into quarterly OKRs and a clear path for how the program evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;multi-market rollouts, including legal compliance, customer communication and migration planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive CRM &amp;amp; the customer lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the CRM strategy for the program, covering journey design, segmentation and multi-channel campaigns across email, push and SMS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;lifecycle interventions tied to key milestones such as enrollment, points thresholds, redemption nudges and churn risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;CRM dependencies with platform and ops teams, catching eligibility, frequency and data issues before they reach customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run experimentation &amp;amp; analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and interpret&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;A/B experiments for program variants, CRM campaigns and feature launches, then turn the results into decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and maintain&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;financial models that quantify program cost, AOV impact and customer lifetime value, refining them as experiment data comes in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and track&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the KPIs that signal program health, including opt-in, redemption, engaged users, points burn and virality, and use them to spot untapped opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build partnerships &amp;amp; deliver operationally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify and evaluate&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;brand partnership opportunities for the reward store, such as gift-with-purchase and co-branded rewards, building the business case by market and aligning with Corporate Partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluate and manage&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;vendor relationships end to end, including reference calls and commercial negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;as the commercial partner to tech and product, owning the ad-hoc business work (scoping, analysis, requirements, trade-off calls) so delivery keeps moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resolve&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;program issues quickly and with little customer disruption, and support local teams running legacy retention initiatives with strategic and CRM input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who has the ability to shape the customer experience of our Loyalty program, including designing and merchandising strong and exciting gamified experiences, paired with a deep analytical strength, business acumen and (ideally) financial modeling experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years (or equivalent) of professional experience in a fast-paced environment, e.g. agency, tech scale-up, consulting, finance, or e-commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record in loyalty, CRM/Lifecycle Marketing, retention, or subscription business models, with a passion for designing excellent customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very strong analytical and conceptual problem-solving skills, strategic thinking, and sound business acumen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial modeling skills and experience holding large models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and measuring business and pricing strategies through experimentation (incl. A/B testing) in data-rich environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mentality, with experience leading multiple parallel workstreams and prioritizing for highest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills and a proven ability to influence stakeholders at all levels, including senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in marketing, business, statistics, or a STEM-related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL or other querying languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern CRM, experimentation, and analytics tooling. Our stack includes Iterable, SFMC, Statsig, Talon.One, Tableau, and Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Machine Learning Engineer in our ML Solutions squad to help build innovative generative AI products that provide AI-powered assistants to HelloFresh&#39;s culinary Chefs helping them editorialize content, validate recipe data, detect issues, suggest corrections, and ideate. As a Machine Learning Engineer, you will primarily contribute to our agentic generative AI system that automates recipe content production, while also supporting the MLOps platform that enables data scientists across the company to develop, deploy, and monitor ML models at scale.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain an &lt;strong&gt;agentic GenAI system&lt;/strong&gt; that integrates with HelloFresh&#39;s culinary content pipeline (API development, LLM orchestration, image generation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement &lt;strong&gt;production-grade AI Agent evaluations&lt;/strong&gt; to measure quality, reliability, and performance of generative outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build scalable, production-grade ML systems capable of handling large datasets, complex model pipelines, and real-time API integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our &lt;strong&gt;MLOps platform&lt;/strong&gt; — a set of tools and services built on Databricks, MLFlow, and Prefect that help data scientists develop, deploy, and maintain ML applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with data scientists, product managers, and culinary stakeholders to translate business needs into reliable AI &amp;amp; ML products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve operational excellence through automation, monitoring, drift detection, and data quality practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date on advancements in generative AI, agentic workflows, and MLOps tooling, and propose improvements to the team&#39;s development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;software development skills&lt;/strong&gt; in Python and SQL, including DevOps practices, test-driven development (TDD), spec-driven development, and fluency working with AI coding agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and maintaining &lt;strong&gt;production ML systems&lt;/strong&gt;, including model serving, monitoring, and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity or interest in &lt;strong&gt;generative AI&lt;/strong&gt; (LLMs, image generation, prompt engineering, agentic architectures).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern MLOps tooling such as MLFlow, feature engineering, Kubernetes, and workflow orchestration (e.g., Prefect). Experience with PySpark and Databricks is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for building &lt;strong&gt;developer tools and platforms&lt;/strong&gt; that improve productivity and enable other teams to scale ML adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate complex technical findings to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
