&lt;li&gt;Conduct machine calibration and run-to-failure maintenance activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform regular facility inspections to ensure fire extinguishers, exits, emergency lighting and other safety features meet and/or exceed&amp;nbsp; regulatory requirements; perform repairs as required&lt;/li&gt;
