&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$101,430&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$117,300 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Manager FSQA (all genders), you will play a key role in ensuring food safety and quality standards across our distribution network in DACH and UK. This role will lead the professionalisation of compliance within our 20 hubs in DACH and an expanding network of 4 hubs in UK, while supporting HelloFresh Delivery Network operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to improve, implement, and maintain robust Quality Management Systems that meet legislative requirements, HelloFresh Standards and BRCGS certification standards. You will embed effective processes and training while mitigating FSQA risks and ensuring audit readiness, all to protect our customers and drive operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act as the FSQA expert for logistics in DACH and UK, ensuring compliance with food safety legislation and due diligence at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Furthermore, you take ownership of logistics FSQA&amp;nbsp; performance by setting up governance, building trackers, and driving KPI reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this role, you lead/support crisis and incident management, coordinating investigations, resolutions, and projects related to traceability, temperature control and cold chain management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You establish and maintain a QMS aligned with BRCGS Storage &amp;amp; Distribution standards, supporting certifications and recertifications in DACH and UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moreover, you develop and implement SOPs, HACCP systems, and audit programs, while training hub teams to ensure lasting compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You validate and verify cold chain processes and follow up on corrective and preventive actions, reducing the risk of non-conformance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finally, you collaborate with Operations, Fleet, and DC FSQA teams to embed standards, ensure full traceability, and foster a strong food safety culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in logistics FSQA; knowledge of EU food safety legislation is required. Expertise in UK and DACH markets is a plus. Experience with GFSI-recognised standards and BRCGS is also a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to establish, maintain, and audit HACCP systems and QMS, while developing, implementing, and training SOPs and FSQA processes across sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness to travel to our locations in UK and DACH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to work effectively with internal teams, external partners, and authorities while driving a strong FSQA culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and data-driven mindset, capable of setting up governance structures, converting data into KPIs and trackers, and harmonising FSQA processes across regions for scalability and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Google Suite and MS Office skills (G-sheets, G-doc, G-slides, Excel, Word, PowerPoint)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is required; German and/or French are a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh we embrace and welcome diversity and we currently employ over 15,000 individuals globally who contribute to this. We employ individuals based on their ability to perform a job rather than on the basis of their: race, national origin, color, caste, social origin or position, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, political opinion, marital status or any other characteristic. We encourage everyone to apply and will give everyone equal consideration. We are an equal opportunity employer – everyone is welcome at our table.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#barlebenquality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh’s newly acquired Ready-to-Eat brand Factor, is looking for a Planning Manager to oversee forecasting, planning and master scheduling responsibilities for the network of manufacturing and fulfillment centers. The Planning team plays a central role in maintaining efficient Operations and delivering for our customers in a high-growth environment. Our Planning Managers are responsible for end-to-end end-to-end production planning for our U.S. distribution centers, including addressing day-to-day operational risk, analytical problem-solving, and driving improvement of key performance indicators. We are looking for leaders with strong analytical and dive-deep skills, as well as excellent communication skills and executive presence, who can partner effectively with other leaders across functions to solve problems and execute high-level network decisions on a daily basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage weekly/monthly production and fulfillment and capacity plans using systems and processes that support the organization’s goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track progress to and deviations from the plan, drive problem-solving and root cause analysis. Review production performance and update planning rates to accurately reflect plant capabilities and available capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess and identify potential Operational risks; lead the discussion of risks and plan changes with other key business stakeholders such as Procurement, Logistics, HR and Operations leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize production and fulfillment planning tools and track performance to ensure the successful execution of production plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on projects to drive the continuous improvement of Planning tools and processes and complete them on schedule.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or participate on special projects as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Key Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thought leader in developing solutions to cross-functional operational challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of thinking strategically about high-level business impacts as well as being familiar with the details of deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to adapt quickly in changing situations and to use data to drive the right results&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills to effectively develop cross-functional partnerships; open-minded, collaborative and team-oriented attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing competing priorities and informing complex decision-making in an ambiguous environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing people and developing talent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to professional integrity and ethics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Business, Statistics, Mathematics, Supply Chain, Finance, or related field with 3-5 years relevant experience in production planning, detailed scheduling , replenishment planning, demand planning or materials management required OR Associates degree with 5 to 10 years relevant experience in production planning, detailed scheduling , replenishment planning, demand planning or materials management required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage multiple demands on time required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizational, project management skills, attention to detail and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Google sheets and/or MS Excel required (VLOOKUP, Pivot Tables, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in Production Planning or related positions that require cross-functional collaboration and data analysis to influence stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food and Beverage manufacturing industry experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Manager, Supply Planning and Inventory &amp;nbsp;to &amp;nbsp;join our growing Supply Chain organization to enhance supply planning and inventory governance and framework, optimize medium term planning and working capital, aimed at improving our business performance for our Canadian RTE brand (Factor_) and delivering the premium crafted meals to our customers. This role will own and develop with continuous improvement in mind for our supply planning and inventory domain, partnering closely with North American and DC teams, to drive optimal inventory control, ensuring availability and high quality through supply planning. This is a high-impact leadership role at the intersection of strategy and execution in a fast-paced, fast-growing environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop the team — setting clear performance expectations and coach to build a high-performance culture aligned to HelloFresh’s DNA and Factor Canada’s growth trajectory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and continuously improve the medium term overview on direct material supply, weeks on hand and safety stock optimization to support the DCs and Procurement Operations seamless flow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up a robust inventory governance framework and the subsequent processes fitting into the Factor Canada’s growing business needs, providing the accurate visibility to upstream and downstream teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with the DC Warehousing teams to implement a cohesive and well executed inventory control. Drive change management in the DC on the processes and SOP, lead in setting up RACI and implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute directly to the business’ financial performance by owning and driving the supply planning and inventory related targets, including but not limited to working capital target, network optimization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive optimization in safety stock principles, set up optimal weeks on hand to balance working capital as well as the production needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize the supply network in the medium term to drive efficiency in storage, transportation and secure supply with quality to serve our customers needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support tech and tool launches related to supply planning and inventory management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional leaders across Finance, Commercial, and Operations to align supply planning decisions with business-wide KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years in planning, inventory, and/or supply chain experience with a Bachelor’s in Engineering, Business or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated people management experience — you’ve directly managed, coached, and elevated team members, and you take ownership of your team’s development as seriously as your own deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem solving, and Excel skills. Able to use a root cause analysis mindset to continuously improve to drive optimization in the responsible area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, enthusiasm, and a can-do attitude. Used to working in a high pressure, fast paced, and constantly changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly self-driven and resilient — comfortable navigating ambiguity, setting direction without a perfect playbook, and leading through change in a scaling business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An effective collaborator, who empowers and enables others to share ideas, raises awareness, gets buy-in, and delivers fast and well-rounded solutions to complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple projects and assignments, able to prioritize and meet budgets deadlines and achieve objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications and/or licenses with Lean Six Sigma preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to work flexible schedules and cold facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Office Suite (Word, Excel, PowerPoint) or Google Suite (Calendar, Gmail, Docs, Sheets).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#JD1008&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$85,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$95,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Marketing Lead, you&#39;ll be the senior expert driving HelloFresh Group&#39;s global referral and virality programme - one of our key growth engines. This is a high-ownership, high-impact role: you&#39;ll set the direction, own the Referral and Virality KPIs and define the operating model that enables execution across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of CRM, product marketing, growth, and performance, spanning 16 markets and 8 brands globally. You will lead the work, organizing cross-functional teams, defining the operational plan and tactical playbooks, shaping how the virality function is perceived and built over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring the depth of an expert and the range of a generalist: as comfortable in the data as you are in a senior stakeholder room, as rigorous in planning as you are fast in execution. You bring a product management mindset to marketing — translating strategy into clear priorities, experiments, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you love owning growth programmes end-to-end, thrive at the intersection of marketing, CRM and product, and want to help define what best-in-class referral looks like at a global company - this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the Programme - Strategy to Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own HelloFresh&#39;s global referral and virality programme, defining the proposition, channel strategy, roadmap, measurement framework, and execution model across CRM and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives into clear priorities, measurable outcomes, and an operating rhythm that enables cross-functional delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the organization&#39;s subject matter expert for referral and virality, influencing strategy and aligning senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build &amp;amp; Scale Referral Growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design referral experiences customers love by partnering with Product and local markets to deliver seamless, globally consistent customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive referral performance through experimentation, data-driven decision-making, and continuous optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional execution across multiple teams, navigating complexity and competing priorities to deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in CRM, lifecycle marketing, growth marketing, product marketing, referrals, virality, or similar—ideally within tech, subscription, e-commerce, or marketplace businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience leading complex cross-functional initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing together Product, CRM, Analytics, Engineering, and commercial teams to deliver strategic outcomes in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A product and systems mindset&lt;/strong&gt;—you&#39;re comfortable turning ambiguous business goals into clear strategies, roadmaps, and experiments while aligning cross-functional teams around shared outcomes without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong analytical and commercial acumen&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience defining success metrics, interpreting customer and performance data, running experiments, and translating insights into measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;—you&#39;re able to influence senior leaders, communicate complex ideas with clarity, and build alignment across Product, CRM, Analytics, and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficiency with modern AI tools&lt;/strong&gt;, using them to improve decision-making, accelerate execution, automate workflows, and enhance personal and team productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ownership-driven approach&lt;/strong&gt; to problem-solving—you prioritize effectively, thrive in ambiguity, and continuously improve how teams, processes, and customer experiences scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building or scaling referral, virality, or customer advocacy programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in subscription, tech, e-commerce, or marketplace businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM platforms, experimentation frameworks, and customer analytics tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing AI-powered workflows, automation, or scalable marketing infrastructure in a commercial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple international markets or global organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high performing, driven individual to join our supply chain operations team. You will have category/sub-category ownership of our inbound operations and report into the Supply Chain Manager. This is the perfect role for someone to advance their career in supply chain operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and improve our inbound supply chain operations to ensure our ingredients arrive in full and on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise inbound processes and identify cross-functional efficiencies, proactively minimising the impact to our end to end operation and more importantly our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate and transform the function through project delivery, setting out clear course of actions to achieve defined outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently analyse internal data to generate ideas, support alternative solutions and provide clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimise costs through effective planning and waste management, recognise and propose new practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise the weekly ordering and forecasting processes, mitigating risks and thinking outside the box to formulate creative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own relationships with external suppliers, working closely with procurement and technical teams to manage costs and onboard suppliers. Report on and manage supplier performance effectively to elevate the operational standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and monitor KPIs, balancing day-to-day operations with long term strategic objectives. Skillfully prioritise tasks, delegating where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively with internal teams including Inventory Management, Warehouse, Transport, Planning, Labour Management, Finance, Marketing ensuring timely and accurate information is shared.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop significant expertise, skills and knowledge to be the voice and influence for supply chain operations across the wider business. Coach and guide team members to deliver optimal outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrable experience in Supply Chain Operations, ideally in a similar industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are incredibly resilient and operate well under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think on your feet and find quick and efficient solutions to resolve problems with minimal impact to internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a self-starter with initiative and a proactive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are not afraid to challenge the status-quo with new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a confident decision-maker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have great communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You find the perfect balance between bigger picture thinking and digging for the detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You embrace change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a role model that excites and motivates other team members with your passion for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are hungry to learn new things every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in excel and data manipulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible to work weekends (approx once every 6 weeks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Dog friendly office!&lt;br&gt;● Eye care scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hours: &lt;/strong&gt;Monday - Friday, Flexible to work weekends (approx once every 6 weeks)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;138&quot; data-end=&quot;232&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;138&quot; data-end=&quot;149&quot;&gt;Factor_&lt;/strong&gt;, eine Marke von &lt;strong data-start=&quot;166&quot; data-end=&quot;180&quot;&gt;HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;, sucht dich als &lt;strong data-start=&quot;197&quot; data-end=&quot;231&quot;&gt;Mechatroniker Instandhaltung &lt;/strong&gt;(all genders).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot;&gt;Als Teil unseres &lt;strong data-start=&quot;251&quot; data-end=&quot;268&quot;&gt;Wartungsteams&lt;/strong&gt; stellst du sicher, dass unsere gewerblichen und industriellen Koch- und Lebensmittelverarbeitungsanlagen zuverlässig laufen und jederzeit einsatzbereit sind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;430&quot; data-end=&quot;553&quot;&gt;Dein Ziel: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;maximale Betriebszeit&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;468&quot; data-end=&quot;498&quot;&gt;hohe Systemzuverlässigkeit&lt;/strong&gt; und ein &lt;strong data-start=&quot;507&quot; data-end=&quot;552&quot;&gt;reibungsloser, sicherer Produktionsablauf&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;555&quot; data-end=&quot;715&quot;&gt;In dieser Rolle bist du unsere Ansprechperson für &lt;strong data-start=&quot;605&quot; data-end=&quot;620&quot;&gt;mechanische&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;622&quot; data-end=&quot;637&quot;&gt;elektrische&lt;/strong&gt; und/oder &lt;strong data-start=&quot;647&quot; data-end=&quot;674&quot;&gt;kältetechnische Anlagen&lt;/strong&gt; – je nach deinem fachlichen Schwerpunkt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;130&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;Wartung &amp;amp; Reparatur:&lt;/strong&gt; Eigenverantwortliche Durchführung von Wartungen, Inspektionen und Reparaturen an Förderbändern, Automatisierungs- und Kältetechniksystemen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;Störungsbehebung:&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose und Behebung technischer Störungen – inkl. SPS, Sensorik und Antriebstechnik; Eskalation an Lieferanten oder Management bei Bedarf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;466&quot; data-end=&quot;486&quot;&gt;Ursachenanalyse:&lt;/strong&gt; Durchführung von Root-Cause-Analysen (z. B. 5-Why) bei Ausfällen und Unterstützung bei technischen Fragestellungen im Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;619&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;Technische Projekte:&lt;/strong&gt; Mitwirkung an Projekten, Inbetriebnahmen und Audits – inklusive Sicherheitsprüfungen und Abnahme neuer Anlagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;760&quot; data-end=&quot;782&quot;&gt;Wissensweitergabe:&lt;/strong&gt; Fachliche Anleitung von Junior-Techniker:innen sowie Weitergabe von Know-how in Mechanik, Elektrik, Pneumatik und Kältetechnik.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;915&quot; data-end=&quot;933&quot;&gt;Dokumentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Sorgfältige Pflege aller Wartungs- und Reparaturmaßnahmen im CMMS und relevanten Tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1026&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;Kontinuierliche Verbesserung:&lt;/strong&gt; Aktive Mitarbeit an Initiativen zur Steigerung von Effizienz, Sicherheit und Anlagenverfügbarkeit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;Lieferantenkoordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Bewertung externer Services und Feedback zu Qualität und SLA-Einhaltung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine abgeschlossene technische oder handwerkliche Ausbildung, z. B. als Elektroniker, Mechatroniker, Industriemechaniker oder vergleichbar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freude daran, praktisch zu arbeiten und technische Probleme zu lösen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse (mindestens B2)&lt;/strong&gt;, da die Kommunikation mit externen Dienstleistern und Handwerksfirmen Teil des Arbeitsalltags ist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft zur Arbeit im Schichtsystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Englischkenntnisse sind von Vorteil, aber keine Voraussetzung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Interne Schulungen und ein jährliches Budget für deine persönliche und berufliche Weiterbildung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_-Boxen:&lt;/strong&gt; Exklusive Mitarbeiterrabatte auf unsere leckeren Factor_-Mahlzeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergütung &amp;amp; Urlaub:&lt;/strong&gt; Wettbewerbsfähiges Gehalt sowie 30 bezahlte Urlaubstage pro Jahr.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gesundheit &amp;amp; Wohlbefinden:&lt;/strong&gt; Zugang zu Wellbeing-Initiativen – bald ergänzt durch attraktive Fitnessangebote.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zukunft &amp;amp; Flexibilität:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir arbeiten kontinuierlich daran, unser Benefit-Portfolio zu erweitern – u. a. mit Mobilitätsunterstützung und betrieblicher Altersvorsorge, um dir noch mehr Sicherheit und Flexibilität zu bieten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#basecampwarehouse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&amp;nbsp;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Mobile Engineer in the Consumer Foundations tribe, you will provide technical leadership for the evolution of our mobile platform. Working alongside engineering and product teams, you will help shape the core architecture, tooling, and developer experience of our mobile applications. This is a high-visibility, high-impact opportunity to contribute to the transition of our white-labeled, multi-brand application from a native brownfield React Native setup to a highly scalable Greenfield architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine hands-on engineering with technical leadership, helping teams adopt scalable architectural patterns, shared tooling, and engineering best practices across the mobile ecosystem. By designing automated guardrails, shared infrastructure, and scalable developer workflows, you will enable a growing team of 50+ mobile engineers to deliver high-quality software safely, independently, and efficiently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our stack: &lt;strong&gt;Core:&lt;/strong&gt; React Native, iOS (Swift), Android (Kotlin) &lt;strong&gt;Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Monorepos, White-labeling, shared npm packages &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Bitrise, Expo (Future) &lt;strong&gt;Observability &amp;amp; Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Honeycomb, Maestro E2E&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Architectural Direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape the architectural direction and contribute to the execution of our brownfield-to-greenfield React Native migration within a white-labeled, multi-brand application ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Infrastructure for Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and evolve the long-term scalability and developer experience of the React Native monorepo, enabling seamless concurrent development for 50+ mobile engineers across multiple squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future-Proof Shared Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and scale the monorepo to host shared npm packages designed for future cross-platform code sharing with web repositories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion CI/CD &amp;amp; Developer Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and optimize our current CI/CD pipelines in Bitrise while helping shape our future migration to Expo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate Quality &amp;amp; Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Enable product teams to make data-informed decisions by building robust tracing and dashboards in Honeycomb. Help establish and scale end-to-end testing frameworks across the organization using Maestro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Technical Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Engineering Managers and Product stakeholders to review technical solutions, provide architectural guidance, and promote engineering best practices across squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen Application Health &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead technical efforts to improve application health and reliability by designing observability tooling, performance reporting, incident response practices, and operational guardrails that improve system stability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Technical Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Facilitate architectural decision-making, choosing the appropriate level of documentation—from lightweight design proposals to formal RFCs and ADRs—based on the scope and impact of each initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;React Native &amp;amp; Native Mobile Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep, production-tested expertise in React Native, combined with strong knowledge of both iOS and Android. You understand React Native&#39;s internal mechanics, performance profiling, native code bridging, platform-specific features and constraints, as well as the respective app store release processes. You are comfortable working across the full mobile stack to build and scale enterprise-grade applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience using AI coding agents (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) in production or near-production work. You think beyond prompts to context engineering—structuring specifications, tool configurations, and information flow so agents produce reliable output. You can decompose complex workflows across agentic components, identify unreliable outputs, and introduce the appropriate guardrails where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale-Minded Developer Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of managing and optimizing workflows, linting, caching, and build times for large engineering organizations (50+ developers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Monorepo Thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience managing complex build configurations, white-label scaling, and monorepo architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Autonomy &amp;amp; Accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable operating with a high degree of autonomy, making sound technical decisions in ambiguous situations, and supporting teams during complex production incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Cross-Squad Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a proven ability to influence technical direction across multiple engineering teams through expertise, communication, and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Amsterdam People team is looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Office &amp;amp; Events Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to make sure the office is a place where people genuinely enjoy working. You&#39;ll be the first point of contact for everything happening in the space: from day-to-day requests, to health &amp;amp; safety, engagement activities and to the events that bring the Benelux team together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your organizational skills and creativity will directly shape how employees experience HelloFresh besides their core work, and you&#39;ll have the freedom to run with ideas that make the office a little more fun, functional, and welcoming, while also helping build a workplace that reflects and celebrates our diversity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that we are unable to provide visa sponsorship for this role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the day-to-day running&lt;/strong&gt; of the Amsterdam office, making sure it&#39;s a safe, well-maintained, and welcoming space to work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as the first point of contact&lt;/strong&gt; for colleagues and guests, managing meeting rooms, reception flow, and requests with speed and a smile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Liaise with building management&lt;/strong&gt; on facility-related matters and coordinate with vendors and service providers to keep the office running smoothly, while managing supply budgets and stock levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate health &amp;amp; safety&lt;/strong&gt; and facilities compliance for the office (e.g. fire safety, ergonomics, BHV coordination)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support new hire onboarding&lt;/strong&gt; with desk setup, welcome packages, and smooth first-day logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organize team moments, events, and celebrations that drive employee engagement: &lt;/strong&gt;from birthdays and anniversaries to team sessions,&amp;nbsp; bringing your own creative ideas to the table&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the DE&amp;amp;I calendar, &lt;/strong&gt;coordinating initiatives and observances that help build an inclusive office culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate Happiness Survey findings&lt;/strong&gt; into concrete actions and support internal communications, including the People newsletter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1-2 years of experience &lt;/strong&gt;in office management, hospitality, or a similar coordinating role, with a strong service- and people-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid organizational and planning skills&lt;/strong&gt;, comfortable juggling day-to-day requests alongside longer-term projects and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re creative and able to improvise&lt;/strong&gt;, staying calm under pressure, whether that&#39;s last-minute event changes or an unexpected office hiccup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with everyday office tools &lt;/strong&gt;(e.g. Google Workspace, Slack, Canva) and openness to picking up new systems as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discretion and a trustworthy approach&lt;/strong&gt; to sensitive moments and information, paired with flexibility for occasional irregular hours around events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in both English and Dutch &lt;/strong&gt;is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A passion for food and cooking&lt;/strong&gt; is a big plus — you may help prepare lunches or occasionally step in for our Kitchen Hero during their absence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;&lt;em&gt;Benefits at Work&lt;/em&gt;&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop, a home office setup budget, and contribute to the Bedrijfspensioenfonds Levensmiddelen pension scheme (2026 rate 27.6%; employer pays 19.64%, employee pays 7.96%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland, free bootcamp classes (Amsterdam), and free subscriptions to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a 7,5% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis in 2026.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 24 days of annual leave (pro-rated), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, plus €0.23 per km for car and bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible employees can work from another country for up to 8 weeks per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with our &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; mindset:&amp;nbsp; access internal/external opportunities, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated annual budget to help you keep learning, developing new skills, and growing your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€3.00/day), weekly vrij-mi-bo (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; sits within the UK Operational Excellence team and plays a vital role in driving the delivery, implementation, and continuous improvement of production technologies, processes, and business propositions across HelloFresh distribution centres in the UK market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly project-driven, hybrid role designed for someone who loves working with data just as much as being present on the shop floor. You will combine disciplined project management with hands-on operational execution to improve key operational KPIs—specifically focusing on Error Rate, Minutes per Box, and productivity. From initial scoping to final on-floor adoption, you will bridge the gap between data-driven insights and real-world operational impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Define project scope, milestones, and success measures to lead technical and non-technical Opex projects from initiation through to successful implementation on time and within budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Lean Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Support and lead Yellow and Green Belt projects utilizing Lean Six Sigma methodologies to identify bottlenecks, eliminate waste, and drive a culture of continuous improvement on the shop floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis &amp;amp; Actionable Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze complex operational data using tools like Excel, Google Sheets, Grafana, Tableau, or SQL, translating these metrics into actionable business decisions and measurable KPI improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital &amp;amp; Low-Code Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage AI tools, modern digital solutions, and low-code/no-code platforms (e.g., PowerApps, AppSheet) to build practical on-floor tools that bridge the gap between data insights and daily operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and influence diverse, cross-functional teams and maintain strong relationships with stakeholders from shop-floor operatives up to senior management through disciplined meetings and clear, structured communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change Management &amp;amp; Floor Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a strong, visible presence on the production floor to drive change initiatives, ensure the sustainable adoption of new processes/technologies, and support trials or tests alongside the Senior Opex Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Issue Mitigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively recognize project risks and operational bottlenecks; create robust avoidance plans, take corrective measures early, and provide transparent status reporting to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standardisation &amp;amp; Training:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive operational standards in line with standard work principles, documenting process improvements and providing training to onsite teams on Continuous Improvement methodologies and techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Industrial Engineering, Supply Chain Management, Operations, or a related technical field (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3 years of experience in food manufacturing, high-volume fulfillment, or packaging sectors (highly preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading or contributing to operational excellence, continuous improvement, or technology implementation projects (essential).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical knowledge of Lean Methodology, its tools, and standard work principles (Green/Yellow Belt level) (essential).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in data analysis tools (Excel, Google Sheets, Grafana, Tableau, or SQL) (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern digital solutions, AI tools, and low-code/no-code application development (PowerApps, AppSheet) (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working with Warehouse Management Systems (WMS) or Warehouse Control Systems (WCS) is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for combining analytical thinking with hands-on, real-time problem solving on a fast-paced production floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An engaging, collaborative personality with the ability to influence cross-functional teams and effectively communicate complex updates to various audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented, with a proven ability to manage multiple competing priorities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Dog friendly office! (London site only)&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The Windmill, 1 Holme Lane, Spondon, Derby, DE21 7HW&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Operations Manager, you will work directly with our Senior Operations Manager and will be responsible for the running of successful shifts to ensure you have a skilled, motivated team so that all of our customers&#39; boxes are packed perfectly each and every time. We look for people who demonstrate a real customer obsession, earn trust quickly and have experience in developing the best talent the industry has to offer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the receipt of our products through to production and dispatch of our customer boxes, through our operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of Shift Managers and Team Leaders to deliver shift performance and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver the shift in line with our key KPIs surrounding health and safety, quality, food safety, and team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamically resolve issues to reduce the impact they could have on the performance of the shift and the impact this could have on our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and empower the operational team through several layers of indirect reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think outside the box (pun intended) about our business, delivering impactful projects in areas from customer experience to waste management and lean production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stamp your mark on our growing HelloFresh employer brand, recruiting the future of the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, be from an Operations background with experience in managing a large indirect team in a high-performing operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in working with various warehouse management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated adaptability to a fast-paced and constantly changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propensity to lead from the front, developing those around you to be better than yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to engage and motivate not only direct reports but peers and supporting functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communication skills and decision-making capabilities. The logical approach to decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, enthusiasm, commitment, and a can-do flexible attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of health and safety and its application in a warehouse/production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with / strong understanding of a food hygiene environment and automated operations is beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Spondon, Derby&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Schedule: &lt;/strong&gt;Wednesday to Saturday rotating days and nights every 3 months 7:00 - 7:00&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
