&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based at our head office in Chippendale, the Payroll Officer will play a key role in ensuring our people are paid accurately and on time, overseeing and processing the end-to-end weekly payroll for Youfoodz, approximately 800 employees, while collaborating closely with operations management teams across the AU business. Reporting to the Senior Payroll Manager, you&#39;ll sit at the centre of a fast-paced, high-volume payroll operation and help design, develop and adapt internal tools that support and optimise critical business processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and oversee the full end-to-end weekly payroll cycle for Youfoodz, covering approximately 800 employees, ensuring accurate and timely remuneration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse and validate time and attendance records, ensuring strict compliance with relevant Modern Awards, enterprise agreements and company policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and reconcile complex payroll calculations, including novated leases, salary packaging arrangements and statutory deductions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and track complex terminations, redundancy packages, final leave payouts, and Workers&#39; Compensation (WC) claims/payments in strict alignment with Australian legislation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Workforce Planning (WFP) and regional operations management teams to resolve scheduling variances, audit roster data and streamline back-office workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and safeguard data integrity for employee master records across all integrated payroll, HRIS and time-tracking systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver exceptional internal customer service, acting as the primary point of contact for employee payroll queries and resolving escalations efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Payroll Manager with ad-hoc tasks and duties as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2 years&#39; proven experience running high-volume, full-cycle end-to-end payroll within Australia (experience managing payroll for 500+ employees highly regarded)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, practical knowledge of Australian payroll legislation, Superannuation Guarantee (SG) requirements, PAYG tax and complex Modern Award interpretation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong capability processing advanced calculations, specifically novated lease reconciliations, complex termination payouts and Workers&#39; Compensation processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with modern payroll platforms (ADP Payforce experience desirable but not essential), time and attendance software, and strong Excel skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills with the ability to collaborate cross-functionally with operations managers and Workforce Planning teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-focused, with a love of nailing daily, weekly and monthly routines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and assertive, you take real ownership and think beyond the brief&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident communicator across all levels of the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to be part of a fast-growing food business that&#39;s changing the way people eat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HelloFresh Academies - internal learning &amp;amp; development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date:&lt;/strong&gt; Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent full time role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must have the right to work full-time in Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
