&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in &lt;strong&gt;Inoza Tower, BGC&lt;/strong&gt; that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Payroll Team Leader&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a key role in ensuring accurate, timely, and compliant payroll operations while leading and developing a high-performing payroll team. You will serve as a trusted partner to employees, managers, and other stakeholders, providing expert guidance on payroll-related concerns while driving process improvements, strengthening controls, and supporting the development of effective payroll policies and reporting frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end payroll processing&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure accuracy, timeliness, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review payroll calculations, adjustments, and payroll imports before the finalization of payroll registers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage payroll calendars, advisories, deadlines, and cut-off dates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop the payroll team to consistently deliver accurate and timely payroll processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct training, coaching, mentoring, and knowledge-sharing sessions within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle complex and escalated payroll queries and concerns, providing timely and effective resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted payroll advisor to employees, managers, stakeholders, and other departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert guidance and insights on payroll-related matters and ensure concerns are properly addressed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and develop payroll policies, procedures, and internal controls to strengthen payroll operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement &lt;strong&gt;continuous improvement initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; across payroll processes, systems, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with applicable statutory and tax requirements related to employee compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the preparation of employees’ &lt;strong&gt;annualized compensation&lt;/strong&gt; and the release of &lt;strong&gt;BIR Form 2316&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support month-end and year-end payroll and financial reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Senior Accountants and the Finance Manager in preparing substantial reports and supporting internal and external audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other payroll-related functions and responsibilities as assigned from time to time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in &lt;strong&gt;Philippine payroll operations&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably with end-to-end payroll processing experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in payroll calculations, annualization, statutory compliance, and BIR Form 2316 preparation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience leading, supervising, mentoring, or managing a payroll team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of payroll policies, procedures, internal controls, and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with a strong attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage confidential and sensitive payroll information with professionalism and integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to work effectively with employees, managers, Finance, HR, and other business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with international stakeholders is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and the ability to manage multiple payroll deadlines and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A continuous improvement mindset with the ability to identify opportunities to improve processes, systems, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership, coaching, and team development skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office, particularly &lt;strong&gt;Excel&lt;/strong&gt;, and familiarity with payroll or HR systems is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BGC &lt;em&gt;(7th Floor, Inoza Tower, 40th Street, BGC, Taguig City)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
