&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in Inoza tower, BGC that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will take on a key responsibility in ensure all day to day administrative tasks are completed in order to enable Hellofresh Distribution Centers in the network to run successfully. Shared Services Associates will work closely with various departments, and are committed to teamwork, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide generalist support to the facility in all areas of Human Resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide payroll support and data entry responsibilities for timekeeping accuracy and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize and reference local HR tools, systems, and data sources to perform roster audit exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update and audit shift codes &amp;amp; schedules in ADP to ensure roster accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage &amp;amp; audit employees profiles in Workday to make sure they are properly reflecting their shifts, managers, and employment status&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain employee records for HelloFresh and Temporary employees to ensure accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage associate callout system including verification of time off hours, use data exports to support operations shift planning, and use system functionality to send out critical site communications to applicable employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with new hire orientations as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet SLA requirements for resolving associate and manager inquiries presented through Workday Help&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and execute on special projects as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other related tasks that may be required from time to time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Human Resources, and/or related field or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least three years of solid and comprehensive experience of the same capacity, human resources and/or HR Generalist experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of payroll and timekeeping processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of database software, email systems, and office software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient of HR processes, systems and tools within the various stages of the employee lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has proven skills in managing, understanding, execution of ERP/HRIS/Payroll systems and tools, database functionality, Workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#helloconnect&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#hcgreenhouse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced People Technology Engineering Manager to join the HelloFresh People Technology leadership team. This role leads the Engineering discipline within People Technology and is responsible for the architecture, capability and delivery of the technical solutions that connect, automate and increasingly enhance our employee technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, the squad’s primary focus is Workday integrations and connected enterprise systems. Over time, its remit will expand across workflow automation, low-code development, AI-enabled solutions and modern engineering capabilities. You will act as the engineering architect and design authority for People Technology, setting technical direction, shaping architecture and establishing standards that balance delivery speed, scalability, security, maintainability and long-term sustainability. This includes maintaining strong expertise in Workday integrations and emerging platform capabilities such as Workday Orchestrate and Extend / Build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also lead, develop and performance-manage a team of engineers, building capability across integrations, automation and AI engineering. You will create a high-performing environment grounded in technical quality, accountability and continuous learning, while ensuring the squad has the skills, capacity and ways of working needed to meet both current and future demand. While you may remain hands-on where appropriate, your primary focus will be technical leadership, people development, capability building and delivery oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the senior business partner for engineering, you will represent the discipline across People Technology and work closely with the People function and stakeholders from across the Group. You will help shape roadmaps, influence prioritisation and investment decisions, and translate business needs into scalable engineering solutions. You will also play a central role in determining where AI, automation and intelligent workflows can create measurable value, both by enabling the squad to deliver faster and by building AI-enabled solutions for the wider People Technology organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. We value diverse experiences and recognise there are many paths into engineering leadership. Even if you do not meet every requirement, we would still like to hear from you if you believe you would thrive in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the engineering architect and design authority for People Technology, owning technical standards, patterns and architectural principles across Workday and connected enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the end-to-end engineering landscape and make architectural decisions that balance delivery speed, scalability, security, maintainability and long-term sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of the squad from a primarily integrations-focused team into a broader People Technology engineering capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of modern Workday capabilities, including Workday Orchestrate, Extend, Build and future platform innovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish AI engineering capability within the People Technology tribe and identify opportunities to apply AI, automation and intelligent workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI-assisted engineering practices that improve productivity, quality and delivery speed, while ensuring responsible security, privacy and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and performance-manage engineers, building capability across integrations, APIs, automation, low-code development and AI-enabled solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and manage team capacity, resourcing and capability against current priorities and future demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior engineering business partner to People Technology leadership, Product Managers, Functional Leads and business stakeholders, shaping roadmaps, prioritisation and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business needs into scalable technical solutions, resolve complex engineering challenges and maintain oversight of technical debt, dependencies, risks and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically 8–12+ years of experience in integrations, systems engineering, software engineering or related technical roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on experience with Workday integrations and the broader Workday technical ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of APIs, middleware, enterprise integration platforms and modern integration architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience acting as a technical architect, design authority or senior engineering lead in a complex enterprise environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing technical specialists, including performance management, coaching and capability building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Workday Orchestrate, Extend and Build, or the ability to rapidly develop expertise in emerging Workday capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying automation, AI-assisted development or AI-enabled solutions in an enterprise technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgement in evaluating emerging technologies, translating them into practical business outcomes and balancing short-term delivery with long-term sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and business-partnering skills, with the ability to influence through clarity, judgement and technical credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in complex, global organisations with sensitive employee data, supported by a relevant degree or equivalent practical experience and fluency in English.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Workday Sr HRIS Analyst will be the lead for &lt;strong&gt;Workday ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;, which includes system configuration, enhancements, and deployment efforts. This subject matter expert will be a point of contact for the HR Technology team and Centers of Excellence (COEs) and responsible for researching and configuring technical solutions. This individual will play an essential role in the deployment and ongoing operations of HelloFresh’s enterprise HR tech stack. You will have an immediate impact on improving employee experience and organizational&amp;nbsp; productivity through consistent processes, tools, and support and have visibility and exposure to our global HR technology ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Workday technical implementation and enhancement activities for various modules including Time Tracking and Absence (strong hands on configuration experience&lt;strong&gt; is mandatory&lt;/strong&gt;), Benefits (US) , Payroll (US), and interdependencies between the modules,&amp;nbsp; and serve as system administrator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with HR Technology peers, Field HR and Shared Services teams, and Benefits and Payroll&amp;nbsp; teams to ensure optimal utilization of Workday including configurations, business processes, data management, security architecture, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with 3rd party technical consultants, IT and cross functional partners to configure systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve complex issues and defects with exceptional customer service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in design, planning, implementation and support of business process configuration, security, and administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously increases knowledge in HR technology by understanding system capabilities, staying informed on product capabilities and trends, and interacting with the Workday community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree from an accredited college or university, preferably in Information Systems and Technology, Human Resources, Business Administration, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 or more years of configuration and administration experience and advanced subject matter expertise with Workday Time Tracking and Absence (&lt;strong&gt;mandatory&lt;/strong&gt;) , Benefits and Payroll (US).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Time Tracking&amp;nbsp; implementation preferred (1 full life cycle is strongly preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of US Payroll, GL, regulations/rules.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the time calculations configuration, time calculation tags, shift differentials and attendance points,&amp;nbsp; eligibility rules,&amp;nbsp; etc, all related configuration and downstream impacts to payroll and other systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on knowledge supporting Workday configuration including (but not limited to) – BPs, notifications, condition rules, custom reports, EIBs, Security, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience with rolling out bi-annual Workday releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agile development frameworks and tools (e.g., Jira, Scrum, Kanban)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills with the ability to communicate effectively with stakeholders across all organizational levels, including technical &amp;amp; non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizational and planning skills, including being able to work reliably and efficiently under demanding deadlines with minimal supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; 401k company match that vests immediately upon participation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave of 16 weeks &amp;amp; PTO policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$0 monthly premium and other flexible health plans&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;85% discount on your subscription to HelloFresh (as well as other product initiatives) &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
