&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Principal Product Manager to own the referral product: the experience across our app and websites, the behavioral mechanics that get customers to invite their friends, and the systems that let us experiment and improve. You&#39;ll partner closely with Marketing to build the experience that drives commercial outcomes. How we get there is yours to define. Beyond that, there&#39;s genuine room to build new forms of viral growth that go past referrals as they exist now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The referrals domain — one of HelloFresh&#39;s most important sources of new subscribers — lives in our Engagement tribe, which deepens customers&#39; relationships with our brands as HelloFresh evolves beyond the weekly meal kit subscription into a daily kitchen companion that earns a place in customers&#39; lives. It&#39;s a highly visible mandate with sustained attention from senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own&lt;/strong&gt; the vision, roadmap, and strategy for the referral product across app and web, and the behavioral mechanics that turn customer engagement into referral growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; the metric framework that connects the customer experience to referral behavior and, with Marketing, to commercial outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt; the mechanics that make people want to share — the incentives, rewards, and moments that turn a good experience into a referral&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize&lt;/strong&gt; the referral journey end to end, from the moment a customer decides to share through to the friend&#39;s first order&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Push&lt;/strong&gt; beyond the referral program as it exists today to build new engines for viral growth — for example, giving customers reasons to create and share content that puts our brands in front of their own networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; a fast experimentation practice — isolate levers, run clean tests, and kill what doesn&#39;t work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner&lt;/strong&gt; with our marketing and CRM teams to integrate program communications — push, in-app, email — into the referral experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner&lt;/strong&gt; closely with commercial counterparts on reward economics and offer strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage&lt;/strong&gt; directly with C-level and senior leadership to communicate direction, defend tradeoffs, and report results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
