&lt;li&gt;Significant experience as a product leader at a large-scale B2C company — you&#39;ve built consumer products at scale and have strong intuition for customer behavior, motivation, and the emotional drivers behind why people share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience in referrals, virality, or growth — you&#39;ve owned an acquisition or engagement loop and know how to move it. Experience with a product that has real viral growth built in is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven, commercial mindset — you understand how rewards and incentives shape customer behavior and business outcomes, and you make those tradeoffs with evidence rather than instinct&lt;/li&gt;
