&lt;li&gt;Maintain and set up equipment, execute recipes in large batches, and ensure the highest quality of all food products prepared at different kitchen stations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare raw ingredients, including brining and marinating of various proteins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare recipe components using grills, braisers, ovens, mixers, blenders, and other industrial kitchen equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across all areas of the production facility, including refrigerated areas, and perform tasks ranging from receiving, cooking, assembly of recipes, and packing customer orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the kitchen operates with the highest health and safety standards, and is in alignment with federal and provincial health and safety requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
