&lt;li&gt;Make tomorrow better than today! Drive continuous improvement in the DC by engaging team members and broader HF stakeholders in identifying opportunities, facilitating root-cause analysis, implementing corrective actions, and delivering positive and focused change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, roll out, and manage standard operating procedures, visual tools, and checklists to ensure we are a process-driven operations; Onboard, train, and continuously develop team members to ensure clear understanding of roles and responsibilities, tasks, process and procedures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a positive team environment that prioritizes safety, strives for accountability &amp;amp; respect, enables continuous learning and promotes&amp;nbsp; open communication and candid feedback&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
