&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Waste Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a Full Time (ONSITE) position at the Goodyear, AZ Factor production facility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Production Waste Analyst role is focused on waste identification and mitigation within Factor&#39;s Kitchen, Production and Fulfillment areas. You will be monitoring inventory utilization, flagging at-risk product, and partnering with onsite operators to reduce waste before it occurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor inventory positions and product utilization across Kitchen, Production &amp;amp; Fulfillment areas to identify waste risk in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with onsite operators and internal logistics team to intervene on at-risk inventory — including near-expiry product, excess stock, and slow-moving SKUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and document waste events across the Kitchen, Production and Fulfillment areas, including root cause and resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support waste projection modeling by providing accurate, timely data on inventory status across external sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze waste trends and surface patterns to the Waste Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain inventory data accuracy in ERP/WMS systems; flag discrepancies promptly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the onsite Operators and DC Waste Manager on network-level waste reduction initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to regular waste reporting cadences with data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in supply chain operations, inventory management, or logistics — preferably with exposure to food production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating external partner relationships and working in settings without direct site authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with proficiency in Excel/Google Sheets and inventory reporting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of ERP/WMS systems and inventory control principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in supply chain, Business, Logistics, or a related field preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
