&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lead, mentor, and optimize a team of Purchasing Coordinators handling pan-European purchasing operations across key categories (e.g., Protein, Grocery, Packaging).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inbound Supply Chain:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage end-to-end category operations, including supplier performance, forecasting, procurement, and delivery tracking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Accountability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hold final accountability for critical metrics such as OTIF, waste mitigation, ASN compliance, and customer error reduction.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partner with international supply chain cluster teams to align on strategic initiatives and establish robust daily operational governance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Leverage data-driven reporting frameworks to proactively identify, escalate, and mitigate supply chain risks across Europe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resource Allocation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Review team capacity dynamically with leadership to distribute workloads effectively and scale service capabilities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Champion process optimizations, propose software/tooling enhancements, and build standardized SOPs to streamline team onboarding and daily operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Monitor service performance metrics and deliver clear, actionable insights to key business stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject Matter Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Serve as an escalation point and subject matter expert, role-modeling agile problem-solving behavior under pressure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
