&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Supply Chain Management, Operations Management, Business Administration, or any related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At least 3 years of experience in procurement, supply chain, or data entry/administrative operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
