&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Excellent English communication skills, both written and verbal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Proficiency in additional European languages such as German, Dutch, French, Spanish, or Italian is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
