&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our new Quality Control Officer, you will play a vital role in ensuring our customers receive the highest quality meal kits. Based in our Jandakot distribution centre, you will support the QC Lead in maintaining food safety standards and overseeing the smooth operation of our assembly lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Jandakot, Perth and reporting to the QC Lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate daily quality assurance and food safety compliance checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support the QC team during your shift with day-to-day operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support supplier management, stock rejections, and stock management processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate, document, and report non-conformances in line with our standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee pest control and cleaning contractors to ensure regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify opportunities to improve our Quality Management System.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 years of experience in a Quality Assurance or Quality Control role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sound understanding of Food Safety standards (HACCP/GMP) within food manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organisational and time management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and communication abilities with a mentoring mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team player with a flexible &quot;can-do&quot; attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to meet and exceed quality control standards with keen attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance for career advancement in a leading food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic and supportive team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full-time role. You must have the right to work full-time in Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Jandakot, Perth - Parking on-site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Roles at HelloFresh may be available for job share, along with other flexible arrangements. Get in touch if this is something you&#39;d like to explore.&lt;/p&gt;
