&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you ready to join an exciting and dynamic team? We are looking for a highly motivated individual to join us as a Sanitation Associate. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Sanitation Associate, you will report to the Sanitation Supervisor and will be responsible for maintaining the overall sanitation within the facility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Breaking down cardboard and loading it into the compactor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping the production floors clean of debris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sweep and mop the floors as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dispose of waste generated by the production lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use approved chemicals to clean and disinfect surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refill soap and hand towels in the bathrooms and lunchroom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete the daily sanitation paperwork as per FSQA requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General cleaning of all facility areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in compliance with OH&amp;amp;S acts and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 6 months to 1 year experience in a food processing, manufacturing or service industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience standing for prolonged periods of time including regular bending, twisting and walking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate in English, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize, remain calm and alert while multitasking in a fast-paced and deadline oriented environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to work in a dynamic environment, which can include warm/humid or cold&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to push, pull, and lift up to 50lbs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and within a team environment, in addition to having strong interpersonal skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work overtime, weekends, evenings and holidays as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 year experience in Sanitation or Janitorial is considered an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and health benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Shift premiums are available for afternoon and overnight shifts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;75% discount on HelloFresh or Chefs Plate weekly box subscription&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;High impact work to help feed thousands of families in Canada&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Opportunity to learn and grow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with a hard-working and supportive team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#JD1008&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Mississauga, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$18&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$18 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_ &lt;/strong&gt;a brand of HelloFresh is seeking a Sanitation Manager to develop, implement and continuously improve on sanitation programs, policies and key performance indicators (KPIs) for the facility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift- Thursday-Sunday-&amp;nbsp; 8:00pm - 5:30am&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement strategic sanitation programs, policies, and procedures to ensure that sanitary performance meets Factor standards as well as supports Food Safety requirements and regulatory compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and write detailed procedures and SOPs for all plant equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update master cleaning schedule for plant according to GMP and Factor guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage sanitation chemical supply and inventory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with hourly associates, managers, carrier partners, vendors, and various departments within HelloFresh&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively engage, coach, motivate and lead the sanitation team for career progression and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in audits, facility inspections and coordinate&amp;nbsp; pre-operational inspection with QA Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement all sanitation related training for sanitation and plant employees as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all safety requirements related to sanitation are met including proper chemical storage, MSDS, PPE and procedures&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bold: you are a true entrepreneurial spirit and not afraid to take calculated risks to disrupt the status quo; you&#39;re a visionary leader that listens to your team and values their ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical: data is your friend; you&#39;re able to translate numbers into action and pave the way for efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic: you recognize and resolve situations that are ambiguous or challenging, focus effort on meeting or exceeding goals, and pave the way for efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem-solver: you are a critical thinker who uses logic to identify alternatives and present solutions to complex problems while thinking in terms of contingency plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused: slightly obsessive when it comes to customer experience and strive to deliver a product that is second to none&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in food science or related business equivalent/2-4 years of plant quality/food safety/sanitation experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have the knowledge and skills required to work in a fast paced and challenging environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, interpersonal, and time management skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must display strong leadership qualities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the GMP, HACCP and Environmental sanitation program is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with third party regulatory agencies such as&amp;nbsp; SQF, FDA, USDA is preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands and can apply basic microbiological principle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Factor #JD1008&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Arizona Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$77,175&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$89,250 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Als&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Schichtleitung Automatisierungstechnik (w/m/d/x)&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;überwachst Du die Wartungsarbeiten und stellst die optimale Betreuung im Rahmen deiner Schicht sicher. Du bindest Deine Teammitglieder effektiv ein, motivierst und coachest sie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;In Zusammenarbeit mit dem Instandhaltungs-Führungsteam unterstützt Du bei der Weiterentwicklung der Lagerwartungs-Roadmap und setzt den Standard für betriebliche Effizienz an unserem Standort Barleben bei Magdeburg.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du überwachst wartungsbezogene Prozesse, einschließlich der Wartung von Automatisierungs- und Fertigungsanlagen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du motivierst und inspirierst dein Team und schaffst eine positive Teamdynamik, die alle Mitarbeiter dazu ermutigt, Feedback zu geben und Veränderungen von innen heraus voranzutreiben&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du betreust die Dienstleister und erleichterst die geplanten und ungeplanten Reparaturen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du stellst sicher, dass die Wartungsvorschriften eingehalten werden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du identifizierst Probleme und bringst Ideen zur Verbesserung ein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du bringst mindestens 2 Jahre Erfahrung in der Wartung von automatisierten Förderanlagen vorzugsweise aus den Branchen Lebensmittel-/Getränke-/E-Commerce-/Fertigwaren-/Vertriebsbranche mit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du hast eine erfolgreich abgeschlossene Ausbildung (Mechanik, Elektro oder Automatisierungstechnik) oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation und mehrere Jahre Berufserfahrung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du verfügst über eine ausgeprägte Kommunikationsfähigkeit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du hast Erfahrung im Führen von Teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du arbeitest selbstständig, strukturiert und gewissenhaft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du bringst eine Begeisterung für die Arbeit in einem Start-up-Umfeld mit und fühlst Dich in einem Umfeld wohl, das sich schnell entwickelt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Du bringst Bereitschaft zur Schichtarbeit mit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz &lt;/strong&gt;in einem tollen Team&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Barleben (Magdeburg)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bis zu 70% Rabatt auf unsere HelloFresh Boxen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;durch interne Trainings - &lt;strong&gt;nach der Probezeit ist die Förderung der Meisterschule möglich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergünstigte Fitnessangebote &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;bei Urban Sports Club&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unterstützung Deines Wohlbefindens&lt;/strong&gt; in&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Kooperation mit der Headspace-App&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 Tage Urlaub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
