&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior-level expertise in at least one core language:&lt;/strong&gt; Go or Python. High proficiency in one stack is required, with a willingness to expand technical knowledge into Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid experience&lt;/strong&gt; building, deploying, and operating critical backend services in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical comfort&lt;/strong&gt; navigating distributed systems, messaging queues, containerization, and modern deployment infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong software engineering instincts&lt;/strong&gt;, including practical application of design methodologies like TDD, BDD, or DDD, and the ability to make sensible technical trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; to operate effectively inside an international, multi-disciplinary technical environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point:&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#ENGINEERING&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The HelloFresh Total Rewards Team is looking for an exceptionally detail-oriented and experienced Senior Benefits Associate to serve as the operational backbone for our comprehensive employee benefits programs across the US and Canada. This role is centered on flawless execution, ensuring regulatory compliance, and delivering a superior employee experience. You will manage the full lifecycle of benefits administration, from vendor oversight and meticulous data management to leading annual enrollment processes. If you are a proactive problem-solver with a deep commitment to data integrity and statutory compliance in a multi-national environment, this is your opportunity to directly impact the well-being of thousands of HelloFresh employees. The role is based in New York, NY.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities and Impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits Administration Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the end-to-end administrative management of all North American employee benefits, including health, dental, vision, wellness initiatives, retirement savings (401k/RRSP), and complex leave-of-absence plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance and Risk Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure absolute and timely compliance with all applicable US and Canadian statutory requirements, including but not limited to ERISA, ACA, HIPAA, COBRA, IRS regulations, Canadian Benefits and Pension legislation. Maintain documentation and support audits as required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Enrollment Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the successful execution of the annual open enrollment process, managing the project timeline, coordinating with internal teams, developing clear and compliant communication materials, and leading employee education sessions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Integrity and HRIS Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain meticulous accuracy of all benefits data within the HRIS (Workday) and other systems. Act as the primary liaison with Payroll to ensure accurate and timely deduction processing, reconciliation, and reporting. Data integrations/feeds with Payroll and external vendors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Analysis Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct detailed analysis of benefits utilization, cost drivers, and participation trends. Prepare comprehensive reports to support Total Rewards leadership in strategic decision-making and recommending data-backed program optimizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor and Partner Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary administrative contact for external benefits vendors and brokers. Monitor vendor service level agreements (SLAs), evaluate performance, assist with contract renewals, and support Request for Proposal (RFP) processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute the operational implementation and wind-down of new and sunset benefit programs, ensuring seamless transitions for employees and compliance across all systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 5 years of progressive experience in benefits program administration and operations within a complex, multi-state/multi-national organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Expert-level knowledge of US and Canadian statutory laws and benefits regulations (e.g., ERISA, ACA, HIPAA, COBRA,).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven proficiency in managing benefits modules within major HRIS platforms (e.g., Workday).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Associate or Bachelor&#39;s degree in Human Resources, Business, or a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional analytical skills, focused on maintaining data integrity, process optimization, and complex spreadsheet modeling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;French or Spanish language proficiency preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication skills, with the proven ability to translate complex benefits policies into clear, accessible language for diverse employee populations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3780&quot; data-end=&quot;3791&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and 401(k) with company match (vesting immediately upon participation)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO policy and 4 weeks of parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;$0 monthly premium and flexible health plans starting on day one&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;85% discount on your HelloFresh subscription and other product offerings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
