&lt;p&gt;#Data&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Senior Data Scientist is responsible for building, testing, and deploying statistical and machine learning models, and conducting data deep dives which drive a better understanding of our customers, products, and operations. Reporting to the Senior Manager, Data Science and Engineering, this role will be responsible for devising and building effective and scalable data-driven solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with data engineers, data analysts, enterprise architects and functional business units&amp;nbsp; to design and execute end-to-end AI integration strategies across business workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, building, fine-tuning, and deployment of data and AI solutions, including statistical models, ML pipelines, Generative AI applications, and advanced statistical analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and integrate AI models, APIs, and microservices into production environments, ensuring seamless operational performance, security, and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach junior data scientists on AI engineering, ML integration best practices, and effective data science project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date knowledge of emerging machine learning, deep learning, and Generative AI frameworks, identifying novel applications for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with Global data science teams to identify opportunities for cross-functional collaboration, code reviews, joint AI initiatives, and the adoption of new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development, implementation, and governance of the global MLOps and LLMOps platforms in Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience leading data science projects and driving quantifiable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of integrating AI models into existing business workflows and production software applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying business opportunities for AI and ML solutions, scoping and prioritizing projects, and structuring execution strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with MLOps/LLMOps frameworks, API integrations, and model monitoring/evaluation in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Python programming and modern ML/AI frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL querying skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in STEM, Economics, or Business preferred, or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
