&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;110 Spadina Ave. Unit 200, Toronto, ON, M5V 2K4, Canada&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Manager, Cost Performance and Supply Chain Optimization to oversee a portfolio of high-impact programs for our Canadian RTE brand (Factor_) aimed at enhancing business performance, leading cost optimization, and transforming operational capabilities. You will serve as the connective tissue between Finance, Operations, Procurement/Sourcing, Supply Planning, and Warehouse teams — owning the end-to-end COGS reporting cycle and leading Supply Chain optimization and continuous improvement projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take ownership of overall portfolio performance and management, including resourcing, planning, reporting, and governance. You will work directly with executive leadership to ensure alignment with organizational priorities in two critical areas, Cost Performance and Supply Chain Optimization initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the entire portfolio of initiatives to improve supply chain performance, ensuring alignment with organizational priorities, and offer hands-on guidance as necessary for the successful end-to-end execution of initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Cost Performance and Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the weekly Factor Canada COGS reporting cycle, analyze the weekly performance,&amp;nbsp; lead a weekly COGS Steerco, become the SME on COGS and operational spend, support financial budgeting and be actively involved in the month end close reconciliations between Finance and Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost Optimization and Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify cost reduction / cost optimization opportunities, apply root cause analysis frameworks to identify waste drivers, collaborate with cross-functional stakeholders across the business to validate and align on opportunities and design measurable improvement programs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define Data Infrastructure &amp;amp; Tool Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with Tech teams to define data architecture and data flows to build, stabilize, and improve supply chain performance. Being the primary point of contact to drive tech enablement for supply chain performance improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership on Offshore team capability: &lt;/strong&gt;Responsible for strengthening the offshore team (HelloConnect) performance and optimization to support the business requirements, including performance management, tasks and resources allocation to support across the supply chain.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving &amp;amp; Decision Recommendations:&lt;/strong&gt; Address complex problems across multiple business areas, utilizing technical problem-solving skills to analyze and present data to senior leadership to inform and guide strategic decision-making. Regularly brief the GM and Director/VP-level leaders; at weekly Steercos and quarterly budget review sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the key liaison across Finance, Procurement, Operations, Planning and Warehouse teams to analyze key issues, coordinate investigations, connect the dots to provide well-founded recommendations for informed decision-making.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Governance &amp;amp; Progress Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and maintain robust program governance and systems for the responsible&amp;nbsp; portfolio progress and outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Project Management Best Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach and educate stakeholders on project management tools and methodology, especially when stakeholders manage their own projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of consulting, project management, finance, inventory, manufacturing, and/or supply chain operations with a strong understanding of financial reporting and demonstrated capability in handling highly complex programs with significant impact and multiple dependencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of costs, budgets, P&amp;amp;L and waste&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing direct reports and/or project resources within a team setting and demonstrated ability to influence, communicate, and partner with cross-functional leaders to drive performance without direct line authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of supply chain and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proficiency in utilizing structured problem-solving methodologies and technical analysis approaches to investigate and resolve complex issues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in in Business, Management, Engineering, Computer Science or related fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of supply chain dynamics, data frameworks, and process improvement methodologies (e.g., Lean Six Sigma, workflow automation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with advanced operational modeling capabilities to dig into data and pull out clear, concise narratives for the executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in an unstructured, fast-paced, and constantly evolving high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#JD1003&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$116,130&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$126,130 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior Manager to lead price and discount strategy for a portfolio of our global brands, owning both the strategy and execution of our experimentation and optimization roadmap. This is a high visibility, high impact role as we work cross functionally to ensure delivery of a world-class experience for our customers and drive profitable, long term growth for the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategic Initiatives: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the conceptualization, execution, and optimization of complex price and discount strategies, ensuring alignment with overall business goals and market conditions and translating strategy into tangible action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Testing &amp;amp; Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, execute, and analyze innovative price and discount tests, utilizing advanced modeling techniques to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Closely monitor market trends for portfolio markets, inflationary pressures, and competitor strategies to identify opportunities for differentiation and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify new data-driven optimization opportunities, propose innovative solutions, and influence cross-functional teams and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Data Science to build advanced segmentation models and enhance attribution, ensuring strategic alignment across customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with senior leadership and global teams (e.g., Product, Marketing Analytics, Growth Marketing) to craft strategies and share recommendations that drive impactful decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in consulting, data analytics, or a price/discount-related role, with a strong track record of solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required, Master’s degree preferred in marketing, business or STEM-related fields (e.g. mathematics, engineering, computer science, economics, statistics, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical skills, including advanced command of Excel, SQL is a plus, with the ability to translate complex data into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience devising and measuring the effectiveness of strategic optimizations (including AB testing), with a proven track record from other data-rich business environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication skills with proven ability to engage with senior leadership and align on key initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with diverse teams, including Product, Marketing, and Data Science, in a fast-paced, matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating ambiguity and adapting quickly to evolving priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$136,710&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$158,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, Global Price &amp;amp; Discount Strategy, you will shape the economics behind our global food solutions group and the world&#39;s leading meal kit company, active in 17 countries across 3 continents. You will shape how millions of customers experience our product, driving one of the company’s most impactful levers of growth: pricing and discounts. Challenges you’ll solve include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What is the right price positioning in each of our markets?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we acquire customers more cost-efficiently?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we design incentives that encourage customers to spend more with HelloFresh?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we leverage AI tooling to arrive at pricing insights and solutions faster than ever before?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be part of the Global Price &amp;amp; Discount Strategy Team, shaping pricing and discount strategy across our full global portfolio which includes our core brand, HelloFresh, as well as: Factor, GreenChef, EveryPlate, Chef&#39;s Plate, and Youfoodz. You’ll work closely with stakeholders from multiple countries and teams such as Product, Marketing Analytics, and Paid Marketing — making this a unique opportunity to combine strategic thinking, analytical depth, and cross-functional execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape market strategies: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor performance and competitor landscapes across our key markets, and translate insights into actionable price &amp;amp; discount strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run and scale experiments: &lt;/strong&gt;Design, align, and execute A/B tests that validate new pricing and promotional approaches, and ensure learnings are rigorously captured&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own key initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Take end-to-end responsibility for selected projects — from framing the problem and aligning stakeholders, to delivering impact through execution and tracking results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build frameworks &amp;amp; playbooks: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop best practices, toolkits, and scalable approaches that improve how we set prices and run promotions across all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modernize processes with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Pricing Analytics and Product to adapt AI use cases within our pricing and discount strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in consulting, data analytics, or a price/discount-related role, with a strong track record of solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required, Master’s degree preferred in marketing, business or STEM-related fields (e.g. mathematics, engineering, computer science, economics, statistics, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, including advanced command of Excel (SQL is a plus) with the ability to translate complex data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience devising and measuring the effectiveness of strategic optimizations (including AB testing), with a proven track record from other data-rich business environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with diverse teams, including Product, Marketing, and Data Science, in a fast-paced, matrixed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating ambiguity and adapting quickly to evolving priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for exploring opportunities to leverage AI-based workflow tools to optimize internal processes and improve speed to insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;starting date. After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you shortly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is an onsite role with a schedule of Sunday through Thursday from 9:30am to 5:30pm and is not eligible for hybrid or remote work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The HelloFresh team is diverse, high-performing, and international, and our work environment is an inspiring space where you can thrive as a result.&amp;nbsp; As the&lt;strong&gt; Senior HR Manager &lt;/strong&gt;you would be responsible for partnering with the Operations leaders to create and drive the culture for the entire location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive core HR functions, ensuring to align initiatives, programs, and projects to business drivers and company strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a performance-driven culture through the development and implementation of consistent performance management coaching and counseling techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep a strong pulse on employee engagement and needs, gain insights from employee off-boarding and exit interviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage front-line HR operations support to employees, compensation support and communication, on-boarding/off-boarding, leave management &amp;amp; workers&#39; compensation, benefits administration, HR data management, employee relations, immigration and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, interpret, administer and ensure compliance with federal, state, and local employment laws, and company policies and procedures partnering with Employee Relations and legal on any agency charge responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a small team consisting of our Senior Associate, Associate, and office coordinator.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training support to all levels of employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet with the Management team to understand business goals and anticipate future staffing needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively develop and implement alternative staffing sources.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively strategize with management to recruit new hires based on production requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide coaching and guidance to leaders and employees regarding employment issues in such areas as policy and procedure interpretation/application, coaching and corrective action, leaves of absence, development plans and terminations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct interventions, fact-findings and resolves conflicts as they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver, monitor, coach and guides technical and nontechnical training for Distribution Center Supervisors and non-exempt associates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in special projects as assigned.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mandatory Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive attitude and are able to engage with employees with confidence and credibility, even if you don&#39;t always have the answer in the immediate moment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are extremely organized and you have a great ability to thrive in a fast-paced and ever-changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in an HR role, with a depth of experience in HR operations, benefits, compensation, and HR data management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling employee relations issues and coaching managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with benefits, leaves of absence, legal compliance (COBRA, HIPAA, FMLA, ADA), and performance reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of HR/labor laws, including CA law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent job experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HRCI/SHRM certified, PHRca preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s in Human Resources/Organizational Psychology preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proficiency in Excel, HR metrics and reporting and Google Suites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an innovative, strategic thinker who can effectively leverage data to improve efficiency in a production focused operational environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent follow through, judgment, and common sense. &quot;Make it happen&quot; attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal/nonverbal skills, along with finely tuned interpersonal skills and professional judgment. You must be able to demonstrate empathy toward employees and serve as their trusted resource.&lt;/li&gt;
