&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$126,130 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Marketing Data Analyst in the Marketing Analytics team, you will play a key role in driving data-driven decision-making at HelloFresh. Based at our Global Headquarters in Berlin, you will own the Virality Analytics space, focusing on our Referral / Refer-a-Friend (RAF) programs across 12+ HelloFresh markets and multiple brands (HelloFresh, Factor, Green Chef, Chefs Plate, EveryPlate, and more).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Referral is one of HelloFresh&#39;s most efficient acquisition channels and a strategic growth lever for the next chapter of the business. You will be the analytical voice behind referral products, shaping how we measure them, how we grow them, and how we prove their value to the C-suite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Your insights will shape strategies to optimize customer acquisition, sender engagement, friend conversion quality, and long-term customer value contribution from the referral channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act&lt;/strong&gt; as the trusted analytics partner to the Virality Marketing, CRM, and Growth stakeholders — translating broad, ambiguous business questions into structured, prioritized analytical work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own &lt;/strong&gt;the Virality marketing reporting (WBRs, QBRs and Forecasting) as well as funnel-level diagnostics across sender and friend journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent &lt;/strong&gt;Virality analytics in cross-functional forums with Product, Marketing, Data Engineering, CRM Ops, and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-design, quality-control, and analyze&lt;/strong&gt; A/B tests on referral incentive structures, entry points, share flows and CRM comms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply &lt;/strong&gt;rigorous experimentation methodology — power analysis, primary metric selection, guardrail metrics, sample-size-aware interpretation — and communicate results to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze &lt;/strong&gt;customer value contribution using MPC2 predictions, sender-reward cost, friend-discount cost, and cost-per-conversion economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute &lt;/strong&gt;to virality-related initiatives beyond RAF — organic sharing, social loops, and future referral product bets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate &lt;/strong&gt;with fellow analysts across Marketing, Retention, Loyalty, and Product Analytics to keep methodology and definitions consistent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute &lt;/strong&gt;to code reviews, dashboard reviews, and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor &lt;/strong&gt;more junior analysts on structured problem-solving and stakeholder communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in Marketing, Product, or Customer Analytics — ideally in a fast-paced B2C, subscription, or growth-oriented business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced SQL&lt;/strong&gt; proficiency — comfortable with window functions, CTEs, complex joins, and performance-tuning queries on large event-level tables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;A/B testing&lt;/strong&gt; design and analysis, including statistical significance, power, guardrails, and small-sample handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and maintain &lt;strong&gt;BI dashboards&lt;/strong&gt; (Tableau, Databricks, or similar) that reach senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and working with GenAI designed end to end workflows from problem definition to documentation and creating reproducible research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills with a track record of translating ambiguous business challenges into structured, data-driven projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, with experience influencing cross-functional Product, Marketing, and Engineering partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with &lt;strong&gt;event-level behavioral data&lt;/strong&gt; (Snowplow, Google Analytics, or equivalent) is a PLUS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with &lt;strong&gt;referral / virality / growth-loops&lt;/strong&gt; programs, or with acquisition-channel economics (CAC, LTV, ROI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;CRM analytics&lt;/strong&gt; (email, push, in-app) — including deliverability, engagement, and unsubscription guardrails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for data transformation, ad-hoc analysis, or lightweight modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Databricks / Spark SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, dbt, or similar modern data-stack tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to statistical modeling techniques beyond A/B testing — segmentation, clustering, regression, causal inference (diff-in-diff, synthetic control)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Statsig, Optimizely, or similar experimentation platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to &lt;strong&gt;event tracking design&lt;/strong&gt; (Snowplow, GA4) — schema design, entity modeling, event naming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Modern and comfortable working space with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discount for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Development possibilities along with internal trainings and a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexible working hours including Work From Home/Work from Abroad/Sabbatical Policy, as well as a home office set up budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Extensive Onboarding and Buddy Program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Social events including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discounted fitness offers with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners and yoga classes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Well-being initiatives in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Childcare and company pension scheme benefit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Monthly transportation budget via NAVIT&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Growth Alliance enables HelloFresh to expand by getting more customers to try, recommend, and return to our products. We build digital experiences used by customers around the world, including our checkout funnel, discounting and wallet services, experimentation platforms, and referral technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about building customer-facing products at global scale—and shaping how millions of people interact with food and technology—this is a strong place to grow your impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Mobile Developer, you’ll join a cross-functional team building features that empower both customers and internal stakeholders. You’ll contribute to developing high-quality mobile and web experiences using modern technologies, with a focus on performance, accessibility, and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with senior engineers while taking ownership of well-defined features end-to-end, growing your technical depth and product intuition over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re also increasingly leveraging &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven tools and systems&lt;/strong&gt;—from developer productivity (e.g., code generation, testing support) to customer-facing experimentation and personalization—so you’ll have opportunities to build and iterate in an evolving, AI-enabled environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate within a cross-functional team of engineers, product managers, designers, and analysts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, test, and ship features that improve the customer experience and drive growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to code quality, performance, and maintainability of our mobile applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in system design discussions and help implement scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with backend services and APIs to deliver seamless end-to-end functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and experimentation to inform product decisions and iterate on features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of continuous improvement through code reviews and team discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with emerging tools and practices, including AI-assisted development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–2 years of experience working with React or React Native&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of experience building mobile applications (iOS and/or Android) using technologies such as Swift, Kotlin, or React Native&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of integrating frontend applications with backend services and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with testing (unit, integration, or end-to-end) and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agile development and working in cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively with designers and product managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and a willingness to learn and grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Experience with experimentation platforms (A/B testing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Exposure to AI/ML-powered features or tools (e.g., personalization, recommendations, or developer tooling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Experience optimizing performance for mobile applications at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Operational Excellence Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; sits within the UK Operational Excellence team and plays a key role in designing, executing, and scaling high-impact continuous improvement initiatives across HelloFresh distribution centres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Positioned as a senior technical practitioner and project leader, you will handle complex, cross-functional projects aimed at optimizing fulfillment processes, reducing costs, and improving error rates. You will bridge high-level strategy and floor-level execution by collaborating closely with the OpEx Team Lead on roadmap implementation while mentoring junior engineers and leading site-level project teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Project Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-impact, multi-faceted continuous improvement projects from end-to-end to drive major KPI improvements across site operations (cost per box, error rate, throughput).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply Lean Six Sigma methodologies, root-cause analysis, and structured problem-solving tools to solve complex operational bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap Delivery Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the OpEx Team Lead and site operational leaders to translate the broader OpEx strategy into actionable project plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Insights &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct deep-dive data analyses (using SQL, Tableau, Excel/Google Sheets) and champion digital/low-code innovation to build scalable operational tools on the floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a subject matter expert and mentor to OpEx Engineers and shift leaders, coaching them on CI methodologies and standard work principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong relationships with cross-functional stakeholders—from floor operatives to Site Managers—ensuring transparent risk mitigation and sustainable change adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standardization &amp;amp; Best Practice Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive site-wide standard work practices, document processes, and support network-wide deployment of successful local initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Industrial Engineering, Supply Chain, Operations, or a technical discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3–5 years of relevant experience in Operational Excellence, Industrial Engineering, Process Optimization, or High-Volume Fulfillment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience successfully leading end-to-end, medium-to-large process optimization and cost-saving initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lean &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in process optimization frameworks (Lean, Six Sigma, Kaizen, TPM); Green Belt certification or equivalent practical capability essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency in data analytics tools (Excel, SQL, Google Sheets) and hands-on familiarity with WMS/WCS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Aptitude:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with low-code/no-code platforms or modern automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to lead project teams and mentor junior team members without needing formal direct reporting lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills with the ability to influence cross-functional teams and present updates to site leadership clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Floor Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong desire to blend strategic thinking with hands-on, floor-level problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The Windmill SIte, SmartParc, Holme Lane, Derby, DE21 7HW&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Operations Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Full Time&lt;br&gt;St. Margaret’s, Co.Dublin, K67 P7E5&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Operations Manager, you’ll take full ownership of our site and partner closely with our 3PL provider to run a first-class operation. This isn&#39;t just about managing processes - it’s about people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be the driving force behind a vibrant, high-performing site culture, boosting team engagement while navigating a fast-paced environment. Your ultimate goal? Rallying the team to deliver an efficient, safe, and financially sharp operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Site:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee our entire Production facility - including the warehouse and planning functions - with strategic oversight of our 3PL partner managing agency and hourly workforces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Champion a culture of continuous improvement across safety, quality, and cost efficiency within an agile, rapidly scaling operational environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Hold our 3PL partner to account against clear performance standards, and drive through operational improvements even where that means resetting an unproductive dynamic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Numbers: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive site performance through critical metrics such as efficiency and error-reduction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect Globally: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with your peers to establish standardisation, share best practices, and build seamless operational consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Future: &lt;/strong&gt;Actively mentor, coach, and develop the team to build a strong talent pipeline and foster clear career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Budget: Maintain full financial oversight of site expenditure, including invoice authorisation, with rigorous attention to detail and sharp numerical skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience managing operations or production within FMCG or a comparable high-volume environment, with a modern, practical approach to lean and continuous improvement, and comfortable applying data and AI tools to solve problems quickly rather than relying on formal improvement programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3PL &amp;amp; Vendor Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience managing a third-party logistics partner or comparable outsourced operation, holding them to clear performance standards and commercial accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Performance: &lt;/strong&gt;Track record of using data to diagnose problems and design process improvements, not simply reporting against existing KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety First Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;A foundational knowledge of health and safety regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;A team-first mentality with a focus on cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to thrive and remain agile in a fast-paced, evolving workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We know that skills come from many places - so even if you don’t &quot;tick all the boxes&quot;, if you’re excited about this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;70% off HelloFresh + free shipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Pension (matched 1:1 contributions up to 5%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Gym membership or Wellness benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Membership to global leading mindfulness App - Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch on Thursdays for office team day (DUBLIN OFFICE ONLY, NOT DC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from home allowance of up to €300&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For every year you are part of the team, you will earn one extra day off to celebrate your anniversary (up to 3 additional days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&lt;/h5&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_, a HelloFresh brand, is looking for a Senior Operations Planning Manager (all genders)!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this key role, you will take ownership of site-wide planning, ensuring that workforce, capacity, and production plans are seamlessly aligned. With your strategic mindset, you will balance operational efficiency, cost, quality, and service performance while enabling sustainable growth across our production operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at the intersection of Operations, Supply Chain, Finance, and HR, you will develop data-driven planning strategies, optimize processes, and play a pivotal role in shaping the future of our production network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the strategic planning for the production site, including workforce, capacity, and production planning, ensuring the achievement of cost, quality, and service level targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and manage short-, mid-, and long-term planning, aligning capacity and workforce requirements with demand forecasts while proactively identifying risks and implementing mitigation plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Operations, Supply Chain, Finance, and HR to ensure realistic, aligned, and executable production plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyze operational data and key performance indicators, identify optimization opportunities, and implement initiatives to improve productivity, efficiency, and planning accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuously enhance planning, reporting, and governance processes while ensuring high data quality and adherence to established standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare management reports and decision-making materials for site leadership and collaborate closely with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least 5 years of professional experience in production planning, capacity planning, workforce planning, or a related role, ideally within a manufacturing, FMCG, or supply chain environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong expertise in production planning, forecasting, capacity planning, and performance management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to translate complex data into actionable business insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with ERP, Business Intelligence, and/or Workforce Management systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A structured, proactive, and collaborative working style with strong communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for taking ownership in a fast-paced production environment and driving continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to internal training programs and an annual budget to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_ Meals:&lt;/strong&gt; Exclusive employee discounts on our delicious and nutritious Factor_ meals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and 30 days of paid annual leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to a variety of wellbeing initiatives, with additional fitness and wellness benefits being introduced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We continuously expand our benefits portfolio, including mobility support and retirement benefits, to provide even greater flexibility and long-term security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Hungry for More?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now with your complete application documents. We welcome applications without a photo and without information regarding nationality, gender, or other personal characteristics. You are also welcome to include language certificates and documentation confirming your right to live and work in the respective country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/p&gt;
