&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A structured, proactive, and collaborative working style with strong communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for taking ownership in a fast-paced production environment and driving continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
