&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills including advanced formulas, pivot tables, and data visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of leveraging AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot, etc.) to increase personal and team productivity in day-to-day analytical work.&lt;/li&gt;
