&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_, a HelloFresh brand, is looking for a Senior Site Planning Manager (all genders)!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this key role, you will take ownership of site-wide planning, ensuring that workforce, capacity, and production plans are seamlessly aligned. With your strategic mindset, you will balance operational efficiency, cost, quality, and service performance while enabling sustainable growth across our production operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at the intersection of Operations, Supply Chain, Finance, and HR, you will develop data-driven planning strategies, optimize processes, and play a pivotal role in shaping the future of our production network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the strategic planning for the production site, including workforce, capacity, and production planning, ensuring the achievement of cost, quality, and service level targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and manage short-, mid-, and long-term planning, aligning capacity and workforce requirements with demand forecasts while proactively identifying risks and implementing mitigation plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Operations, Supply Chain, Finance, and HR to ensure realistic, aligned, and executable production plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyze operational data and key performance indicators, identify optimization opportunities, and implement initiatives to improve productivity, efficiency, and planning accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuously enhance planning, reporting, and governance processes while ensuring high data quality and adherence to established standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare management reports and decision-making materials for site leadership and collaborate closely with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least 5 years of professional experience in production planning, capacity planning, workforce planning, or a related role, ideally within a manufacturing, FMCG, or supply chain environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong expertise in production planning, forecasting, capacity planning, and performance management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to translate complex data into actionable business insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with ERP, Business Intelligence, and/or Workforce Management systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A structured, proactive, and collaborative working style with strong communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for taking ownership in a fast-paced production environment and driving continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to internal training programs and an annual budget to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_ Meals:&lt;/strong&gt; Exclusive employee discounts on our delicious and nutritious Factor_ meals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and 30 days of paid annual leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to a variety of wellbeing initiatives, with additional fitness and wellness benefits being introduced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We continuously expand our benefits portfolio, including mobility support and retirement benefits, to provide even greater flexibility and long-term security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Hungry for More?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now with your complete application documents. We welcome applications without a photo and without information regarding nationality, gender, or other personal characteristics. You are also welcome to include language certificates and documentation confirming your right to live and work in the respective country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/p&gt;
