&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lead the day-to-day operation of your shift, ensuring the safe, efficient, and high-quality delivery of customer orders. Drive operational performance through strong leadership, accountability, continuous improvement, and the development of engaged, high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;527&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s128mz&quot; data-start=&quot;527&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;Lead shift operations to achieve productivity, quality, safety, and service targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;o965pv&quot; data-start=&quot;614&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;Execute production plans while ensuring compliance with health &amp;amp; safety, food safety, and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1isgl7d&quot; data-start=&quot;725&quot; data-end=&quot;809&quot;&gt;Monitor performance, resolve operational issues, and implement corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3bjkmp&quot; data-start=&quot;810&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;Drive continuous improvement to improve efficiency, reduce waste, and enhance customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;936&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nmzdbm&quot; data-start=&quot;936&quot; data-end=&quot;1037&quot;&gt;Lead, coach, and develop Team Leaders and Production Operatives to build capability and succession.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zil0sf&quot; data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;Set clear expectations, monitor KPIs, provide regular feedback, and manage performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19tu1qe&quot; data-start=&quot;1128&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;Promote accountability, engagement, recognition, inclusion, and colleague wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;by2z2k&quot; data-start=&quot;1215&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;Support recruitment, onboarding, workforce planning, and employee relations in partnership with HR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Decision Making&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sis9ws&quot; data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;Take ownership of shift performance and operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;41ahqu&quot; data-start=&quot;1420&quot; data-end=&quot;1482&quot;&gt;Make timely, informed decisions in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ysuqby&quot; data-start=&quot;1483&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;Lead by example with a hands-on approach and empower teams to solve problems and improve processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health, Safety &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1890&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qr57kc&quot; data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1735&quot;&gt;Champion a safety-first culture and ensure compliance with all health, safety, food safety, and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kbcdet&quot; data-start=&quot;1736&quot; data-end=&quot;1834&quot;&gt;Conduct audits, risk assessments, and investigations, implementing effective corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;562nt7&quot; data-start=&quot;1835&quot; data-end=&quot;1890&quot;&gt;Maintain a clean, organised, and compliant workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;2138&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v2mzz8&quot; data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;2028&quot;&gt;Apply Lean and continuous improvement principles to enhance productivity, quality, and cost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17gk7g7&quot; data-start=&quot;2029&quot; data-end=&quot;2138&quot;&gt;Use performance data to identify opportunities and support implementation of new processes and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;40&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1aijvad&quot; data-start=&quot;40&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;Experienced people leader in a fast-paced manufacturing, production, fulfilment, logistics, or FMCG environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15fprkj&quot; data-start=&quot;155&quot; data-end=&quot;222&quot;&gt;Proven ability to lead, coach, and develop high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;arans6&quot; data-start=&quot;223&quot; data-end=&quot;291&quot;&gt;Strong decision-making, problem-solving, and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e46qsk&quot; data-start=&quot;292&quot; data-end=&quot;376&quot;&gt;Results-driven, with experience managing KPIs and driving operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;132tlue&quot; data-start=&quot;377&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of health &amp;amp; safety, quality, and continuous improvement principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantageous:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;647&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1iiqozz&quot; data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;530&quot;&gt;Experience in food manufacturing or FMCG.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;130gwc0&quot; data-start=&quot;531&quot; data-end=&quot;589&quot;&gt;Knowledge of Lean, Continuous Improvement, or Six Sigma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h8zinm&quot; data-start=&quot;590&quot; data-end=&quot;647&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Relevant Food Safety or Health &amp;amp; Safety qualifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Smart parc, Spondon, Derby DE21 7HW&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;: Rotating days and nights every 3 months, Wednesday to Saturday - 7:00 - 7:00&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As a Shipping Lead, you will oversee daily operations in receiving, shipping, and logistics. You’ll be a hands-on leader, coaching your team to ensure maximum productivity while maintaining high standards for quality and safety. Working under the guidance of a Supervisor, you’ll be a key player in keeping our distribution center running smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift: Sunday to Wednesday - 7:00am to 5:30pm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead, train, and coach a team of 6-10 employees, ensuring high morale and efficient performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations: &lt;/strong&gt;Coordinate daily shipping activities, communicate with carriers, and manage data entry in Microsoft Office and Google Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety &amp;amp; Quality: &lt;/strong&gt;Enforce all safety, GMP, and SQF policies while maintaining a clean and orderly work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of leadership experience in a distribution or shipping environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate’s degree OR equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate computer skills (Email, Microsoft Office, Google Sheets).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High School Diploma or GED.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification in material handling equipment (or willingness to become certified).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and additional sick leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_) &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Physical Demands&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role operates in a cold manufacturing environment (10º - 40ºF). You should be comfortable standing and walking for 10-12 hour shifts and able to regularly lift 25-50 lbs. Expect a dynamic, fast-paced atmosphere with significant weekend work based on production needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our company is committed to fair hiring practices and complies with all applicable laws, including the Colorado Job Application Fairness Act (JAFA). In accordance with JAFA, we will not request your age, date of birth, or dates of attendance at or graduation from an educational institution on your initial application for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;When submitting supporting documents such as a resume, curriculum vitae (CV), or educational transcripts, you may voluntarily redact or omit any information that would identify your age. This includes:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of birth&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of attendance at educational institutions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of graduation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your decision to redact this information will not adversely affect the consideration of your application. We evaluate all candidates based on their skills, qualifications, and experience. Please be aware that should you receive a conditional offer of employment, we may be required to request this information for legally permissible purposes, such as verifying eligibility for employment or for benefits administration and background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Colorado Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$23.75&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$23.75 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into the Senior Director of National Production, you will oversee all fulfillment processes (warehouse, portioning, and pick &amp;amp; pack) within a HF Distribution Centre. Your focus is to ensure that our customers receive a perfect box on time; create, develop, and manage a high-performing team; and drive continuous improvement initiatives and process rollouts to achieve cost and operational targets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Leadership Team, you will play a key role in shaping and building HelloFresh’s operational scale and capability of the future, as we strive to win our customers with high levels of service, quality and choice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team multi-department team consisting of Operations Managers, Supervisors, and Coordinators/Team Leaders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop a high-performing culture, with focus on leadership, accountability, engagement, continuous learning and speed/agility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up, manage, and be accountable for key performance indicators and targets, with focus on employee safety, food safety, quality, order accuracy, cost, and on-time delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with Planning, Supply Chain, and Logistics leaders and teams to deliver production plans that optimize product freshness, on-time delivery, while delivering on DC targets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make tomorrow better than today! Drive continuous improvement by collaborating with teams/Ops Excellence in identifying, scoping, and delivering initiatives and leading/coaching teams through positive and focused change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate root-cause analysis and implement corrective actions to prevent recurring product and performance issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, improve, and setup standard processes, onboarding, and training in all fulfillment processes - Warehouse, Portioning, and Pick &amp;amp; Pack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that the DC achieves and/or exceeds the Global DC Audit and regional Occupational Health &amp;amp; Safety standards; oversee facility and equipment upgrades and maintenance to achieve and/or exceed standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Ops Excellence, SCM Tech, and other CA/global resources to enable our team and deliver on system, data, and process improvements within the DC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and build a work environment focused on Health &amp;amp; Safety. Work in compliance with OH&amp;amp;S acts and regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of Manufacturing and/or Supply Chain experience with a Bachelor’s and/or Master’s degree in Engineering, Business or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of OHS and Food Safety and its application in a warehouse and production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with managing a large scale operations with multiple management tiers and large employee headcount&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, enthusiasm, and a can-do attitude. Used to working in a high pressure, fast paced, and constantly changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and self-motivation. We seek a leader who competes to win and have the burning desire to make a meaningful difference in our business and lives of our employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An authentic leader, who’s able to build strong relationships, clearly communicate and motivate, and drive accountability in all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An effective collaborator, who empowers and enables others to share ideas, raises awareness, gets buy-in, and and delivers fast and well-rounded solutions to complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of manufacturing and warehouse systems and controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple projects and assignments able to prioritize and meet budgets deadlines and achieve objectives;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to maintain sensitive and confidential information;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications and/or licenses with Lean Six Sigma preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to travel within Canada&amp;nbsp; up to 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;On top of base salary and amazing benefits, this role is also eligible for the HelloFresh equity program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#JD1003&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Mississauga, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;36&quot;&gt;Site QA/QC Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our dynamic, fast-growing team in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;100&quot;&gt;Bleiswijk&lt;/strong&gt;. As a key member of the Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Assurance (FSQA) department, you will drive the initiatives that define the quality of every HelloFresh box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;You will be on the front lines of our fulfillment center, optimizing daily processes and partnering closely with operational teams to ensure a gold standard of quality for our customers. When challenges arise or unannounced audits occur, you are the expert who steps forward to ensure compliance and maintain our high operational momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Management Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary driver of the Quality Management System (QMS), ensuring the site remains compliant with all internal standards and external regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and refine internal quality processes to bridge the gap between high-speed operations and flawless food safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Work side-by-side with production and logistics teams to embed a &quot;quality-first&quot; mindset and optimize daily fulfillment workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Take a leading role in conducting internal audits and GMP rounds, while serving as the key point of contact for supervising external and unannounced audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement Projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with the wider Site Quality team to spearhead strategic projects that drive the evolution of the HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Feedback Loop:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the investigation and follow-up for supplier non-conformities and consumer complaints, turning feedback into actionable site improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;2-5 years work experience in a quality function within the food industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You are accurate and goal oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You are able to present in a fast-paced and continuously changing work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You enjoy working with other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You have experience with quality systems such as IFS, BRC or FSSC22000.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You are fluent in English and Dutch (must).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;Benefits at Work&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop and, if necessary for your position, a phone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build your future with a pension plan through Aegon Cappital (age-based rates, 50/50 split).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive a 7,5% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis (2026), plus free access to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a flexible hybrid work setup with a €2.40 daily remote work allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start with 24 days of annual leave (pro-rata), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, and €0.23 per km for car/bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access internal/external opportunities aligned with our Job Framework, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated annual budget to help you keep learning, developing new skills, and growing your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€20/month), weekly vrij-mi-bo (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;HelloFresh is on a mission to change the way people eat, forever!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Since our 2011 founding in Europe’s vibrant tech hub, Berlin, we’ve become the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider, delivering to over 4.2 million households worldwide in 15 countries across 3 continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our more than 15,000 employees from over 70+ nationalities are the heart and soul of our diverse, fast-paced and dynamic environment where innovation and smart, fast action is encouraged.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We will encourage you to make an immediate impact in your area of work as well as empower you to grow your career with us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over de stage - What&#39;s in the Box&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ons &lt;strong&gt;Benelux Marketing team&lt;/strong&gt; vormt hoe HelloFresh de levens van duizenden huishoudens in Nederland en België bereikt. Social media en influencer marketing horen bij de meest zichtbare en creatieve manieren waarop we dat doen: hier komt ons merk tot leven en verbinden we ons dagelijks met mensen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als onze &lt;strong&gt;Social Media &amp;amp; Influencers Stagiair&lt;/strong&gt; speel je een hands-on rol bij het vormen van content, het beheren van onze social media kanalen en het opbouwen van authentieke influencer-samenwerkingen die mensen inspireren om met HelloFresh te koken. Je maakt onderdeel uit van een dynamisch team waar jouw ideeën direct vorm geven aan hoe ons merk online wordt gezien en ervaren.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heb jij een passie voor social media, creatieve content en gewoon dingen voor elkaar krijgen? Dan is dit jouw kans om je stempel te drukken op een merk waar mensen elke dag mee koken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dit is een betaalde stage die je hands-on ervaring geeft in een dynamische, internationale omgeving, met structurele begeleiding om je leerproces te ondersteunen. De stage is geschikt voor studenten wiens studie-eisen het mogelijk maken om in de voorgestelde periode stage te lopen. Tijdens de sollicitatieprocedure stellen we vragen over universitaire vereisten (zoals duur, taken of criteria), zorg er dus voor dat je deze informatie kunt aanleveren bij je sollicitatie.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen: Het Recept&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je ondersteunt bij het maken en aanpassen van content die het HelloFresh merk weerspiegelt, en brengt onze recepten, producten en campagnes tot leven op social media kanalen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je helpt mee met het beheren van de social media kanalen van HelloFresh, en blijf op de hoogte van de nieuwste social trends, platformupdates en kansen om ons merk in de schijnwerpers te houden.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je neemt het projectmanagement van ons micro-influencer programma op je, van de eerste planning en briefing tot uitvoering, content-goedkeuringen en opvolging na de campagne.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je coördineert influencer-samenwerkingen en co-branded partnerships met bekende Nederlandse en Belgische merken, in samenwerking met bureaus en interne stakeholders, van kick-off tot publicatie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je draagt frisse, trendgevoelige ideeën aan tijdens creatieve briefings en helpt mee door de toon, look en boodschap van onze influencer- en merkcontent vorm te geven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je verzamelt en analyseert campagneprestaties ten opzichte van belangrijke KPI&#39;s, en vertaalt de resultaten naar heldere learnings en concrete aanbevelingen voor toekomstige campagnes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je signaleert kansen en mogelijke obstakels vroegtijdig, komt met oplossingen en ondersteunt het bredere marketingteam waar nodig.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat je meebrengt: De Ingrediënten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je volgt momenteel een HBO/WO-opleiding in Marketing, Communicatie of een gerelateerd vakgebied.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een passie voor social media en influencer-cultuur: je weet wat er speelt in de Nederlandse en/of Belgische markt en begrijpt welke content aanslaat bij een doelgroep.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sterke organisatorische vaardigheden en het vermogen om meerdere projecten, deadlines en stakeholders tegelijk te managen zonder het overzicht te verliezen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een proactieve, creatieve mindset: je komt met ideeën, neemt initiatief en pakt dingen met eigenaarschap op.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vloeiend in Nederlands en Engels, gezien de Benelux-scope van deze rol.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bovenal zoeken we mensen die HelloFresh beter maken. Er zijn veel verschillende manieren om vaardigheden te ontwikkelen, en we houden van diverse ervaringen! Dus ook als je niet aan alle punten voldoet, maar denkt dat je zou floreren in deze rol, horen we graag meer over jou.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat wij bieden: De Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vergoeding &amp;amp; Financieel Welzijn&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profiteer van 20% korting op je HelloFresh- en 40% korting op je Factor_-abonnement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Toegang tot het &quot;Benefits at Work&quot; platform voor kortingen bij merken zoals Nike, Bol.com en IKEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je ontvangt een HelloFresh laptop gedurende de stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Gezondheid &amp;amp; Welzijn&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gratis bootcamplessen op maandag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibiliteit &amp;amp; Werk-privébalans&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profiteer van een flexibele hybride werksetup met een thuiswerkvergoeding van €2,45 per dag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je krijgt 10 vakantiedagen, gebaseerd op een werkweek van 40 uur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volledige reiskostenvergoeding voor 2e klas openbaar vervoer naar kantoor, en €0,23 per km voor auto/fiets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Carrière &amp;amp; Ontwikkeling&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Toegang tot interne/externe kansen, afgestemd op ons Job Framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cultuur &amp;amp; Omgeving&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Geniet van verse, huisgemaakte lunches op kantoor (€3,00/dag), wekelijkse vrijmibo&#39;s, kwartaal strategiesessies en teamuitjes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ben jij het ontbrekende ingrediënt?&lt;/strong&gt; Als dit klinkt als een smakelijke kans, horen we graag van je. We streven ernaar je profiel binnen 5 werkdagen te bekijken en te reageren.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sourcing Coordinator, you will play a key role in supporting procurement strategy and operational excellence by partnering with purchasing leaders, coordinating cross-functional processes, maintaining data accuracy, and driving initiatives that optimize sourcing operations across our Meal Kit and Ready-to-Eat (RTE) brands, through effective collaboration, process management, and continuous improvement, you will help ensure efficient operations, informed decision-making, and a seamless supply chain that supports business success and enhances customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with purchasing leaders and cross-functional teams to support procurement strategy initiatives across our Meal Kit and Ready-to-Eat (RTE) brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Coordinate vendor onboarding activities, ensuring documentation is complete and accurately maintained&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Manage pricing updates, SKU data, and product specifications across multiple systems to ensure data integrity and operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support invoicing processes by tracking credits, rebates, and following up on outstanding items to maintain financial accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Assist in resolving operational escalations related to supply chain, inventory, product quality, and vendor performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Coordinate new product launches by aligning pricing, inventory, logistics, and system readiness with business requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Monitor product quality and key operational metrics, providing insights and recommendations to drive continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders to support strategic sourcing initiatives, market intelligence efforts, and product optimization projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong organizational and time management skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to build strong relationships across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;High attention to detail and a commitment to maintaining accurate data, documentation, and operational processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A proactive problem-solving mindset with a passion for identifying opportunities to improve efficiency and streamline workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The ability to thrive in a dynamic environment, adapting quickly to changing business priorities and operational needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Excel and experience working with business systems or data management tools to support operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A collaborative, self-driven approach with a commitment to delivering high-quality work and contributing to team success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#helloconnect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#hcgreenhouse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Sourcing Manager to join our Procurement team. In this role, you will be responsible for developing and executing sourcing strategies to improve our cost structure, the quality of our products, and the reliability of our supply chain. You will play a leading role in supporting innovation through new product development and the management of Third-Party Production products and vendors. You will have key responsibilities over SKU ideation and onboarding, vendor selection and relationships, price negotiations and contract management, capacity planning, end-to-end strategic sourcing processes, and budgetary planning—while continuously improving our end-to-end sourcing operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will help drive the strategy and framework for how the business interacts with its supplier base and have a direct stake in affecting bottom-line profitability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will own…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Network Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute defined sourcing strategies that align with company growth objectives, innovation priorities, and financial targets. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support the optimization of a scalable third-party manufacturing and supplier network, identifying operational capability gaps and proposing mitigation plans. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply industry knowledge to manage supplier segmentations and performance frameworks that drive improvements in quality, service, and cost competitiveness.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; New Product Commercialization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Culinary, Operations, and Commercial teams to unlock supplier and manufacturing capabilities for new concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the execution of the strategic sourcing process for new product development from initial concept through successful commercialization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance customer experience, operational complexity, and profitability when onboarding new SKUs and suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Performance &amp;amp; Cost Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage individual sourcing contributions to annual business planning and team financial targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement cost optimization initiatives and execute supplier negotiations to improve margins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead commercial negotiations and contract management for mid to high value agreements, balancing financial savings with long-term supplier partnerships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain Resilience &amp;amp; Risk Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute proactive risk management and supply continuity strategies across assigned suppliers and manufacturing partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold suppliers accountable through established performance metrics, service level agreements, and corrective action programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively manage and resolve day-to-day operational, quality and supply conflicts as they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Excellence &amp;amp; Data Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive iterations and continuous improvement of sourcing processes, supplier onboarding frameworks, and category management guidelines of a team level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and analytics to build data driven solutions and inform strategic decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will work…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous Execution &amp;amp; Strategic Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work highly autonomously to manage the scope, timeline, and execution of both short- and long-term strategic sourcing projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect Daily sourcing decisions and negotiations to broader department strategies and corporate objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage uncertainty independently by developing successful, actionable solutions to complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully manage interactions with stakeholders across Product, Operations, Finance, Legal and FSQA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence project outcomes and decisions without direct authority by leveraging data, business insight, and strong relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Contribution &amp;amp; Mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a recognized subject matter expert within your respective category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively take ownership of your career path and dedicate time to mentoring and coaching more junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critically challenge the outcome of other team members work for technical soundness and provide constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in this role looks like…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous Project Delivery: Short- and long-term sourcing project and product launches are executed on time, within scope, and with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network &amp;amp; Supplier Optimization: Assigned third party manufacturers consistently meet quality, service, and cost metrics through proactive performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value Creation: Sourcing driven financial targets, margin improvement goals, and cost optimization metrics are successfully achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Iteration: Sourcing standards, tools, and workflows are continuously challenged, updated, and improved on a team level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Alignment: Fruitful, collaborative relationships are maintained with stakeholders, accelerating cross functional decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a Minimum, You Have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of relevant experience working in supply chain operations, strategic sourcing, or procurement—ideally within the food or third-party manufacturing industry; or equivalent experience in operations strategy-focused management consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An undergraduate degree, preferably in supply chain, business, engineering, or a related field (or equivalent relevant experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Google Suite applications (especially Google Sheets)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of successfully leading large initiatives and sourcing events through strategic sourcing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high value contract negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to travel as needed (up to 20%), with destinations determined by business need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; 401k company match that vests immediately upon participation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave of 16 weeks &amp;amp; PTO policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$0 monthly premium and other flexible health plans&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;85% discount on your subscription to HelloFresh (as well as other product initiatives) &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
