&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need a hands-on CapEx procurement expert, not a generalist. You&#39;ll lead strategic sourcing for capital investments across HelloFresh&#39;s European production sites: machinery, automated lines, Material Handling Equipment (MHE), and facility build-outs. You&#39;ll be embedded with Engineering and Operations from spec to handover, owning multi-million euro decisions. This role reports to the Director Indirect Procurement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious, confident, entrepreneurial, and high-spirited Procurement professional with a strength for data processing, optimisation &amp;amp; reporting, ability to navigate ambiguity, attention to detail and great stakeholder management ability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end CapEx sourcing: supplier market mapping, RFx execution, negotiation, and contract award for high-value capital projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a multi-year CapEx category strategy covering production machinery, conveyors &amp;amp; MHE, cold storage, and building fit-outs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Total Cost of Ownership modelling and investment scenario analysis with Engineering and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Early Supplier Involvement (ESI) to influence specs and design-to-cost outcomes before projects are locked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage the supplier portfolio across Hello Fresh’s markets: qualification, performance tracking, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Project Management and Site Operations from inception through commissioning — not just at the buying stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor equipment markets, supplier landscape, and technology trends relevant to food production and logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support broader Procurement Ops team, if necessary, in MRO, Facilities Management, Utilities, etc. projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in procurement, with at least 3–4 years of dedicated CapEx category ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record sourcing capital equipment: production machinery, automated systems, conveyors/MHE, or equivalent industrial CapEx&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering degree or equivalent technical background strongly preferred: you need to speak your stakeholders&#39; language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large-scale sourcing across multiple European markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; German and/or French is a meaningful advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong TCO and financial modelling skills; able to build business cases alongside Engineering and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able travel to production sites across Europe if necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initially we offer 2 years contract.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sr. Finance Business Partner for Cost of Goods and Packaging, you will be a core member of the BNL &amp;amp; Nordics Finance Team, reporting directly to the Associate Director of FP&amp;amp;A for Nordics &amp;amp; Benelux. This is a high-impact, hands-on role where you will serve as the primary finance partner for supply chain, procurement, and distribution centre leadership across both the BNL and Nordics markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Amsterdam, you will embed yourself in the operational and commercial detail of our distribution centres, build trusted relationships with procurement and operations counterparts across markets, and translate cost data into clear financial insights for senior stakeholders. Beyond COGs and packaging, you will also have the opportunity to contribute to broader finance projects across the BNL and Nordics region, gaining exposure to the full P&amp;amp;L and a wide range of strategic and operational workstreams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis (FP&amp;amp;A):&lt;/strong&gt; Lead COGs and packaging budgeting, forecasting, and month-end close for BNL and Nordics, incorporating inflation, menu mix dynamics, and specification changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Variance Analysis &amp;amp; Cost Bridges:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct variance analysis and build cost bridges against budget and prior year—decomposing drivers like price inflation, volume, menu mix, waste, and yield loss for executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Partnering:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary finance partner to Procurement, Menu Planning, and DC Operations to track supplier pricing, contract renewals, sustainability impacts, and operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automated Reporting Suite:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and continuously improve the regional COGs reporting suite, including theoretical consumption models, cost-per-box assumptions, and DC-level cost tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Tooling &amp;amp; Technical Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage SQL and Databricks to automate COGs data pipelines and eliminate manual reporting overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Theoretical vs. Actual Benchmarking:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor theoretical vs. delivered COGs performance to identify, explain, and mitigate gaps driven by operational waste, yield loss, and menu composition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Strategic Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with central FP&amp;amp;A and broader finance teams on strategic projects, cross-functional efficiency drives, and continuous model improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least five years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A or commercial finance, with a demonstrable focus on COGs, procurement finance, supply chain, or manufacturing cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of food or FMCG cost structures - ideally including ingredient pricing, packaging, and DC operational costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, analytical, and intellectually curious - with the confidence to interrogate cost data, challenge numbers, and validate outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build relationships with operational and procurement stakeholders and translate complex cost dynamics into clear business insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating across multiple markets simultaneously, with the adaptability to navigate different business contexts and stakeholder environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills, with experience querying large datasets in cloud or data warehouse environments (Databricks experience a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Google Workspace (Sheets, Slides, Docs) and Microsoft Office (Excel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a subscription business or high-volume, low-margin consumer environment is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; Dutch or another BNL language is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;&lt;em&gt;Benefits at Work&lt;/em&gt;&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop, a €250 home office setup budget, and contribute to the Bedrijfspensioenfonds Levensmiddelen pension scheme (2026 rate 27.6%; employer pays 19.64%, employee pays 7.96%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland, free bootcamp classes (Amsterdam), and free subscriptions to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a 7,5% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis in 2025.&lt;/li&gt;
