&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$215,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&amp;nbsp;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will contribute to the success of the Food Systems Alliance by providing technical leadership across multiple engineering teams and business domains. At a pivotal stage in our transition from bespoke operational tooling to globally scalable software products, you will help shape architecture, drive technical decision-making, and translate complex supply chain processes into robust, maintainable systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with engineers and operational stakeholders, you will influence technical direction, promote engineering best practices, and support the delivery of scalable solutions that power HelloFresh&#39;s global supply chain operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; cross-squad technical initiatives to design and build modular, globally scalable backend solutions for complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act&lt;/strong&gt; as the technical bridge between engineering squads and operational stakeholders (Procurement, Production, Data) to architect reliable, long-term systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and drive&lt;/strong&gt; engineering best practices around system design, code quality, and maintainability across the entire Food Systems Alliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize&lt;/strong&gt; complex data workflows and event-driven architectures to seamlessly support day-to-day production and scaling needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide technical leadership &lt;/strong&gt;through architecture reviews, design discussions, and knowledge sharing across engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape&lt;/strong&gt; the technical roadmap by proactively identifying architectural bottlenecks and proposing strategic improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive backend engineering expertise, ideally within JVM-based ecosystems (Kotlin or Java), coupled with a strong grasp of distributed systems and microservices architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of designing and operating highly scalable, event-driven systems using messaging technologies such as Kafka, RabbitMQ, or SQS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to work fluidly across team boundaries, translating complex business or operational requirements into actionable technical roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of modern cloud infrastructure (AWS, Kubernetes) and observability practices, with the capacity to establish and advocate for tribe-wide standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, low-ego approach to problem-solving, possessing strong technical judgment and a passion for mentoring fellow engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Mennica Legacy Tower (Prosta 20).&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month. Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Product Manager, you will own and evolve HelloFresh&#39;s benefit creation platform, which defines, configures, and governs every discount, voucher, and reward across all our global brands and channels. Leading a dedicated squad of engineers, you will transform this high-impact system into a flexible, scalable, and highly automated platform. This is a foundational infrastructure role where you will design self-serve tooling and robust governance rules, ensuring our marketing and commercial teams can safely launch campaigns without engineering bottlenecks. Your work will directly protect our P&amp;amp;L margins while unlocking innovative, automated capabilities for future customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the long-term vision,&lt;/strong&gt; strategy, and roadmap for our global benefit and incentive platform, setting the path toward intelligent, automated creation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design scalable platform primitives&lt;/strong&gt; and reusable building blocks to eliminate custom, one-off engineering for individual marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish automated governance layers,&lt;/strong&gt; including margin floors and stacking checks, to systematically protect business profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build intuitive back-office tooling&lt;/strong&gt; that enables commercial and growth teams to configure standard campaigns independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment&lt;/strong&gt; across international teams, encouraging adoption of a unified platform contract.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluate and implement automation&lt;/strong&gt; and smart interfaces where they bring the highest return on investment, balancing flexibility with system reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in platform product management is essential, with a proven track record of building scalable internal tools, APIs, or foundational infrastructure rather than just user-facing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 6+ years of product management experience, specifically operating already at a Senior or Staff level within complex systems across multiple markets or diverse business lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional leadership and communication skills are required to align senior, cross-functional stakeholders and champion platform adoption without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It is a strong advantage if you bring a background in commercial strategy or promotional economics, enabling you to design smart business guardrails that balance marketing flexibility with P&amp;amp;L protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data analysis and technical architecture is highly valued, helping you effectively design reliable automation and interpret experiment data alongside engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point (Prosta 20).&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We are hiring a Staff Product Manager to own and evolve HelloFresh&#39;s customer prediction and decisioning portfolio, the suite of ML products that forecast customer value and, increasingly, decide the next best action for every customer: the right action, message, or nudge, for the right person, on the right channel, at the right moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll lead a squad of Data Scientists and Machine Learning Engineers on a mission to build the AI-powered engine that decides how HelloFresh creates and protects customer value across millions of customers and multiple markets. In this role, you will evolve our customer prediction and decisioning portfolio from a passive measurement layer that predicts value into an active engine that prescribes&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;and&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;orchestrates the actions that create it, moving from generic, rules-based segmentation to a sophisticated predict-and-optimize system that pairs models of each customer&#39;s lifetime value and incremental response with optimization that spends finite budget and attention where it returns the most. Your scope spans the entire customer journey: from first discovery to reacquisition and active retention, across every owned channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a commercial decision-making role, not a single-surface personalization role. CLV is the prediction that powers it; next-best-action is what we do with it. You will own both the prediction layer and the decisioning/orchestration layer that turns predictions into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will advocate for a customer-centric philosophy: optimization as empowerment, not manipulation. Working backwards from customer needs, you&#39;ll ensure our AI helps customers make better-informed decisions, with rigorous standards around transparency, privacy, and fairness. Trust is our primary growth lever when customers feel understood, it drives long-term retention, higher order frequency, and advocacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as the voice of the customer and the single-threaded leader across Data Science, Engineering, Commercial, Marketing, CRM, and Growth translating ML capability into customer-first experiences and aligning the organization around one decisioning strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the vision, strategy, and roadmap for the customer prediction and decisioning portfolio across the full customer lifecycle evolving it from a measurement layer that&amp;nbsp;predicts value into a decisioning engine that prescribes and orchestrates the actions that create it. Decide not just what action, but where and when.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sense the opportunity and set direction: synthesize customer insight, commercial context, competitive signal, and ML advances into a clear, prioritized multi-quarter strategy then translate it into quarterly objectives the squad can execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run a predict-and-optimize portfolio: partner with Data Science to advance our CLV, propensity, and uplift models extending prediction horizons beyond the near term, moving from cohort-level to customer-level granularity, and adding action-value attribution then pair them with budget/constraint optimization so we spend each marketing dollar where it returns the most. Ensure outputs are relevant, timely, and fair across segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive adoption of predictions as decisions: deepen how prediction outputs feed experimentation guardrails, CRM/communication decisioning, and growth &amp;amp; product strategy so models don&#39;t just inform analysis, they drive operational action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scale decisioning across all markets and touch points, ensuring consistent, explainable experiences customers understand and trust while navigating complex technical and operational trade-offs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define success metrics that balance customer and business outcomes satisfaction, retention, and engagement on one side; conversion, customer lifetime value, incremental lift, and ROI efficiency on the other and report directly on the outcomes that matter to both customers and the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prioritize ruthlessly with rigorous product practices, balancing near-term efficiency wins against long-term strategic capabilities, and making clear pragmatic calls between ML, GenAI, heuristics, and simple rules based on ROI, latency, and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment and adoption as a single-threaded leader across Tribes and Alliances influencing without authority to get Commercial, Marketing, CRM, and Growth to converge on, trust, and adopt a unified decisioning strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;573&quot; data-end=&quot;1014&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder influence &amp;amp; adoption&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;609&quot; data-end=&quot;612&quot;&gt;You have a strong track record of influencing senior, cross-functional stakeholders often without direct authority and driving alignment toward clear decisions rather than just consensus. You’re able to translate complex algorithmic or technical concepts into simple, compelling business narratives for executives, and you stay resilient in large, fast-moving organizations where ambiguity is the norm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1016&quot; data-end=&quot;1411&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end product craft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1044&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;You bring strong product leadership across the full lifecycle from opportunity identification to vision setting, strategy, execution, and prioritization under constraint. You typically have 6+ years of product management experience at Senior or Staff level, with a track record of shipping products that have had meaningful impact at scale across multiple markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1788&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1441&quot;&gt;Data-driven fundamentals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1441&quot; data-end=&quot;1444&quot;&gt;You are highly data-native and comfortable defining success metrics, designing and interpreting A/B and incrementality experiments, and reasoning about causal impact rather than surface-level metrics. You’re comfortable working with data directly (including SQL where needed) and don’t rely solely on others to form insights or recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1790&quot; data-end=&quot;2061&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1790&quot; data-end=&quot;1812&quot;&gt;AI-native operator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;You actively use modern AI tools as part of your daily workflow for analysis, research, prototyping, and exploration. You’re able to form and test hypotheses faster by leveraging AI, increasing both your own velocity and that of the broader team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;jb5ov3&quot; data-start=&quot;2063&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;jb5ov3&quot; data-start=&quot;2063&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;What’s a strong advantage&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2094&quot; data-end=&quot;2462&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2094&quot; data-end=&quot;2130&quot;&gt;ML fluency &amp;amp; science partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2133&quot;&gt;You’re comfortable working closely with Data Science and ML Engineering teams, and can engage meaningfully in discussions around model performance, feature engineering, uplift/causal inference, and the ML lifecycle. Prior experience in personalization, recommendations, propensity models, or decisioning systems is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2464&quot; data-end=&quot;2723&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2464&quot; data-end=&quot;2500&quot;&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; subscription acumen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2500&quot; data-end=&quot;2503&quot;&gt;You understand subscription-based business models and how pricing, promotions, and personalized offers influence LTV, retention, and churn. You can balance commercial outcomes with customer value in your decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$185,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$224,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;The Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is the world&#39;s leading meal-kit company, serving millions of subscribers across 18 markets. Historically, we have grown through paid acquisition, but the way people discover food is changing twice over. Search is being reshaped by AI, and a new generation of consumers is asking ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and Perplexity to &quot;plan dinner for my family this week&quot; instead of opening an app or a search engine. Whoever shows up in those answers wins the category-default position. Whoever does not is invisible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We own the meal-kit category in organic search and in LLMs. The broader food and recipe universe, where 150M+ monthly searches live, is still dominated by publishers with decades of content authority. Closing that gap is one of the largest, most durable growth opportunities in the business, and it is the mandate of the Organic Growth squad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Staff Product Manager to lead Organic Growth and level it up from a traditional SEO function into a modern organic discovery engine spanning SEO, Generative Engine Optimization (GEO), and an emerging Agentic Commerce mandate. This is the single-threaded leadership role for how HelloFresh and Factor get discovered, cited, and chosen across Google and AI surfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the end-to-end product strategy for organic discovery technical SEO, content infrastructure at scale, GEO and AI visibility, and the early Agentic Commerce surface that turns discovery into action inside LLMs. You&#39;ll inherit a real foundation: a quality-first content strategy, recipe-collection automation, a GEO editorial framework, and a shipped Discovery MCP / ChatGPT App proof-of-concept. Your job is to take that to a responsible scale.&amp;nbsp;You will set the direction for a cross-functional squad Product, Engineering, Data/ML, SEO, Content/Editorial, and UX and act as the connective tissue across Marketing, Brand, PR, and Commercial. You will operate with high agency and a strong bias for ownership: this role is for a builder who takes accountability for outcomes, not just outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll own&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SEO-the engine&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end technical and content SEO across HelloFresh and Factor: crawlability, indexation, structured data, internal linking, SSR, sitemaps, and CMS/content-platform infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content scale with guardrails: recipe detail pages, automated recipe collection pages, editorial/blog, recipe internationalization, and UGC signals (ratings, reviews, authorship) — growing the footprint without falling into the content-debt trap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move the org from meal-kit catalog to food destination: identify high-volume recipe and food queries where we have no page, and build them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GEO-the next surface&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own AI visibility and citation share across ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and Perplexity, measured via Profound across a priority set of food and meal-kit prompts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive our +25ppt GEO Visibility Score target (HF + Factor) by EOY 2026 through GEO-specific content formats built for AI citation, narrative-shaping editorial, and coordinated signals across owned, editorial, PR/affiliate, and social surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalize &quot;good SEO is good GEO&quot; while owning the GEO-only tactics (comparison/listicle content, third-party narrative, non-Google LLM optimization) that pure SEO misses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Commerce-the emerging bet&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend organic discovery from &quot;showing up&quot; to &quot;converting&quot;: connect GEO presence to our Agentic Commerce surface so discovery in an LLM turns into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with New Ventures on the Discovery MCP / ChatGPT App and the hub-and-spoke platform (MCP / Apps SDK, then Claude and Gemini), helping shape funnel and active-experience coverage as the space matures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect discovery to engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Route food-intent traffic into the Cooking Companion / Cookbook experience (web-to-app save, cook-along, shopping lists) to build daily active users, not just sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own one integrated, prioritized organic-discovery roadmap that keeps content, product, engineering, data, and AI measurement connected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar &amp;amp; lead through influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard for product thinking, experimentation rigor, and quality-first sequencing across the squad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment across Marketing, Brand, PR, and Commercial on a single repeated message and a shared definition of organic success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep SEO expertise (must-have): 6+ years in product management with hands-on ownership of technical and content SEO at scale indexation, structured data, internal linking, SSR, content infrastructure, and large content programs. You have personally moved non-branded organic traffic for a large, content-rich site and know how to scale content&amp;nbsp;without tanking quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GEO / AI search fluency (must-have): Demonstrable understanding of how LLMs retrieve, cite, and repeat brand narratives, and how to influence them, AI-citable content formats, third-party signal building, and measurement of AI visibility (e.g., Profound or equivalent). You can articulate where GEO overlaps with SEO and where it diverges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content + platform product sense: Experience shipping content automation, CMS/platform migrations, or publishing infrastructure, working with Data/ML for tagging, deduplication, and quality guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insight-driven, quantitative rigor: Comfortable in search analytics, GSC, Ahrefs/STAT-type tooling and funnel data; you work backwards from user intent and defend decisions with evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency &amp;amp; ownership: You diagnose, decide, and drive in ambiguous, fast-moving spaces and you&#39;re energized by standing up a discipline rather than maintaining one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global cross-functional leadership: You influence and align stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Marketing, Brand, PR, and Commercial without direct authority and communicate at publication quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff-level behavior: You set direction across teams, resolve ambiguity without escalation, and operate as a single-threaded leader for a strategic surface.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic Commerce / LLM distribution experience (nice-to-have): Hands-on experience building on MCP, the Apps SDK, Stripe&#39;s ACP, or Google&#39;s UCP or shipping commerce/discovery experiences inside ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini. This is the direction we are steering the team, and prior exposure is a strong differentiator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in subscription, DTC, or consumer businesses where LTV, churn, and contribution margin are the governing metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in SQL and/or Python sufficient to interrogate data pipelines and collaborate as a peer with data science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in food, recipe, or publisher-scale content ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mandate to build a durable, category-defining organic growth engine at one of the world&#39;s most data-rich consumer companies with direct visibility to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A rare chance to lead a discipline through an inflection point, evolving SEO into GEO and helping define HelloFresh&#39;s Agentic Commerce future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Box Discount-Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness-Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RRSP Matching-Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO-Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family Benefits-A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development-We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun-From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives-&amp;nbsp;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$164,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$174,850 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work with HelloFresh&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;GenAI Enablement Squad&lt;/strong&gt;, a cross-functional team helping teams across the company unlock the practical value of AI. The mission is simple: identify high-impact problems, build AI-powered solutions that solve them, and scale what works. As a Staff Engineer, you&#39;ll work at the intersection of engineering, product, and business. One week you might be embedded with the HR or Finance teams understanding how they work; the next you&#39;ll be building an agentic workflow, integrating it into the internal tooling, or scaling a successful prototype into a production system used across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly hands-on role. You&#39;ll work on problems from discovery to production, working directly with engineers, product managers, and non-technical stakeholders. Rather than waiting for requirements, you&#39;ll help define them—identifying where AI can create real leverage and shipping solutions that deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While you&#39;ll support and advise other engineers and influence technical direction, your primary impact comes from building products people actually use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with teams across HelloFresh to understand their workflows, uncover opportunities, and identify where AI can meaningfully improve productivity or decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly prototype AI-powered solutions and validate them with real users before investing in production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate production-grade AI applications including agents, workflow automations, retrieval systems, developer tools, and business assistants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver projects end-to-end—from problem discovery and solution design through implementation, deployment, measurement, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable AI assistants distributed through the internal plugin marketplace, helping teams solve recurring problems without reinventing the wheel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn successful one-off solutions into reusable platform capabilities that accelerate future AI development across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with platform engineers to improve the internal AI infrastructure, ensuring solutions remain reliable, secure, observable, and cost-effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge across the engineering organisation and support teammates through design discussions, pairing, and technical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production AI applications using modern LLMs, including agents, RAG, workflow automation, structured generation, evaluation, and prompt engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals with experience building reliable, maintainable, observable production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product mindset—you care as much about user adoption and business impact as technical elegance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with customers or business stakeholders to understand ambiguous problems and translate them into software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort moving quickly from idea to prototype while knowing when to invest in scalability and production quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with managed AI platforms such as AWS Bedrock, OpenAI, Anthropic, or Google Vertex AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python or another modern backend language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to explain technical concepts to both engineers and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, pragmatism, and a willingness to experiment. You know there is rarely a perfect AI solution—only one that delivers meaningful value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal developer platforms or productivity tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating LLM quality, latency, and cost trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying AI systems at organisational scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MCP, tool calling, agent orchestration frameworks, or workflow engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience measuring AI adoption and defining product success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw WeWork Mennica Towers.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer in our Supply Chain Management organization, you will be responsible for defining, securing, and implementing technical solutions for business problems. You will play a critical role as our systems scale to handle a jump from 1.2 million to over 2.4 million produced boxes per week due to recent software product consolidation. You will look after speeding up development, decision-making, and problem-solving. You will work with our neighboring teams to ensure that our efforts aim to achieve a clearer architecture and boundaries between tech teams to support autonomy. You will communicate directly with our business stakeholders and multiple tech teams supporting local markets. You will report to the Director of Engineering in the Production tribe. This role does not include people management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assume technical leadership within a tribe and own the most challenging tech decisions, including architecture, design, development, deployment, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the teams in the architectural design and help to maintain architectural integrity in the scope of the tribe and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend a significant portion of your time orchestrating code generation—guiding AI coding agents, rigorously reviewing their implementations, and refining logic based on organization needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve software problems that have visible risks, roadblocks, and constraints. You will navigate an environment that is approximately &lt;strong&gt;70% greenfield development and 30% legacy systems&lt;/strong&gt;, managing dependencies, data quality, compliance, and architectural transformations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor more junior engineers by fostering a culture of continuous learning and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, 10+ years of engineering experience, including 2+ years in a staff/principal level capacity and technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong capability in working with different stakeholders and experience addressing physical world problems with software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-Stack &amp;amp; Agentic Engineering: Deep problem-solving skills and full-stack proficiency (e.g., C#, Python, Golang, and modern frontend technologies). You bring hands-on experience leveraging AI coding agents (Cursor, Copilot, Claude Code) in production, moving beyond basic prompting to master context engineering, workflow decomposition, and the implementation of strict guardrails for reliable agent outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data engineering fundamentals is highly desirable, including expertise in data modeling, governance, quality assurance, and proficiency in data processing and storage systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in designing and implementing modular systems, including proficiency in synchronous/asynchronous communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player attitude and a passion for helping others grow through peer-to-peer mentoring, knowledge-sharing sessions, and advocating for best engineering practices, such as CI/CD, TDD, BDD, DDD, and Design Patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An agile mindset with the ability to advocate for cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interacting with front-end developers, designers, product managers and our teams around the world is very much part of our day-to-day, so communication skills are vital. We are looking for strong problem-solvers who can apply their engineering skills to a wide range of platforms and environments, while also acting as an ambassador to coach team members and stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with a discounted Urban Sports Club membership and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? &lt;/strong&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp;We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;

