&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced sourcing manager to join our Produce Team as a Procurement Strategy Manager. In this role, you will be responsible for managing a selection of categories through all parts of the supply chain. You have key responsibilities over category management, vendor selection, price negotiations and weekly budgetary planning for your set of categories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You will …&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of assigned produce categories to develop and optimize our national supply network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a wide range of suppliers on initiatives spanning category management to performance compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cost savings initiatives through our strategic sourcing process to ensure that we hit our targeted budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboard new vendors and new SKUs to drive cost savings and customer satisfaction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively manage quality specifications and potential issues that might impact ingredient standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with procurement operations teams to set the weekly execution plan and develop best practices for tracking contract compliance by our vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You are…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone with a clear understanding of procurement sourcing best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert negotiator who has handled multi-million dollar contract negotiations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creative problem solver with a process improvement mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven decision maker who is passionate about bringing that mentality to their team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented – You possess strong organizational skills and consistently demonstrate a methodical approach to all your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A project manager - You have exceptional project and people management skill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter – You are highly motivated and passionate; you’re eager to take on new projects without knowing exactly what you will uncover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player- You have experience working effectively in teams and prioritize collective goals over personal accolades&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile – You thrive in fast-paced and dynamic environments and are willing to get deep into the weeds where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong communicator who can easily communicate complex solutions cross functionally and to upper management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience as a procurement/sourcing lead, with relevant experience in the Food or CPG Industry&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in supply chain, business, engineering, other relevant area of study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to travel (up to 25%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work weekends when required (2-3 times per quarter)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Microsoft Office and Google Suite applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation, and company equity plan based on role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to 6 different Employee Resource Groups (ERGs) including those for minorities, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is growing exponentially year over year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
