&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Full Time, On-Site&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;St. Margaret’s, Co.Dublin, K67 P7E5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Thursday to Monday, working hours 8:00am - 4:00pm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Supply Chain Coordinator, you&#39;ll ensure that production receives the right products, on time, in full and with the correct quality. You&#39;ll handle ad-hoc issues and communicate them clearly with stakeholders. You&#39;ll collaborate continuously to optimize processes and take a long-term approach to challenges. Your focus will be on minimizing waste, resolving issues, and ensuring customers get exactly what they ordered — leaving them happier than ever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring inventory levels and production demands from a strategic standpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolving ad-hoc OTIFIQ deviations and serving as the primary point of contact for supplier communication throughout the week. A quick thinker, you adapt easily and are always ready with effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with cross-functional teams - procurement, production, warehouse, product, and FSQA - to ensure alignment on agreements, updates, and exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A multitasking expert, skilled at switching between communication platforms (email, phone, Slack etc.), with a keen ability to prioritize and perform well under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focused on minimizing waste by closely monitoring delivery details (such as BBD, oversupply, etc.) throughout the week, identifying root causes, and implementing future-proof adjustments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing errors to minimize customer impact, while ensuring thorough follow-up on communication and compensation when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting on supplier performance by gathering and analyzing feedback related to process compliance and overall supplier effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively engaging in team meetings, sharing valuable insights, and encouraging best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously working on optimizing processes and implementing sustainable, long-term solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in supply chain preferably in the food sector and/or from a production company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a fixer who likes a challenge, and want to proactively solve complicated puzzles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply Chain, Business/Management study or related fields is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong continuous improvement mindset - you simply can’t help it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative and analytical experience, including expertise with WMS and/or ERP systems, Excel, Tableau etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and a problem-solving expert who uses data to drive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, ambitious, and assertive: you take ownership of your work and think beyond the scope of a given assignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial with a proven track record of ‘getting things done’&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to work in a fast-paced environment with constant change and limited direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable solving problems and making quick decisions on the go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What we offer:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;70% off HelloFresh + free shipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Pension (matched 1:1 contributions up to 5%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Gym membership or Wellness benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Membership to global leading mindfulness App - Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from home allowance of up to €300&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For every year you are part of the team, you will earn one extra day off to celebrate your anniversary (up to 3 additional days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in Ireland, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Supply Planner to strengthen our Supply Chain Operations team. Every week, the team purchases all the ingredients for our HelloFresh boxes and manages supplier performance and quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Supply Chain Planner, you will independently manage our ordering process: delivery scheduling, shortage management, supplier performance improvement, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reducing food waste, OTIFIQ (On Time, In Full, In Quality), and error rates are your key daily performance indicators!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage purchase orders for our European supplier portfolio (Conventional Cluster), ensuring all ingredients are delivered on time and in the right quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main point of contact with suppliers and production for all operational matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop long-term relationships with suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement processes to optimize our supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in Supply Chain or relevant fields (Bac +5)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;1–2 years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Quick learner, adaptable, and solution-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Highly organized, detail-oriented, and rigorous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Proactive, with the ability to react quickly to unexpected challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Fluent in English &amp;amp; Dutch both spoken and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;&lt;em&gt;Benefits at Work&lt;/em&gt;&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop, a €250 home office setup budget, and contribute to the Bedrijfspensioenfonds Levensmiddelen pension scheme (2026 rate 27.6%; employer pays 19.64%, employee pays 7.96%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland, free bootcamp classes (Amsterdam), and free subscriptions to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a 7,5% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis in 2025.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work flexibly with our hybrid setup (50% office, 50% remote), plus a €2.45 daily remote work allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 24 days of annual leave (pro-rated), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, plus €0.23 per km for car and bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible employees can work from another country for up to 8 weeks per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with our &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; mindset:&amp;nbsp; access internal/external opportunities, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated annual budget to help you keep learning, developing new skills, and growing your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€3.00/day), weekly vrij-mi-bo (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high performing, driven individual to join our supply chain operations team. You will have category/sub-category ownership of our inbound operations and report into the Supply Chain Manager. This is the perfect role for someone to advance their career in supply chain operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and improve our inbound supply chain operations to ensure our ingredients arrive in full and on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise inbound processes and identify cross-functional efficiencies, proactively minimising the impact to our end to end operation and more importantly our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate and transform the function through project delivery, setting out clear course of actions to achieve defined outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently analyse internal data to generate ideas, support alternative solutions and provide clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimise costs through effective planning and waste management, recognise and propose new practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise the weekly ordering and forecasting processes, mitigating risks and thinking outside the box to formulate creative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own relationships with external suppliers, working closely with procurement and technical teams to manage costs and onboard suppliers. Report on and manage supplier performance effectively to elevate the operational standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and monitor KPIs, balancing day-to-day operations with long term strategic objectives. Skillfully prioritise tasks, delegating where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively with internal teams including Inventory Management, Warehouse, Transport, Planning, Labour Management, Finance, Marketing ensuring timely and accurate information is shared.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop significant expertise, skills and knowledge to be the voice and influence for supply chain operations across the wider business. Coach and guide team members to deliver optimal outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrable experience in Supply Chain Operations, ideally in a similar industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are incredibly resilient and operate well under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think on your feet and find quick and efficient solutions to resolve problems with minimal impact to internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a self-starter with initiative and a proactive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are not afraid to challenge the status-quo with new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a confident decision-maker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have great communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You find the perfect balance between bigger picture thinking and digging for the detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You embrace change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a role model that excites and motivates other team members with your passion for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are hungry to learn new things every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in excel and data manipulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible to work weekends (approx once every 6 weeks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Dog friendly office!&lt;br&gt;● Eye care scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hours: &lt;/strong&gt;Monday - Friday, Flexible to work weekends (approx once every 6 weeks)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Supply Planning &amp;amp; Optimisation Manager, you will play a critical role in ensuring Youfoodz consistently meets customer demand through highly accurate planning, scheduling, inventory management, and capacity modelling. This leadership position is central to our mission, bridging the gap between commercial demand and factory execution to ensure our fulfillment teams have exactly what they need to deliver on time, every time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Karawatha and reporting to the Chief Operating Officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end demand planning and production scheduling process for all B2B and B2C channels, partnering closely with Retail Sales and B2C commercial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Delivered In Full (DIF) metrics, guaranteeing that Pick &amp;amp; Pack, Line Haul, and DCs receive the exact volumes required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise inventory holding levels for finished goods and WIP food while minimising waste and obsolescence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead short, medium, and long-term capacity planning in collaboration with Manufacturing and Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Manufacturing Leads to drive Continuous Improvement (CI) and optimise Overall Equipment Effectiveness (OEE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary Operations representative and SME for major retail customers, managing retailer shelf-life expectations and DIFOT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the transition from S&amp;amp;OP to a mature, data-driven IBP model, facilitating cross-functional alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and evolve a team of 4 direct reports, driving transformation through automation and analytical problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in demand planning, production scheduling, or S&amp;amp;OP/IBP roles within an FMCG/food manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tertiary qualification in Supply Chain, Operations, Business, or Engineering; APICS certification is highly regarded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in planning systems and data/AI tools, with the ability to lead system development and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven capacity planning experience including OEE, labour modelling, and production sequencing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical leader who proactively solves complex supply chain challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic thinker capable of driving operational transformation and S&amp;amp;OP/IBP maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative partner who can bridge commercial demand and factory execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An advocate for continuous improvement and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A skilled negotiator and SME capable of managing critical retail partner relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite gym at the facility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full time role. Must have the right to work full-time in Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Karawatha&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#youfoodz&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
