&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in Inoza tower, BGC that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will take on a key responsibility for driving recruitment strategy, coaching a high-performing team, and ensuring seamless execution of talent acquisition processes across Global Business Services. This role is focused on proactive problem-solving, process compliance, and performance development, while maintaining strong stakeholder relationships and minimizing escalations. The Team Leader also plays a hands-on role in interviews and candidate assessments when required to meet business demands or coach team members in best practices, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear goals and performance standards for the talent acquisition team, aligned with business objectives and hiring targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic TA planning, including pipeline development, and continuous improvement of sourcing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the first point of contact for escalations and ensure issues are resolved promptly with minimal impact on timelines and stakeholder satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an active presence in daily operations while focusing on strategic outcomes and long-term talent acquisition goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Development &amp;amp; Coaching:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor team members in sourcing, interviewing, stakeholder engagement, and other TA-related topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular performance reviews, provide real-time feedback, and establish individual development plans to support career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate ongoing training to ensure team alignment on recruitment standards, system usage, and process compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee accurate and timely tracking of requisitions, candidate progress, hiring status, and reporting through the applicant tracking system (ATS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the coordination and quality control of job advertisements, interview logistics, and offer issuance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with HR Operations and other departments to ensure complete, compliant onboarding and pre-employment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to recruitment policies, regulatory requirements, and data privacy standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships with hiring managers, senior leaders, and other stakeholders to align recruitment outcomes with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or participate in handshake meetings to gather hiring requirements and set realistic hiring expectations and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver consistent updates on hiring performance and recommend solutions or adjustments as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Support &amp;amp; Ad Hoc Interviews:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step in to conduct interviews or candidate assessments when needed, especially for critical roles, high-volume periods, or team coaching purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on support during peak recruitment cycles, ensuring continuity and service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, review, and deliver regular reports and dashboards on recruitment metrics such as time-to-fill, candidate pipeline status, source effectiveness, and offer-to-acceptance ratios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and data-driven recommendations to leadership and stakeholders to improve decision-making and enhance recruitment strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data integrity and compliance in all reporting activities through the consistent use of the applicant tracking system and relevant tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead recruitment-related projects and initiatives, such as process automation, DEI efforts, and employer branding campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze recruitment data to identify trends and optimize team performance, candidate experience, and time-to-fill metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the use of new technologies, tools, and platforms that enhance the effectiveness of talent acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree in Human Resources, Psychology, Business Administration, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 6 years of progressive experience in talent acquisition, with a minimum of 3 years in a team leadership or senior specialist role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing full-cycle recruitment in a shared services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coaching, delegation, and leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, stakeholder management, and conflict-resolution abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and reporting skills, with proficiency in ATS platforms and Google Workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage multiple priorities in a dynamic and fast-paced setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal Mobility, Diversity, Employer Branding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volume hiring (nice to have)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#helloconnect&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#hcgreenhouse&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As FSQA Lead (Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Assurance), you will assume overall responsibility for food safety and quality assurance at the Factor_ production site in Verden. You will drive the operational development of quality and food safety standards while ensuring compliance with the highest internal and external requirements. You will act as the central interface between Production, Intralogistics, and Engineering, fostering close cross-functional collaboration. You will also manage a team, further develop structures and processes, and actively promote a proactive, prevention-oriented quality culture across the site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; the FSQA team at the Verden site, including QA/QC (Quality Assurance/ Quality Control) and sanitation operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt; the further development and implementation of all food safety and quality assurance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage&lt;/strong&gt; daily FSQA operations in a fast-paced manufacturing environment while fostering continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitor&lt;/strong&gt;, analyze, and report FSQA performance using KPIs, trend analysis, and site quality metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluate&lt;/strong&gt; quality deviations, initiate root cause analyses, and implement effective Corrective and Preventive Actions (CAPAs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate&lt;/strong&gt; the escalation and resolution of food safety and quality incidents as well as recalls in collaboration with relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; closely with Production, Intralogistics, Supply Chain, and Engineering teams to further develop processes in a data-driven and risk-oriented manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in food technology, food chemistry, nutrition science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of professional experience in food safety and quality assurance within the food or feed manufacturing industry, combined with leadership experience in a dynamic production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of relevant food safety standards and certifications (e.g., HACCP, GFSI) as well as experience in preparing for and conducting external audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of complex production processes with the ability to implement effective cross-functional improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven, analytical, and solution-oriented working style with a structured, independent approach and strong prioritization skills as well as proficiency in Google Workspace (G-Suite)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and confident stakeholder management, combined with a hands-on mentality and ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and good command of German (minimum B1/B2 level).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Internal training opportunities plus a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food &amp;amp; Lifestyle: &lt;/strong&gt;Discounts on Factor_-boxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary and 30 days of vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-being: &lt;/strong&gt;Access to well-being initiatives, with discounted fitness offers currently being rolled out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re working on introducing additional perks, including mobility support and a company pension scheme, to give our team even more flexibility and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp;We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#basecampquality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Teamleitung FSQA (Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Assurance) übernimmst Du die Gesamtverantwortung für die Lebensmittelsicherheit und Qualitätssicherung an unserem Factor_ Produktionsstandort in Verden. Du treibst die operative Weiterentwicklung der Qualitäts- und Lebensmittelsicherheitsstandards voran und stellst die Einhaltung der damit verbundenen internen sowie externen Anforderungen sicher. Du fungierst zudem als zentrale Schnittstelle zwischen den Produktions, Intralogistik und Engineering Teams und förderst eine enge, bereichsübergreifende Zusammenarbeit. Darüber hinaus leitest Du ein 3-köpfiges Team, entwickelst Strukturen sowie Prozesse weiter und treibst die Etablierung einer proaktiven, präventionsorientierten Qualitätskultur am Standort voran.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17h8jzm&quot; data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;172&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;75&quot; data-end=&quot;86&quot;&gt;Leitung&lt;/strong&gt; des FSQA-Teams, einschließlich QA/QC- (Quality Assurance/Quality Control) und Sanitärversorgung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;126vk3z&quot; data-start=&quot;174&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklung&lt;/strong&gt;, Implementierung und Sicherstellung aller Prozesse im Bereich Lebensmittelsicherheit und Qualitätssicherung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q2qtdd&quot; data-start=&quot;327&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;329&quot; data-end=&quot;342&quot;&gt;Steuerung&lt;/strong&gt; der täglichen FSQA-Abläufe und Förderung kontinuierlicher Verbesserungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14vsiwz&quot; data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;612&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;469&quot; data-end=&quot;484&quot;&gt;Überwachung&lt;/strong&gt;, Analyse und Berichterstattung der FSQA-Performance anhand von KPIs, Trendanalysen und standortbezogenen Qualitätskennzahlen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;35ov58&quot; data-start=&quot;613&quot; data-end=&quot;763&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;615&quot; data-end=&quot;628&quot;&gt;Bewertung&lt;/strong&gt; von Qualitätsabweichungen, Einleitung von Ursachenanalysen sowie Implementierung wirksamer Korrektur- und Vorbeugemaßnahmen (CAPAs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c2w2ds&quot; data-start=&quot;764&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;766&quot; data-end=&quot;782&quot;&gt;Koordination&lt;/strong&gt; von Eskalationen und Bearbeitung von Vorfällen im Bereich der Lebensmittelsicherheit und Qualität sowie von Rückrufen in Abstimmung mit relevanten Stakeholdern&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19enq1e&quot; data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;1104&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;969&quot;&gt;Enge Zusammenarbeit&lt;/strong&gt; mit Produktions, Intralogistik, Supply Chain und Engineering Teams zur datenbasierten und risikoorientierten Weiterentwicklung von Prozessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;173&quot;&gt;Abgeschlossenes Studium in Lebensmitteltechnologie, Lebensmittelchemie, Ernährungswissenschaften oder einem verwandten Fachgebiet&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rq94gx&quot; data-start=&quot;175&quot; data-end=&quot;392&quot;&gt;Mindestens 5 Jahre Berufserfahrung im Bereich Lebensmittelsicherheit und Qualitätssicherung in der Lebensmittelindustrie, kombiniert mit Führungserfahrung in einem dynamischen Produktionsumfeld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6h813q&quot; data-start=&quot;393&quot; data-end=&quot;572&quot;&gt;Fundierte Kenntnisse relevanter Lebensmittelsicherheitsstandards und Zertifizierungen (z. B. HACCP, GFSI) sowie Erfahrung in der Vorbereitung und Durchführung externer Audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;craz1e&quot; data-start=&quot;573&quot; data-end=&quot;711&quot;&gt;Ausgeprägtes Verständnis komplexer Produktionsprozesse und die Fähigkeit, effektive bereichsübergreifende Optimierungen umzusetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;698m0c&quot; data-start=&quot;712&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;Datengetriebene, analytische und lösungsorientierte Arbeitsweise mit strukturierter, selbstständiger Vorgehensweise, sicherem Gespür für Prioritäten und einem routinierten Umgang mit Google Workspace (G-Suite)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i89xyj&quot; data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;Ausgeprägte Kommunikationsstärke und souveränes Stakeholder Management, Hands-on-Mentalität und Freude an der Arbeit in einem schnelllebigen Umfeld&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e98m0x&quot; data-start=&quot;1115&quot; data-end=&quot;1201&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Fließende Englisch- und gute Deutschkenntnisse (mindestens B1/B2 Niveau)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Vor allem suchen wir Menschen, die HelloFresh besser machen. Wir lieben vielfältige Erfahrungen und glauben, dass es viele Wege gibt, Fähigkeiten zu entwickeln.&amp;nbsp;Wenn Du also nicht alle Kriterien erfüllst, aber glaubst, in dieser Rolle überzeugen zu können, möchten wir gerne mehr über Dich erfahren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wachstum &amp;amp; Entwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Interne Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten sowie ein jährliches Budget zur Förderung deiner persönlichen und beruflichen Entwicklung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_Vorteile:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Exklusive Rabate auf unsere leckeren Factor_-Mahlzeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergütung &amp;amp; Freizeit: &lt;/strong&gt;Attraktives Vergütungspaket sowie 30 Urlaubstage pro Jahr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gesundheit &amp;amp; Wohlbefinden: &lt;/strong&gt;Zugang zu verschiedenen Gesundheits- und Wellbeing-Angeboten. Zusätzliche Fitness-Benefits sind bereits in Planung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zukunft &amp;amp; Flexibilität: &lt;/strong&gt;Ein sich kontinuierlich weiterentwickelndes Benefit-Programm, einschließlich Mobilitätsangeboten und betrieblicher Altersvorsorge für mehr Flexibilität und langfristige Sicherheit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bist du die fehlende Zutat?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn diese Gelegenheit für Dich lecker klingt, freuen wir uns darauf, von Dir zu hören.Wir bemühen uns, Dein Profil zu prüfen und Dir innerhalb von 5 Werktagen zu antworten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
