&lt;h2&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;436&quot;&gt;Als Teamleitung Logistik (all genders) übernimmst Du die Verantwortung für zwei Teams innerhalb der Intralogistik und sorgst für einen reibungslosen, sicheren und effizienten Logistikbetrieb. Mit Deiner Führungsstärke, einer ausgeprägten Hands-on-Mentalität und einem klaren Blick für Prozesse entwickelst Du Teams weiter, steuerst operative Abläufe und treibst die kontinuierliche Optimierung unserer Logistikprozesse aktiv voran.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fachliche und disziplinarische Führung von zwei Teams in der Intralogistik&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Förderung einer leistungsorientierten, motivierenden und wertschätzenden Teamkultur durch gezieltes Coaching, fachliche Begleitung und die individuelle Weiterentwicklung der Mitarbeitenden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verantwortung für die Einhaltung von Sicherheits-, Qualitäts- und Produktivitätsstandards zur Gewährleistung eines reibungslosen Tagesgeschäfts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Planung und Koordination des Personal- und Ressourceneinsatzes für effiziente Abläufe und optimale Ergebnisse&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1umh8r5&quot; data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;231&quot;&gt;Steuerung und Bewertung der Performance inklusive dem Monitoring relevanter KPIs und der Erstellung aussagekräftiger Reportings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a8hfl3&quot; data-start=&quot;232&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot;&gt;Aktive Mitwirkung an der kontinuierlichen Optimierung von Prozessen durch das Einbringen neuer Ideen und die Umsetzung nachhaltiger Verbesserungsmaßnahmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6bd5f0&quot; data-start=&quot;390&quot; data-end=&quot;549&quot;&gt;Enge Zusammenarbeit mit funktionsübergreifenden Teams mit Fokus auf die Sicherstellung einer reibungslosen Supply Chain und effizienten, reaktionsschnellen Logistik&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfolgreich abgeschlossenes Studium im Bereich Logistik, Betriebswirtschaft, Wirtschaftsingenieurwesen oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mehrjährige Führungserfahrung in der Lebensmittelproduktion, Lagerlogistik oder Distribution sowie ein fundiertes Verständnis logistischer und operativer Prozesse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägtes Verantwortungsbewusstsein für Arbeitssicherheit, Qualitätsstandards, Prozessstabilität und die Performance der verantworteten Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherer Umgang mit MS Office bzw. Google Workspace sowie Erfahrung in der Analyse und Interpretation von Kennzahlen (z. B. Excel, Google Sheets, Grafana oder Tableau) zur datenbasierten Steuerung von Prozessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qz0z3t&quot; data-start=&quot;894&quot; data-end=&quot;1070&quot;&gt;Analytische, strukturierte und lösungsorientierte Arbeitsweise sowie die Fähigkeit, in einem dynamischen Umfeld Prioritäten zu setzen und fundierte Entscheidungen zu treffen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qz0z3t&quot; data-start=&quot;894&quot; data-end=&quot;1070&quot;&gt;Ausgeprägte Hands-on-Mentalität mit dem Anspruch, operative Prozesse aktiv mitzugestalten, Teams zu befähigen und Veränderungen erfolgreich umzusetzen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse (jeweils mind. auf C1-Niveau)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wachstum &amp;amp; Entwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Interne Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten sowie ein jährliches Budget zur Förderung Deiner persönlichen und beruflichen Entwicklung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_Vorteile:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Exklusive Rabate auf unsere leckeren Factor_-Mahlzeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergütung &amp;amp; Freizeit: &lt;/strong&gt;Attraktives Vergütungspaket sowie 30 Urlaubstage pro Jahr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gesundheit &amp;amp; Wohlbefinden: &lt;/strong&gt;Zugang zu verschiedenen Gesundheits- und Wellbeing-Angeboten. Zusätzliche Fitness-Benefits sind bereits in Planung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zukunft &amp;amp; Flexibilität: &lt;/strong&gt;Ein sich kontinuierlich weiterentwickelndes Benefit-Programm, einschließlich Mobilitätsangeboten und betrieblicher Altersvorsorge für mehr Flexibilität und langfristige Sicherheit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bist du die fehlende Zutat?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Wenn diese Gelegenheit für Dich lecker klingt, freuen wir uns darauf, von Dir zu hören. Wir bemühen uns, Dein Profil zu prüfen und Dir innerhalb von 5 Werktagen zu antworten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_986add36c57b5fd6&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As HelloFresh transitions to an AI-native operating model with tools like Claude Cowork, Claude Code, and Gemini deployed across the business, you will serve as the principal B2B lead driving the strategy and execution to transform tool access into operational capability. Sitting within Tech (under IT Services) and steering efforts alongside the Tribe Director, you will design and deliver a company-wide GenAI upskilling framework from scratch to empower 6,000 users across 16 markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Without this centralized expertise, business units risk working in silos or letting tool adoption drift. You will solve this challenge by establishing clear capability baselines, driving safe and effective usage, and demonstrating a tangible return on our GenAI investments. You will build and direct a dedicated core team of five consultants/specialists while acting as the strategic bridge between Tech leadership, cross-functional business stakeholders, and executive leadership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Deliver the Enterprise Program:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, own, and roll out a comprehensive three-level enablement framework—encompassing a mandatory foundation tier (gating tool access), job-specific proficiency training, and an active enterprise Champions network.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Activate &amp;amp; Lead the GenAI Champions Network:&lt;/strong&gt; Onboard and steer a high-impact network of 40–60 departmental Champions; establish governance models, training curricula, and quarterly forums to drive localized adoption and cross-functional alignment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner with Executive Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Interface directly with VP and Tribe leadership to translate adoption and usage depth metrics into actionable business outcomes, securing necessary resource commitments and organizational buy-in.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Direct a High-Performing Delivery Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and lead a multidisciplinary team of ~5 specialists across learning design, change management, program delivery, and analytics to execute program milestones.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Establish Measurement &amp;amp; Governance Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Define core delivery KPIs (WAU, 28-day active users, depth of usage, shadow AI trends) and align program execution with HelloFresh’s broader GenAI Governance Framework.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;8+ years of enterprise change &amp;amp; transformation leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of executing large-scale technology adoption, L&amp;amp;D, or change management programs for thousands of users across international markets in complex corporate or e-commerce environments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hands-on GenAI mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Daily operational expertise with modern GenAI tools, agentic workflows, and LLMs, combined with a strong grasp of enterprise governance and practical model constraints.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Executive presence &amp;amp; stakeholder management:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication skills with demonstrated experience partnering at the VP level to align strategy, manage expectations, and drive enterprise-wide adoption.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team leadership &amp;amp; steering capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record of hiring, guiding, and managing multidisciplinary project teams across instructional design, change management, and analytics.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Builder mindset &amp;amp; agility:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to create structure in ambiguous environments, operating with an iterative approach (shipping high-quality deliverables at 80% and refining via data feedback).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Outcome-driven data fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise in setting success metrics and building executive-ready dashboards that quantify business impact and adoption metrics.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;attachment-container unknown&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Operative - Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Derby, UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rate of Pay:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; £13.98/hour&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To primarily maintain and be first responder for Frozen Fish Labelling and DMP/ILP related issues. This will be a semi-technical role and training will be provided to upskill the individual in the role so they have the knowledge, skills and behaviours to be the ‘first line fixers’ for the above assets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all replenishment tasks for the Frozen Fish labelling - Replenishments, refills and&amp;nbsp; waste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all stock levels for Frozen Fish labelling are sufficient and reorder as applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for daily preventative maintenance compliance tasks for Frozen Fish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First line fix for all related tasks for Frozen Fish, escalating further issues with the Engineering Team where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out basic daily and weekly ILP tasks on Kitting; print head cleans and alignment of labels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out basic daily and weekly DMP tasks on Kitting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out basic reactive tasks for kitting - Scanners and Keyboard replacements etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comply with Food Safety Regulations and HelloFresh quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be involved in ad hoc projects as and when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any other responsibilities/duties which would be reasonably expected as part of this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring that Food Safety and Health &amp;amp; Safety standards are met and sustainably maintained. You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring your own health, safety and welfare in the activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to adapt to changing priorities and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work shifts and &amp;nbsp;weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication skills, both verbal and written, to collaborate with various stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with a keen eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and time management abilities, with the ability to prioritise tasks and meet deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient computer skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;70% Discount on HelloFresh or GreenChef boxes (yes 💸)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
