&lt;p&gt;As Operation Manager, you will be an integral part of how HelloFresh revolutionizes the food industry and the&lt;br&gt;way people eat! In this role, you will deliver strategic operational leadership across all aspects of production and&lt;br&gt;will cultivate a culture that is second to none. You will be hands-on and immerse yourself in the trenches to&lt;br&gt;optimize productivity, promote growth, spark innovation, and incite change from within. We&#39;re searching for a&lt;br&gt;visionary leader who is excited to build something awesome and share it with the world!&lt;/p&gt;
