&lt;p&gt;We seek a Senior Manager, Planning Excellence to elevate planning capabilities through scalable data solutions, process optimization, and strategic insight generation. The Senior Manager, Planning Excellence is responsible for defining and leading the roadmap for planning analytics, tools, and reporting infrastructure across the Factor network. The ideal candidate brings a strong blend of analytical expertise, strategic thinking, and leadership capability, with a proven ability to translate complex business needs into scalable solutions and influence senior stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
