&lt;p&gt;The Director, Construction Management will oversee the Construction team which manages all ongoing construction and major renovation projects within the HelloFresh network. This includes capital improvements &amp;amp; all on-site construction and land development, including budget, scheduling, quality assurance, &amp;nbsp;job site safety &amp;amp; compliance, and relevant building codes for our current &amp;amp; future HelloFresh Fulfillment Centers. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the team responsible for design, planning, organization, and execution of capital construction projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the coordination of all construction project logistical tasks &amp;amp; timelines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall responsibility for the financial management of all construction projects that can be in excess of $50M in total project costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make frequent site visits to survey the progress of work on all construction and associated renovation projects to assure quality control &amp;amp; monitor performance to contract.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the formulation of construction budgets; develop RFPs, negotiate terms and conditions with professional entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish agreed upon project expectations and adherence to the approved budget and work effectively with end user(s), such as Fulfillment Operations, Engineering, Logistics, etc. - and other necessary outside professionals (architects, engineers, developers, estimators, equipment planners, etc.) to establish the scope and budget for a project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with local/state agencies regarding permits and inspects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with outside contractors regarding bidding, scheduling, billing, and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance to contract and recommend payment for appropriate services rendered. This includes review and submission of all letters of approval, invoices, change orders, support documentation, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage business and develop relationships with external contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage review process of all project design documents (drawings and specifications)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure maintenance of up-to-date building &amp;amp; plot plans for planning &amp;amp; control purposes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly and effectively communicates the status of all major &amp;amp; minor construction projects to Leadership and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You are…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate, imaginative, and able to articulate a clear vision when leading others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic: you recognize and resolve situations that are ambiguous or challenging and use logic to identify alternatives, evaluate, and present solutions while thinking about contingency plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrator of technical skills and proficiency through presentation and analytical tools necessary for creating visually and verbally engaging content/reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Versatile: you enjoy solving a broad range of issues and excel in growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in leading teams and encouraging collaborations at all levels and departments of an organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adventurous, optimistic, and bold in making decisions and taking calculated risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A friend to data and analytics. Can conduct and evaluate analyses, identify points of improvement, and develop clear solutions and strategies from the findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A seeker of knowledge to understand how things work, why they work the way they do, and question things to continuously learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated to providing the best possible experience for the HelloFresh customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You have…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree is required.&amp;nbsp; Degree in Construction Management, Architecture, Engineering or a related field a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years’ experience in construction with 5 years of experience in building e-commerce fulfillment/distribution centers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience in leading a Construction Management team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food industry experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant working knowledge of Federal, State and local laws and regulations related to facility buildouts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple projects of scope and scale simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven history negotiating contracts for facility expansion (contractors, sub-vendors, landlords, permit offices, site management, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Building, Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing Codes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in CAD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Word and Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret complex construction drawings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires heavy travel to all sites&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CO POSTINGS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our company is committed to fair hiring practices and complies with all applicable laws, including the Colorado Job Application Fairness Act (JAFA). In accordance with JAFA, we will not request your age, date of birth, or dates of attendance at or graduation from an educational institution on your initial application for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;When submitting supporting documents such as a resume, curriculum vitae (CV), or educational transcripts, you may voluntarily redact or omit any information that would identify your age. This includes:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of birth&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of attendance at educational institutions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of graduation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your decision to redact this information will not adversely affect the consideration of your application. We evaluate all candidates based on their skills, qualifications, and experience. Please be aware that should you receive a conditional offer of employment, we may be required to request this information for legally permissible purposes, such as verifying eligibility for employment or for benefits administration and background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Posted until 8/31/26&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Colorado Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$131,250&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$158,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Newark, NJ Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$170,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we want to revolutionize the way we eat by making it more convenient and exciting to cook meals from scratch. We have offices all over the world and we deliver delicious meals to millions of people. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the industry leader in meal-kit subscription services and we’re growing all the time. We have distinct meal-kit services that cater to everyone with the most menu variety in the market, which allows us to reach an incredibly wide population of people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The HelloFresh team is diverse, high-performing, and international, and our work environment is an inspiring space where you can thrive as a result.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Manager, Quality Systems Compliance, you will be responsible for the HelloFresh and Factor fulfillment center locations. You will take a hands-on approach and deliver strategic operational leadership across all aspects of supplier food safety and quality.&amp;nbsp; You will map out and deliver the quality system program at HelloFresh, effectively raising the bar on food safety and quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will ...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate the implementation and rigorous maintenance of Supplier Quality Management Systems, encompassing program and policy documents, supplier document control, supplier and ingredient onboarding, audit management, corrective and preventive actions (CAPA), certificate of analysis (COA) and technical specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and monitor supplier food safety and quality performance KPIs such as audit results, complaints, non-conformances, documentation, CAPA etc. and report trends to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence and drive continuous improvement initiatives across 8 distribution centers to standardize food safety and quality practices and identify opportunities for automation and digital quality systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Procurement, Operations and other departments to ensure supplier food safety and quality requirements are embedded throughout the business .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer and regulatory inspections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate a customer-centric culture dedicated to ensuring the delivery of premium-quality products and superior service standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented: recognizes and resolves situations that are ambiguous or challenging, focus effort on meeting or exceeding goals, and pave the way for efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bold: you are a true entrepreneurial spirit and not afraid to take calculated risks to disrupt the status quo; you&#39;re a visionary leader that listens to your team and values their ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic: you’re a critical thinker who uses logic to identify alternatives, evaluate, and present approaches to solve complex problems while thinking in terms of contingency plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused: you understand the importance of customer experience and are able to achieve excellence in delivering the planned customer outcomes with the highest level of customer care and customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted Partner &amp;amp; Adviser: you&#39;re able to cultivate collaborative partnerships with others inside or outside the organization who can provide information, assistance, and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree (Masters preferred) in Food Science, Supply Chain, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Quality, Supply Chain, Vendor Management or Food Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of specification management, document control, root cause and corrective action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-versed in quality systems, food safety regulations, HACCP, SQF, GMPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality or Ingredient Certification knowledge a plus (BRC, SQF, AIB, Organic etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced use of Google app (Gmail, drive, sheets, etc.), and Tableau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of TraceGains or similar quality management systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; 401k company match that vests immediately upon participation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave of 16 weeks &amp;amp; PTO policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$0 monthly premium and other flexible health plans&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;85% discount on your subscription to HelloFresh (as well as other product initiatives) &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is the policy of HelloFresh not to discriminate against any employee or applicant for employment because of race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, marital status, genetic information, disability or because he or she is a protected veteran.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Colorado Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$94,815&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$109,650 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Texas Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$82,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$102,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Newark, NJ Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$101,430&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$117,300 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Arizona Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$82,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$102,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Illinois Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$94,815&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$109,650 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh&#39;s Performance Innovation studio is scaling a cross-channel video engine built on a single core principle: one production, many platform-native cuts. Post-production is where that model wins or stalls.&amp;nbsp; This role is what makes it win. We&#39;re looking for a Video Editor who is AI-native by instinct, not just by familiarity: someone who reaches for GenAI tools (AI-assisted editing, voiceover, video generation) as naturally as a timeline. You will own end-to-end post-production for the paid social pipeline, drive the AI-integration layer across post, and operationalize the studio’s global footage library so markets can localize independently. This is a high-output, high-craft role at the center of how the team scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end post-production.&amp;nbsp; From ingest through multi-format delivery and versioning at the speed and volume the studio’s model demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalize the global footage library.&amp;nbsp; Cut, adapt, and localize central footage for each market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the AI-integration layer across post to push creative and efficiency boundaries.&amp;nbsp; Stay up to date with new Gen AI tools to share with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain GenAI policy compliance across EU and global markets, staying current on evolving regulations and ensuring all AI-generated assets meet platform and legal requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Edit short-form video from scratch for paid social channels (TikTok, Meta, YouTube, Snap, OTT) using sharp creative instincts, platform-native best practices, and data from Creative Strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build motion graphics, titles, lower thirds, and end cards in After Effects; collaborate with design teams to communicate graphic needs clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multi-format, multi-market video workflow across delivery stages, partnering with the Senior Video Editor, Creative Strategy, and Production teams as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work proactively to bring edits to near-final state, minimizing feedback rounds and meeting or beating stakeholder deadlines without sacrificing quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and adapt work from written and verbal feedback quickly and independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality-check all video content against brand guidelines and platform specs before delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-native editor who treats GenAI tools as core craft, not a novelty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-output editor who thrives on turning a single shoot into a volume of finished, platform-native assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply fluent in the performance content / paid social landscape. You know how to prioritize what works based on data, not just personal taste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert in Premiere Pro, After Effects, and Adobe Creative Suite; experience with apps like CapCut and other UGC content creator tools.&amp;nbsp; Eager to try new things as the UGC market and trends evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized, self-starting, and reliable.&amp;nbsp; You manage complex multi-market, multi-format workflows without dropping anything.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong collaborator who can work across Creative, Creative Strategy, Production, and Brand teams and communicate clearly at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm under pressure, professional, and positive when deadlines compress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to on-brand quality at every stage of the editing process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a Minimum, You Have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of video editing experience in digital, paid media, or social content with a portfolio that proves output at volume and platform-native quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated, hands-on experience using GenAI tools in a post-production workflow .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with GenAI content policies and compliance requirements, particularly for EU/global markets, or the demonstrated ability to get up to speed rapidly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience developing assets for Paid Social, particularly TikTok, Meta, YouTube, &amp;amp; Snap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in Premiere Pro, After Effects, and Adobe Creative Suite; working knowledge of CapCut and UGC-first editing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of color grading, pacing, and timing for performance-oriented content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multi-format, multi-market asset workflows, conversion tactics, ideally including localization or global content adaptation.&amp;nbsp; Knowledge of creative advertising principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within tight deadlines, handling multiple projects simultaneously, and turning around same-day edits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impeccable organization, attention to detail, and a strong eye for quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, verbal, and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on-site 4 days a week in NYC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Film, Media, or equivalent. Preferred but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll Get...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; 401k company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave of 16 weeks &amp;amp; PTO policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$0 monthly premium and other flexible health plans effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;85% discount on your subscription to HelloFresh (as well as other product initiatives)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks, cold brew on tap &amp;amp; monthly catered lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company sponsored outings &amp;amp; Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
