&lt;li&gt;A comprehensive understanding of the Work Health and Safety legislation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong teamwork and communication skills, with proven interpersonal abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management and prioritisation skills to handle competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
